tml_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commit/f00a49026639d672a2de6ad89681f3cac23ae097","node_id":"C_kwDOUAjB-doAKGYwMGE0OTAyNjYzOWQ2NzJhMmRlNmFkODk2ODFmM2NhYzIzYWUwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commit/f53358e500f513740c831804fc463353d8d6598f","sha":"f53358e500f513740c831804fc463353d8d6598f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/f53358e500f513740c831804fc463353d8d6598f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commit/e9fe38bee60d1e4e582e59d3f0c5fc08303c9483","sha":"e9fe38bee60d1e4e582e59d3f0c5fc08303c9483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/e9fe38bee60d1e4e582e59d3f0c5fc08303c9483"}],"sha":"f00a49026639d672a2de6ad89681f3cac23ae097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/f00a49026639d672a2de6ad89681f3cac23ae097"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/e9fe38bee60d1e4e582e59d3f0c5fc08303c9483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:48:13Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:48:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(events): TaskCompleted carries line_no (per-line confirm-pick, decision 18) (#170)\n\n* feat(events): TaskCompleted carries line_no (per-line confirm-pick, decision 18)\n\nApplyWorkReleased reads the optional WorkReleased.line_no (wes-work-planning\nadds it in a sibling PR; absent today) and stamps it on the Task as\nsource_line_no, for order-originated work only (never transfer work), never\nparsed from the \"<order>-line-<n>\" work unit id. Migration 0017 adds the\nnullable tasks.source_line_no column.\n\nTaskCompleted v1 data (integration and analytics) gains an optional line_no\nnext to order_ref, omitted when unknown. Stays v1 (additive).\n\nTests: domain, ApplyWorkReleased stamping (present/absent/transfer/non-positive),\nconsumer decoding of the optional field, publisher units and byte-exact goldens\nfor both topics, testcontainers Postgres round-trip and outbox wire test.\n\n* docs(events): line_no in AsyncAPI, ADR 0041 and the DDD pack\n\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: optional line_no (integer >= 1) on both TaskCompleted\n  schemas and examples, and on the consumed WorkReleased schema, example and\n  description. Validated with the asyncapi CLI (0 errors) and spectral\n  (.spectral.asyncapi.yaml, --fail-severity=warn: clean).\n- ADR 0041 (Accepted) + index: why line_no, order work only, never parsed from\n  the work unit id, ecosystem check.\n- events, domain-events, sequence-diagrams, entity-relationship (tasks gains\n  source_order_id 0016 / source_line_no 0017), aggregate-design-canvas,\n  context-relationships (WorkReleased ACL table; ref is no longer \"unused\"),\n  ubiquitous-language.\n- docs-api-drift reproduction: no diff (openapi.yaml is unchanged).","tree":{"sha":"12b0c378c5967d4545c441a3802762b241049a08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/12b0c378c5967d4545c441a3802762b241049a08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/e9fe38bee60d1e4e582e59d3f0c5fc08303c9483","verification":{"payload":"tree 12b0c378c5967d4545c441a3802762b241049a08\nparent bea2be2aa827943c6ae792b20f3cac9472ef148b\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791420493 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791420493 -0300\n\nfeat(events): TaskCompleted carries line_no (per-line confirm-pick, decision 18) (#170)\n\n* feat(events): TaskCompleted carries line_no (per-line confirm-pick, decision 18)\n\nApplyWorkReleased reads the optional WorkReleased.line_no (wes-work-planning\nadds it in a sibling PR; absent today) and stamps it on the Task as\nsource_line_no, for order-originated work only (never transfer work), never\nparsed from the \"<order>-line-<n>\" work unit id. Migration 0017 adds the\nnullable tasks.source_line_no column.\n\nTaskCompleted v1 data (integration and analytics) gains an optional line_no\nnext to order_ref, omitted when unknown. Stays v1 (additive).\n\nTests: domain, ApplyWorkReleased stamping (present/absent/transfer/non-positive),\nconsumer decoding of the optional field, publisher units and byte-exact goldens\nfor both topics, testcontainers Postgres round-trip and outbox wire test.\n\n* docs(events): line_no in AsyncAPI, ADR 0041 and the DDD pack\n\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: optional line_no (integer >= 1) on both TaskCompleted\n  schemas and examples, and on the consumed WorkReleased schema, example and\n  description. Validated with the asyncapi CLI (0 errors) and spectral\n  (.spectral.asyncapi.yaml, --fail-severity=warn: clean).\n- ADR 0041 (Accepted) + index: why line_no, order work only, never parsed from\n  the work unit id, ecosystem check.\n- events, domain-events, sequence-diagrams, entity-relationship (tasks gains\n  source_order_id 0016 / source_line_no 0017), aggregate-design-canvas,\n  context-relationships (WorkReleased ACL table; ref is no longer \"unused\"),\n  ubiquitous-language.\n- docs-api-drift reproduction: no diff (openapi.yaml is unchanged).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxuhNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuhIQADIeHz50b3Wjb4Ck7qDTRESp\ndz38muE/2rEI+07qZzSu7zzIbH/Y1TH6JJ2m1iGvtUrl7eSKHlPX1FE1EFJ/rvf6\nE8i2/N5rg9JELqDnbgiQ6QAYd/l9wPUn/mCBbyucooHKAMHOI/blysI7JYijkQhu\n8K2wKlAbNSdfR5S+U3Ypcpb5mmZgh/rR1r6f8Zm0vMFx8s3dWGZU5zP5zEMwXghU\nzMvOLFf2FtaCtqKca6OW0yCztvXifkLW+Y01ifYwSy/UxUMgWKuH++HK6WjcUmtC\n391yFMSaXLw4cu1BzHJwOaVzT7b0etA+HJNIETAB/q0/bliAlMsg5nrP1TdcI395\nkrOkpNTPTePfI148y2EnIDXOnceokyuf3QFLzG1sm/5bN+/Wq+geHH/Yisxw5JHU\ns5rzH34FwIuE4xQp7LqsHPwigxGIvjVNu4Vrk8lSTpVyJ9R7B8wh2UKYQDDBG/xp\nGI9Yo/scKxVhEg+NOgZ/JuIN8dWRvZH+RbigP0WG8nTtNIyIfKqbrMTWFg1j3I67\niTXW+aqiI82c07b0xHvUZe0LfoXV2mz+E2lBB/7UeC1+9subrPtneEbFK73Qrlaj\n3gzDGvbYRq0ownYoo0H6RQLGCD4PQER0GbVQkEebpFdgiVDQ+NXbC8AGG4gtBup4\nZgdT/JmMRN0s0e8ZEjFi\n=im6m\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow