ulfillment-execution/commits/bea2be2aa827943c6ae792b20f3cac9472ef148b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/7f286a6a20a7201ab024463100c676f537491f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:44:07Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:44:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(events): TaskCompleted carries order_ref (audit decision 17) (#168)\n\n* feat(events): TaskCompleted carries order_ref (audit decision 17)\n\nPublish an optional order_ref on TaskCompleted v1, integration and\nanalytics topics: the upstream order id, omitted when empty.\n\nThe Task did not hold the order id: ApplyWorkReleased stored\norderRef = WorkReleased.work_unit_id, which for order work is the\nper-line \"<order>-line-<n>\", and dropped WorkReleased.ref (the order id).\nKeep that ref on the Task as sourceOrderId (migration 0016, nullable\ntasks.source_order_id; not stamped for transfer work, whose ref is a\ndemand id) and publish it as order_ref. work_unit_id is unchanged.\n\nTests: domain, ApplyWorkReleased stamping, publisher unit tests, golden\nJSON for both topics (set and omitted), testcontainers Postgres\nround-trip and outbox wire test.\n\n* docs(events): order_ref in AsyncAPI, ADR 0040 and the DDD pack\n\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: optional order_ref on both TaskCompleted schemas\n  and examples; WorkReleased.ref now documented as the order id.\n  Validated with the docs-site AsyncAPI parser (0 errors).\n- ADR 0040 (Accepted): why order_ref, why the Task had to keep\n  WorkReleased.ref, per-order granularity, short picks not modelled.\n- domain-events, sequence-diagrams, aggregate-design-canvas,\n  api-reference/events updated. The ItemPicked hotspot is untouched.","tree":{"sha":"658b77aab494d6e69b8194d7863f0698c47e6525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/658b77aab494d6e69b8194d7863f0698c47e6525"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/7f286a6a20a7201ab024463100c676f537491f3f","verification":{"payload":"tree 658b77aab494d6e69b8194d7863f0698c47e6525\nparent e5c66fda63e5a14ff0a3c4335c5318e602487b3d\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791366247 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791366247 -0300\n\nfeat(events): TaskCompleted carries order_ref (audit decision 17) (#168)\n\n* feat(events): TaskCompleted carries order_ref (audit decision 17)\n\nPublish an optional order_ref on TaskCompleted v1, integration and\nanalytics topics: the upstream order id, omitted when empty.\n\nThe Task did not hold the order id: ApplyWorkReleased stored\norderRef = WorkReleased.work_unit_id, which for order work is the\nper-line \"<order>-line-<n>\", and dropped WorkReleased.ref (the order id).\nKeep that ref on the Task as sourceOrderId (migration 0016, nullable\ntasks.source_order_id; not stamped for transfer work, whose ref is a\ndemand id) and publish it as order_ref. work_unit_id is unchanged.\n\nTests: domain, ApplyWorkReleased stamping, publisher unit tests, golden\nJSON for both topics (set and omitted), testcontainers Postgres\nround-trip and outbox wire test.\n\n* docs(events): order_ref in AsyncAPI, ADR 0040 and the DDD pack\n\n- apis/asyncapi.yaml: optional order_ref on both TaskCompleted schemas\n  and examples; WorkReleased.ref now documented as the order id.\n  Validated with the docs-site AsyncAPI parser (0 errors).\n- ADR 0040 (Accepted): why order_ref, why the Task had to keep\n  WorkReleased.ref, per-order granularity, short picks not modelled.\n- domain-events, sequence-diagrams, aggregate-design-canvas,\n  api-reference/events updated. The ItemPicked hotspot is untouched.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxhRnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3xwQAAH/bVURRTF5EhVpWYRg3s/L\n/saxQu/d9bIEjmPTRD65lgTh/aZUqBLzGgUS7U5T7jqu1klX5rMq9M9JRa2Pu6K+\nBhwdKe7E3sxdxblJG0cYs5f49G1i4kn8JrUXG7foSCO78lPFKWYKMtLeYfDNgsFS\nZP45bNvzOozlekKq1JBPWg/yU5qFQDfzIVvRHi3KwqSBx490obCNjfYwhp20glcF\nHXMT3VifrCWpPoo88xEeixrS1gh0A9iqErd7De4kojTJaHIAg0XfYRYoP30emqQc\nOUlybW3WbjiR2/SseMb19dIh6rmNzvHq8JNBkizH2SWttZPCY1sT5PKuLnwZtTw8\n/460IifQiuBcTGKMlAeQVIiygEAUgyIfkK+TF6a45GigV/UDbFktcWk8pWoVVeN5\nehCAl8ZqSO1rIbBbI1Fc0zVh1ryOsTtlo78G/G3aA+AGSvxHs0IA+lnwNnGRbEUM\n8Z9sZ6v0Xjhf0NHaF5axRrGYlyU5xG0yExxFdJk1e6XbfFT2SRgo7ehNZ/E/AWNG\n/GLy//dfbrc4jMSjlzv9867aposvS6NmhDvkU9rJH0p0uZauMW3vZaDJf/QyiSqV\nA1Er9FsLPUr6r6L5BT83iHdXpV+SmEUrNbXMUETQ9xMIozxlSarUk24/jBEKi8b3\ncnSOXO1EfS4Hgxk3Qrvy\n=Ej5x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T09:44:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users