{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/1e83ccf18e797eda85af75f6ea65a6bbc970e345/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:49:41Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:49:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): GET /packages/{id} and GET /packages?orderRef= package read model (#130)\n\nPOST /packages/{id}/slam returns 204 for both outcomes (LABELED and\nDIVERTED), and no endpoint could read a Package, so a caller could not\ntell whether a carton goes to the truck or to problem-solve.\n\n- GetPackage / GetPackagesByOrderRef read use cases (GetTasksByOrderRef pattern)\n- PackageRepo.FindByOrderRef in memory + postgres adapters\n- migration 0013: idx_packages_order_ref\n- GET /packages/{id}: 200 PackageResponse, 404 package-not-found\n- GET /packages?orderRef=: 200 array, 400 invalid-request on missing/blank\n- openapi.yaml + regenerated Docusaurus REST reference\n- ADR-0032; rules tables + README updated\n- use-case, httptest, BDD and testcontainers integration tests\n\nSLAM''s 204 contract is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"3be33b80af65e496d434eb8d25176630b91b45c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/3be33b80af65e496d434eb8d25176630b91b45c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/1e83ccf18e797eda85af75f6ea65a6bbc970e345","verification":{"payload":"tree 3be33b80af65e496d434eb8d25176630b91b45c6\nparent 489fe0734ba9f3756f7a22996fffaa0c1ed872aa\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790894981 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790894981 -0300\n\nfeat(api): GET /packages/{id} and GET /packages?orderRef= package read model (#130)\n\nPOST /packages/{id}/slam returns 204 for both outcomes (LABELED and\nDIVERTED), and no endpoint could read a Package, so a caller could not\ntell whether a carton goes to the truck or to problem-solve.\n\n- GetPackage / GetPackagesByOrderRef read use cases (GetTasksByOrderRef pattern)\n- PackageRepo.FindByOrderRef in memory + postgres adapters\n- migration 0013: idx_packages_order_ref\n- GET /packages/{id}: 200 PackageResponse, 404 package-not-found\n- GET /packages?orderRef=: 200 array, 400 invalid-request on missing/blank\n- openapi.yaml + regenerated Docusaurus REST reference\n- ADR-0032; rules tables + README updated\n- use-case, httptest, BDD and testcontainers integration tests\n\nSLAM''s 204 contract is unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvuOFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnXUQAHFiMNdhRpFfURcrmjXKfaYG\nY4k88MtilAEYEIA0hczuV/wxe0pVQ3Z7UQ3yKy9jk5V/dFNSsy3vJJq2SrcvNVov\njKLOjRaf+5cWYrw54mKcLHtdyOZV8uK1M9ZSaeaqIFeHsY3H44hN4/d1hNq5e56w\nbodWFEH815t3R6wooe7ynejt6WQPSWjRM1y6QfTf5HVRzClLENxK1lFERq0Q65Li\ns1AHgSH2iThADH2PYRBtMjzPY+/3U0lfGwNlgu2BDU648kViJ+7AZRnt31ZEnlap\nyk9rbYmvamOyzegHYq2ES016l2Y9qlR9laq55NcAvbHOo0OxUGTWjRarnRp6uP8r\nRKuA/6bWekxZJCqvO8S/S33idKg4