ganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/fae64ef9e7fedd19be73783a6d8561a5dae0b4ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:32:42Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:32:42Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"feat(events)!: CloudEvents 1.0 mandatory envelope, remove flat/dual modes\n\nEvery Kafka message fulfillment-execution produces or consumes (integration\nand analytics topics) is now a CloudEvents 1.0 event in structured content\nmode, built/validated with github.com/cloudevents/sdk-go/v2/event via the\nnew internal/adapters/kafka/cloudevents helper (ADR-0032).\n\n- Publishers (integration + analytics, direct and outbox Encode path) emit\n  only CloudEvents with the content-type header; id is a UUID v4 minted once\n  in Encode and persisted by the outbox; subject = aggregate id = Kafka key;\n  Hash balancer and data payload shapes unchanged; analytics schema_version\n  replaced by dataschema.\n- Consumers (WorkReleased, process-path catalogue, analytics projector)\n  decode with cloudevents.Decode, dispatch on the full type, dedupe on id;\n  invalid/legacy messages are dead-lettered (WorkReleased) or WARN+skipped.\n- Removed EVENT_ENVELOPE_MODE, EnvelopeMode/ParseEnvelopeMode,\n  NewPublisherWithMode, the hand-rolled CloudEvent[T], flat Envelope types,\n  dual-read decodeEnvelope and the flat/dual-only tests.\n- Golden exact-JSON tests per published type, legacy-flat-rejected tests per\n  consumer, testcontainers integration tests on the CloudEvents wire format.\n- AsyncAPI rewritten (exact type const + dataschema per message), ADR-0032\n  added; ADR-0027 superseded, ADR-0004 envelope part superseded; docs,\n  rules, skill and CLAUDE.md updated.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: flat-envelope messages are no longer produced or accepted.\nMust deploy together with the fleet cutover; see warehouse-infra\ndocs/cloudevents-cutover.md.","tree":{"sha":"42b6a725986bce47a6f3219f2777cadeecc7e78e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/42b6a725986bce47a6f3219f2777cadeecc7e78e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/fae64ef9e7fedd19be73783a6d8561a5dae0b4ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commit/fae64ef9e7fedd19be73783a6d8561a5dae0b4ac","node_id":"C_kwDOUAjB-doAKGZhZTY0ZWY5ZTdmZWRkMTliZTczNzgzYTZkOD