i.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/commits/d3568c162cefc91aebd76164704f91f69a7ac95a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:17:18Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:17:18Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"claudioed"},"message":"docs(api): document POST /rebin/arrivals in openapi.yaml\n\nThe pick->pack handoff endpoint (ArriveAtRebin, ADR-0016) was live on the\nchi router but absent from the published contract. Add it under a new\nRebin tag with operationId arriveAtRebin and an ArriveAtRebinRequest schema\nmirroring arriveAtRebinRequest.validate(): 204, 400 invalid-request (no\ninstance), 422 rebin-unknown-line, 500.\n\n- openapi_routes_test.go: walk the chi router and diff it against the\n  spec''s paths in both directions, so a route missing from the spec (the\n  drift docs-api-drift cannot see) now fails make test.\n- schemathesis.toml: per-operation positive_data_acceptance override for\n  arriveAtRebin only (lineId-in-required-set is a cross-field rule OpenAPI\n  3.0.3 cannot express); contract-test.sh passes it explicitly.\n- Regenerate the Docusaurus REST reference (clean + gen); refresh the\n  api-reference index coverage table and .claude/rules notes.","tree":{"sha":"95cd1b9a439408688654bc8c16d1f9af3409bd88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/95cd1b9a439408688654bc8c16d1f9af3409bd88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/d3568c162cefc91aebd76164704f91f69a7ac95a","verification":{"payloa