ce gocyclo/gocognit/cyclop/funlen/nestif gate, refactor all violations\n\nEnable the five complexity linters in .golangci.yml (gocyclo 15, gocognit 20,\ncyclop 15 / package-average 10, funlen 80 lines/50 statements, nestif 5;\n_test.go exempt from funlen/gocyclo, web/ exempt from all five) and add a\ndedicated `complexity` CI job (golangci-lint --enable-only + gocyclo report\nin the step summary, gated into docker-publish). Refactor every\npre-existing violation with zero behavior change: table-driven problem\ncatalogs, split wiring/relay/policy functions, named test helpers instead\nof t.Run closures. golangci-lint, go build/vet, go test ./... all green.","tree":{"sha":"51673d4a728f4a92bf335335a3a4f4d51078aeb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/51673d4a728f4a92bf335335a3a4f4d51078aeb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/7d4e2c13cecb9c40e3164dc1cd308dcb6e4a1cd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view