ub.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: propose ADR-0027 (CloudEvents envelope migration) (#111)\n\n* docs: propose ADR-0027 (CloudEvents envelope migration)\n\nCompanion to wes-work-planning''s own envelope-migration ADR-0021.\nImplements the CloudEvents 1.0 structured envelope both this repo''s and\nwes-work-planning''s ADR-0004 already documented as the target shape but\nnever shipped, via a non-breaking dual-read/dual-write bake period\nacross the 5 real fleet consumers.\n\nRegisters 0027 in docs/docs/adr/index.md and sidebars.ts. Adds a short\naddendum to ADR-0004 pointing at ADR-0027.\n\nStatus: Proposed. Requires explicit user acceptance before Phase 2\nimplementation starts.\n\n* docs: accept ADR-0027 (CloudEvents envelope migration)\n\nAccepted by owner review 2026-09-26, alongside companion\nwes-work-planning ADR-0021.","tree":{"sha":"fd83505bc6b1028eb5db9fd9e5ef655295d64508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/trees/fd83505bc6b1028eb5db9fd9e5ef655295d64508"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/fulfillment-execution/git/commits/3d78e47da19378fc19e12c7e91dc6c858e6f4584","verification":{"payload":"tree fd83505bc6b1028eb5db9fd9e5ef655295d64508\nparent e578cf3ee2d7f8ee1a93d0c6fa8b4b58fd665aec\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790469866 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790469866 -0300\n\ndocs: propose ADR-0027 (CloudEvents envelope migration) (#111)\n\n* docs: propose ADR-0027 (CloudEvents envelope migration)\n\nCompanion to wes-work-planning''s own envelope-migration ADR-0021.\nImplements the CloudEvents 1.0 structured envelope both this repo''s and\nwes-work-planning''s ADR-0004 already documented as the target shape but\nnever shipped, via a non-breaking dual-read/dual-write bake period\nacross the 5 real fleet consumers.\n\nRegisters 0027 in docs/docs/adr/index.md and sidebars.ts. Adds a short\naddendum to ADR-0004 pointing at ADR-0027.\n\nStatus: Proposed. Requires explici