","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(boot): wire logger into oltpHandlerDeps — nil logger panicked the contract boot (#109)\n\nThe complexity-gate refactor (#105) moved buildInstalledCapacityClient into\nnewOLTPHandler, whose permissive-mode Warn ran on a nil logger: unit tests\nand lint stay green, but the contract job — the only one that boots the\nreal binary — panicked at startup (nil pointer in slog). Verify: boots and\nserves /healthz with the permissive warning logged.","tree":{"sha":"eb196fecd93eba33eb1655e2e24aefff1d0ae7ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/trees/eb196fecd93eba33eb1655e2e24aefff1d0ae7ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/commits/475747723fce60492a8f2592346c4ab7c6052cc4","verification":{"payload":"tree eb196fecd93eba33eb1655e2e24aefff1d0ae7ae\nparent 31ce9dd3a0422ab580c7674ff48ba82cff672028\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790588927 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790588927 -0300\n\nfix(boot): wire logger into oltpHandlerDeps — nil logger panicked the contract boot (#109)\n\nThe complexity-gate refactor (#105) moved buildInstalledCapacityClient into\nnewOLTPHandler, whose permissive-mode Warn ran on a nil logger: unit tests\nand lint stay green, but the contract job — the only one that boots the\nreal binary — panicked at startup (nil pointer in slog). Verify: boots and\nserves /healthz with the permissive warning logged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqujf/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACAcQACQMVeV/cKjBubXx6kdJ3xj2\ngMBTAw4g19AKpY60njRA4xxJ0+7kAi2Xkb3K/n92D7w177E68qx1PiJLOLFQQjzR\nyjOGj4DL5K5x6lLEStd2qns0U1QQt3GRZ8Ns9O+ZqDIgsYt62ncQHBTQuuixxmCe\ndm/LElFKTsdNKuM+NVaFxAHheKDcebGMuQiS7ShzTCHA1r2dgv54b0TiJ5PCgYLk\nKfWq14WrE2dEcfMT4y/WwvXsK1tUDvTLCK/0fV5qrWhuE2uQxK+y+AlkY1Y/1eiU\nWYtN+nztL4y/ymJu6iH0ukvnYF0GwOYq2IJIVMHzUg1z9FwKXYKUL5WIPMWxqpc9\n19u+XiZgR0/iq8UVRHJ6UwpmHXOO8iP