laudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/commits/d8ef983399ad99254273e58c5d56d8ca40961a68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T14:34:15Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T14:34:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: replace \"Amazon\" prose with generic e-commerce-retailer wording (#95)\n\nGenericize every real-world-company-named mention of \"Amazon\" across\nREADMEs, CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md disclaimers, ADR prose and Docusaurus docs\npages: disclaimers (\"not affiliated with Amazon...\") now say \"any\nreal-world company\"; style/vocabulary references (\"Amazon-style chaotic\nstow\", \"Amazon''s Selling Partner API\", \"Amazon''s FCLM\", \"Amazon-fulfillment\nreference model\") now read \"e-commerce-retailer-style\", \"a major\ne-commerce retailer''s Selling Partner API\", \"a major e-commerce retailer''s\nFCLM\", \"e-commerce-fulfillment reference model\", etc.\n\nLeft unchanged: the local reference file path\n`/Users/claudioed/docs/amazon-fulfillment-ddd.md` itself (private, not\npublished, out of scope) and every path/backtick reference to that\nfilename in prose (\"see `amazon-fulfillment-ddd.md`\") — only the running\nprose *about* Amazon Inc. was reworded, not the file pointer.","tree":{"sha":"42af805780af998f4eb395ef279504e16fcba0d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/trees/42af805780af998f4eb395ef279504e16fcba0d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/commits/d8ef983399ad99254273e58c5d56d8ca40961a68","verification":{"payload":"tree 42af805780af998f4eb395ef279504e16fcba0d5\nparent f9ed92dc86509250ad8f984c7f97178994ca638a\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790433255 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790433255 -0300\n\ndocs: replace \"Amazon\" prose with generic e-commerce-retailer wording (#95)\n\nGenericize every real-world-company-named mention of \"Amazon\" across\nREADMEs, CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md disclaimers, ADR prose and Docusaurus docs\npages: disclaimers (\"not affiliated with Amazon...\") now say \"any\nreal-world company\"; style/vocabulary references (\"Amazon-style chaotic\nstow\", \"Amazon''s Selling Partner API\", \"Amazon''s FCLM\", \"Amazon-fulfillment\nreference model\") now read \"e-commerce-retailer-style\", \"a major\ne-commerce retailer''s Selling Partner API\", \"a major e-commerce retailer''s\nFCLM\", \"e-commerce-fulfillment reference model\", etc.\n\nLeft unchanged: the local reference file path\n`/Users/claudioed/docs/amazon-fulfillment-ddd.md` itself (private, not\npublished, out of scope) and every path/backtick reference to that\nfilename in prose (\"see `amazon-fulfillment-ddd.md`\") — only the running\nprose *about* Amazon Inc. was reworded, not the file pointer.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt9fnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9+8QACUljbUh3o9cY+gVLXl5vp++\nHuRk4I1HM9QhAFUfVgXNf6AXaZ/r8GmnE+C/b7STp9ZyPnSR+Q4brzZ8h3Q4u56n\n4+HV/2DRpAI4YG0Ou5mQxgQeVNc0ZnqPKIhZhYeUPQJFkXlWyYZZIJmibsFpAy3J\nJys3CyMJLsn83gz0EAVpQ4h+TCgBU6+dABin1OgnheadXeAAZ3jYOFzz5jH8WoN+\nt+efN+0v9r7KxwsWtB6/GZmYSSWLLimTxgv+sm2UaVhJAFR6SMH7lAIBwqIWl1IS\nYeB+bxL/kWByx880sNfqULukPeajR/d723XScR1tA3CUkvc8rKNFlEyIV+0am3ja\nqIhNtY2lb6AwXe