CR).\n- Prefix every image reference (build tags, cosign sign/attest, SBOM\n  attestation, imagetools re-tag on release, release notes) with\n  `ghcr.io/`.\n- Update the couple of docs/README lines that named Docker Hub as the\n  registry.\n\nSame trigger, same versioning scheme (SHORT_SHA + :latest on main,\nsemver tag on release) -- registry only.","tree":{"sha":"497c9a1da53a7aa46db3fcb2c246dfc3507971c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/trees/497c9a1da53a7aa46db3fcb2c246dfc3507971c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/commits/9fc391a97e9bdb7595d15bd948b9ddc45caf55c9","verification":{"payload":"tree 497c9a1da53a7aa46db3fcb2c246dfc3507971c7\nparent dda8e71ce92ddfd6dde2c7127a4cb7821ba43750\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790429337 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790429337 -0300\n\nci(docker-publish): publish images to GHCR instead of Docker Hub (#92)\n\nSwitch docker-publish and release jobs from Docker Hub to GHCR:\n- Replace the Docker Hub login step (DOCKERHUB_USERNAME/DOCKERHUB_TOKEN)\n  with a GHCR login using the built-in GITHUB_TOKEN (no new secret needed).\n- Add `packages: write` to docker-publish''s job permissions (required to\n  push to GHCR).\n- Prefix every image reference (build tags, cosign sign/attest, SBOM\n  attestation, imagetools re-tag on release, release notes) with\n  `ghcr.io/`.\n- Update the couple of docs/README lines that named Docker Hub as the\n  registry.\n\nSame trigger, same versioning scheme (SHORT_SHA + :latest on main,\nsemver tag on release) -- registry only.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt8iZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZ4kQAJep4Gl9ipn2sFKMKKciIyrk\nIEOW5xpHG11ZJ4jOnPHPzxMzFa/TLF5Jl2SWfucgIgay3frXSkZWNlhVIpKf9RqF\nw+v4pPoE62vsc+2hVnixeY8A3apKS2EwkV0ibn4z/KkKte00JkH9Mt4YPEvzVsz7\nMVPjpBEIo1eDzGnKsneOrUolpUjsdNH0e0mAZyXWXwF64MM+HyNxt4ahTTrB1HXA\njW+DVZIleM6+DrtYKfTqI05X+vZjC1OUmRpfL