c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/commits/9fc391a97e9bdb7595d15bd948b9ddc45caf55c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4073304?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/commits/dda8e71ce92ddfd6dde2c7127a4cb7821ba43750/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T11:36:02Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T11:36:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(scorecard): trigger on pushes to develop, the default branch (#91)\n\nscorecard-action refuses to run on a push to anything but the\nrepository''s configured default branch (\"Only the default branch develop\nis supported\"), and every repo in this fleet keeps develop as its default\n(GitFlow). With `push: branches: [main]` the workflow fails on every\ndevelop->main release; the schedule and workflow_dispatch triggers were\nunaffected, which is why the problem only surfaced on release pushes.\n\nSame fix labor-performance, facility-layout, fulfillment-execution,\nprocess-path-management and warehouse-ops-agent already carry.","tree":{"sha":"2d928233e868a17ffbc196ffb46dd4d2568fcdf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/trees/2d928233e868a17ffbc196ffb46dd4d2568fcdf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/commits/dda8e71ce92ddfd6dde2c7127a4cb7821ba43750","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d928233e868a17ffbc196ffb46dd4d2568fcdf3\nparent 4b3c093928642ab5b1f1121cc519413ba6430c44\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790422562 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790422562 -0300\n\nci(scorecard): trigger on pushes to develop, the default branch (#91)\n\nscorecard-action refuses to run on a push to anything but the\nrepository''s configured default branch (\"Only the default branch develop\nis supported\"), and every repo in this fleet keeps develop as its default\n(GitFlow). With `push: branches: [main]` the workflow fails on every\ndevelop->main release; the schedule and workflow_dispatch triggers were\nunaffected, which is why the problem only surfaced on release pushes.\n\nSame fix labor-performance, facility-layout, fulfillment-execution,\nprocess-path-management and warehouse-ops-agent already carry.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqt64iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmXwQAIsyKJyfkGbxSHpRqK0UA7RP\nFVpsVUrBB2xICN3eP2A/CLwyQ4jf68AS0BtC2HKRkgqQFpE+c1cGHnZgwiNsnEUR\nznH8NL9Ik5EfFHPF/kZQTJocz5imS6Snc/sdzKPa1fzYprk7selDutBJtsMPHohB\n+PKobeO340cmlQywoRcuR9cLNey9qKynN5PEm1L2wclvC3RcmyDUX97HZoA4xqla\nQ3prefeRNPw+nJsmT/D4e3cfIllQIf5X5WhYxXsw1nTLy1NkkwDo1j7eiC7b3Q3l\nMKChN/QRKbfXnAN8z+ncPTTKcXo2al7MJAsgKMOysVYc3K7/DQmfk/zmUsSHkIQz\nYMI0PKTBDlOC2ndOBgEL7XyE6pZlQmWz/yXsXIYrHfZ2qnE4xdfMu2dGgYUGnHx6\nx1xG546/uV//tGYCASmMUYu42xQQseRemzeGHc3EieaKMn0vcSR4/MoyUKbENeRa\nrPXwuMvhNguaslIJKjk9vpkPk7bzyO20LS2suNnu2cRy8UHaq2Xey8UVafkKP6on\nNCCqyLJrRD1kaHoQKje9TcUL+6qsewifGYMsrp7BEZj1+HwB30shQMgI0opBjmsm\nj3K/