-r0 build (now 20260909-r0 in the branch''s apk index), so\napk add --no-cache ca-certificates=20260611-r0 fails outright with\n''unable to select packages''. This breaks the Docker image build step\nin the trivy-scan CI job (docker/build-push-action), which then fails\nbefore Trivy ever runs (no image to scan).\n\nBumps the pin to the currently available 20260909-r0 build.","tree":{"sha":"e027c9d5d7caf3a7c3be2646ba1a65e45606c373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/trees/e027c9d5d7caf3a7c3be2646ba1a65e45606c373"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/workforce-management/git/commits/39b308b085b8313ee8a1f0b5b2f981f1e63e86f9","verification":{"payload":"tree e027c9d5d7caf3a7c3be2646ba1a65e45606c373\nparent 1d1c7f86cd0ee2bb75bc263a0d22876061ed51fe\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1790299136 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790299136 -0300\n\nfix(docker): bump ca-certificates to 20260909-r0 (trivy-scan pull fix) (#88)\n\nAlpine 3.24''s ca-certificates package has moved past the pinned\n20260611-r0 build (now 20260909-r0 in the branch''s apk index), so\napk add --no-cache ca-certificates=20260611-r0 fails outright with\n''unable to select packages''. This breaks the Docker image build step\nin the trivy-scan CI job (docker/build-push-action), which then fails\nbefore Trivy ever runs (no image to scan).\n\nBumps the pin to the currently available 20260909-r0 build.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtcwACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkD8QAKpMRpqPtvrJQZFHC0vB0Oou\n2b3GFOurQMLbuioEk+SOg8op5QLcIuRKaTwICSOkceqwH885Xlr4aDu2UhXiheNU\nFCd9nKQMbKYGWgSeZEcEMd6ABUbbnKHSV6qj5/MPTO8R/DsVhNHu50rCnacmRp2N\nDSN0XoEtyOVDQ1Nwimfw9EeW/VdwBzkc/GVexRMD4E6AawN26TANmyR9BKSQlrQi\nx87uva2puIdwWEOGBtNoHoRmbijK+tM+gTYq7lCNs1MPadZ1Pwpr95nwzNKAVwSd\nOMORyllC9ZAOpgWc1UUoRLM3lHwhzxE83uarmtEK+AAO9Uov56/d3rgx5TZATq3K\np1Uc5KG1n5kFd17FYxDsFBdiwCafLiBrUaEtqoBdzXBeCMapktBDuCC+w/K9wMnX\n0fXjDiSz9JmE