"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/19420c7253a479e59ccc41bb0fee3102d9fe2408/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:37:07Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:37:07Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"feat: instance-enabled, i18n-before-messages, README links the user docs\n\ninstance-enabled: common.enabled is false, as the object schema and\njs-controller''s io-package schema ask; an update keeps the setting of an\nexisting instance (extendCommon preserves enabled).\n\ni18n-before-messages: I18n.init is the first statement of its function,\na device manager is constructed after it, no constructor registers a\nmessage handler - js-controller delivers messages before onReady has\nfinished and I18n throws before init. The order ioBroker.shelly uses.\n\ncommon-docs: README.md links docs/<lang>/README.md of every language in\ncommon.docs (ioBroker.repositories README).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6ecb3d2e87363650701bf152cb0dd0682d27f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/d6ecb3d2e87363650701bf152cb0dd0682d27f4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/19420c7253a479e59ccc41bb0fee3102d9fe2408","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":