 was read: a second fixed port (a discovery\nport beside the declared push port) stayed undeclared and the check was green.\nEvery port the code fixes - a number, or a name assigned a number anywhere\nbelow src/ - must be declared in listenPorts, as fixed or as the manifest\nvalue of the entry''s key. A port from the settings is not judged. Measured\nbefore the release: one new finding across eleven adapters, none in the forks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e1879d6bb9141c49fceaffb89d1b12f21e93a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/2e1879d6bb9141c49fceaffb89d1b12f21e93a58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/06e81a7ca688d32bcddba36bb37675d733a03181","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/06e81a7ca688d32bcddba36bb37675d733a03181","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDA2ZTgxYTdjYTY4OG