rror whose message is empty.\n- caught-value-text: a caught value''s `.message` shown as text is a finding in every branch,\n  also behind `instanceof Error`, unless the same function or catch block reads its `.cause`.\n- Relative imports resolve also when the adapter directory is given relative.\n- error-text-helper: helper discovery shared as errorTextHelpers(); adapter names struck from\n  the docstring, README and a test title.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63b7e62c283e955e2f546076a519326ac7f7534f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/63b7e62c283e955e2f546076a519326ac7f7534f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/329b127de09a48e0fbb45615d1a9899c92b2263e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/329b127de09a48e0fbb45615d1a9899c92b2263e","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDMyOWIxMjdkZTA5YTQ4ZTBmYmI0NTYxNWQxYTk4OTljOTJiMjI2M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95","sha":"0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95"}],"sha":"329b127de09a48e0fbb45615d1a9899c92b2263e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/329b127de09a48e0fbb45615d1a9899c92b2263e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:33:50Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:33:50Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"fix(read-stub-copy): resolve identifiers by the path the sources are keyed by — the Windows leg of the 0.13.0 tag run crashed\n\n`StubReader` handed `source.fileName` to the function resolver; the compiler normalises it to\nforward slashes while the sources map is keyed by the listed path, so on Windows the lookup\nreturned undefined and `declaredFunction` crashed on it. The reader now carries the map key.\nRegression test added; 0.13.1, the 0.13.0 tag never published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e543c4eaca48f380e5ef9aac21aaf3df1736c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/2e543c4eaca48f380e5ef9aac21aaf3df1736c05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDBlZDk3ZTA2NzBiOTcwOTRjNTAzZTA5YWQ1MzNhMTNjNWYwNGZmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d","sha":"f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d"}],"sha":"0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/0ed97e0670b97094c503e09ad533a13c5f04ff95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:30:00Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:30:00Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"feat: 0.13.0 — a stub of an adapter read method answers with a copy, never with the object it keeps\n\nNew check `read-stub-copy`, judged in the test sources with the adapter''s own compiler: every\nbinding of a read method (`getObject`, `getForeignObject`, `getForeignObjects`, `getState`,\n`getForeignState`, `getStates`, `getEnums`, `getObjectView`, `getObjectList`,\n`getAdapterObjects`, each with its `Async` twin) — property, method, class field, assignment,\n`vi.fn(impl)`, `.mockImplementation(impl)`, `spyOn(...).mockResolvedValue(x)` — whose answer,\nfollowed through `Promise.resolve`, `await`, `??`, `||`, `?:` and the stub''s own variables, is a\nlookup (`store.get(id)`, `objects[id]`), a member the harness keeps or a variable declared\noutside the stub. A callback-form name counts only next to another adapter member or on a\nreceiver called `adapter`/`this` (`date-holidays` fakes carry `getStates(country)`).\n\nBackground (hassemu 2026-09-17, v1.45.0): js-controller answers every read with a fresh value;\nwith a shared reference a change the code makes on what it read is in the store before any\nwrite, so no test can tell a missing write from a done one — the repair path''s write was\ninvisible to every test.\n\nMeasured on twelve adapters: 39 findings in eleven (hassemu 10, govee-smart 8, homeconnect 4,\npublic-holidays 4, yamaha 4, beszel 2, hueemu 2, nut2 2, fakeroku 1, homewizard 1, parcelapp 1;\nai-usage 0). Nine needles S1–S9 caught against this tree.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c31d40145e4988f8a865b2c24045be91f90f562b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/c31d40145e4988f8a865b2c24045be91f90f562b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKGY4NGIwMDNhMjM2YTQ0YmIyZjkwZTZjODM0NTQyZjk0MDJhMmMwMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/132456a29269bbd070cccce4b063bd254c07333e","sha":"132456a29269bbd070cccce4b063bd254c07333e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/132456a29269bbd070cccce4b063bd254c07333e"}],"sha":"f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/f84b003a236a44bb2f90e6c834542f9402a2c00d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/132456a29269bbd070cccce4b063bd254c07333e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:03:32Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:06:31Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"feat: 0.12.0 — one error-text helper per repository, no delState beside delObject, a receiver for every dropped promise; caught-value-text follows copies and allSettled reasons\n\nThree checks from the fleet''s morning findings and one widening:\n\n- error-text-helper: every function below src/ and src-admin/src/ whose body\n  calls both JSON.stringify and Object.prototype.toString.call is the helper;\n  the first under src/ is the repository''s, every further one is a copy.\n- object-delete-drops-state: delState right before or after delObject of the\n  same id on the adapter — js-controller deletes the value with the state\n  object (_delForeignObject → delForeignState, since the 2019 lib/adapter.js).\n- fire-and-forget-rejection: a promise dropped with `void` is followed to its\n  callee, whose body must keep every await, throw, returned promise and own\n  throwing helper inside a try/catch with a catch clause; awaited own functions\n  are followed the same way, chains with .catch() and Promise.resolve/\n  allSettled never reject, a .then() chain without .catch() is judged by its\n  root and callbacks; unresolvable callees (adapter-core, libraries) are not\n  judged, nor are unresolvable sync calls inside a body — counting every call\n  reported this.log.debug() before the try at twelve fleet sites.\n- caught-value-text: a copy of the caught value (`const err = error as Error`,\n  `const copy = error`) is followed under its new name, .message off a cast\n  copy is the cast form; the results of Promise.allSettled are followed\n  through for-of and the element callbacks to `r.reason`.\n- The function resolution the AST checks share moved to src/sources.ts.\n\nMeasured on the twelve fleet adapters, the reporting adapters'' pre-fix trees\nand ioBroker.javascript; 21 targeted mutants of the new code all caught.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8abf2725e676d037a4eef6f7643b1d2b20183850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/8abf2725e676d037a4eef6f7643b1d2b20183850"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/132456a29269bbd070cccce4b063bd254c07333e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/132456a29269bbd070cccce4b063bd254c07333e","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDEzMjQ1NmEyOTI2OWJiZDA3MGNjY2NlNGIwNjNiZDI1NGMwNzMzM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"ht