te":"2026-09-16T14:14:36Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"candidate: deprecated-adapter-methods — a call to a method the installed @iobroker/types marks deprecated\n\nNot released. The list is derived from node_modules/@iobroker/types/build/*.d.ts\nof the adapter, so it follows the version the adapter resolves (7.2.2:\nsetStateAsync, extendObjectAsync, setObjectAsync, setForeignObjectAsync,\ncreateState/createChannel/createDevice, deleteState/deleteChannel/\ndeleteDevice and their Async twins). Judged on the adapter receiver only.\nMeasured 2026-09-16: 50 findings in 5 of 12 fleet adapters (homewizard 26,\npublic-holidays 17, hueemu 5, beszel 1, yamaha 1) and 42 in 4 of 13 foreign\nadapters, all true for their installed version — whether the fleet adopts\nthe rule as a gate is the owner''s decision; until then the check stays on\nthis branch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1dd2ca94b1491cdc565d09234f2b12ef18bd2de1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/1dd2ca94b1491cdc565d09234f2b12ef18bd2de1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/3e775dd400b4987e1ee72760c50e92fb073bf4b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/3e775dd400b4987e1ee72760c50e92fb073bf4b2","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDNlNzc1ZGQ0MDBiNDk4N2UxZWU3Mjc2MGM1MGU5MmZiMDczYmY0YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/27f09345d23db80e4a491c1709843acc629eda63","sha":"27f09345d23db80e4a491c1709843acc629eda63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/27f09345d23db80e4a491c1709843acc629eda63"}],"sha":"3e775dd400b4987e1ee72760c50e92fb073bf4b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/3e775dd400b4987e1ee72760c50e92fb073bf4b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/27f09345d23db80e4a491c1709843acc629eda63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:14:17Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T14:14:17Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"feat(object-rewrite): an object loses a key by a copy written with setForeignObject, not by delete + create or setObject\n\nTwo findings, judged with the adapter''s own TypeScript compiler: a delete\nof an object followed on the same path through the function by a create\nof the same id on the same receiver (a deleted state object loses its\nvalue and its enum memberships — _delForeignObject calls delForeignState\nand removeIdFromAllEnums), and a whole-object write with setObject or\nsetObjectAsync on the adapter (the checker''s S5054 and its unseen async\ntwin). Measured before the release: 4 true findings in 4 of 12 fleet\nadapters, 11 whole-object writes in 3 of 13 foreign adapters. New\ninternal helper adapter-api lists the calls of a file with receiver,\nadapter detection and the same-path walk; typescript is an optional peer\ndependency, loaded from the adapter''s copy, and a missing compiler is a\nfinding, not silence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42ae43c4c3a07fbadabd70d0ab5b6f3f5d4a18f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/42ae43c4c3a07fbadabd70d0ab5b6f3f5d4a18f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/27f09345d23db80e4a491c1709843acc629eda63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: