-adapter-checks/commits/00510a03889ec607ab7237331ef9bf019592cc0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/123415236d5b85f77e0d124de9d514f4abe309fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:19:19Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:19:19Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"fix(listen-port-declaration): a protocol-fixed port field must be disabled unconditionally\n\nConfigGeneric short-circuits `disabled: true` and evaluates every other value as an\nexpression — the boolean is the canonical form, the string \"true\" is accepted because it\nevaluates the same, and a condition on the form data (`!data.enabled`) no longer passes\nas a fixed port.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1eddea9578256a5d708ba95c3031ea588fc2d8d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/1eddea9578256a5d708ba95c3031ea588fc2d8d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/123415236d5b85f77e0d124de9d514f4abe309fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/123415236d5b85f77e0d124de9d514f4abe309fb","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDEyMzQxNTIzNmQ1Yjg1Zjc3ZTBkMTI0ZGU5ZDUxNGY0YWJlMzA5ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/9d2dd8f25b6b06daac24d53cd4b22d44aef912c7","sha":"9d2dd8f25b6b06daac24d53cd4b22d44aef912c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/9d2dd8f25b6b06daac24d53cd4b22d44aef912c7"}],"sha":"123415236d5b85f77e0d124de9d514f4abe309fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/123415236d5b85f77e0d124de9d514f4abe309fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/9d2dd8f25b6b06daac24d53cd4b22d44aef912c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:13:17Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T08:13:17Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"feat: listen-port-declaration check — a listening adapter declares native.port + native.bind\n\nThe admin''s port-conflict check (\"Port is already used by X\") only sees instances on the\nsame host that carry both native.port and native.bind (ConfigPort skips every instance\nwithout bind). Measured on the 801 adapters of the official repository: 145 declare\nnative.port, only 38 also bind — and none of the fleet''s five listeners was visible, each\nstored its listen address under its own key (host, bindAddress, networkInterface).\n\nThe check reads the adapter''s own declaration (fleet.json `listenPorts`: key, protocol,\nrole primary|secondary|shared|perDevice, fixed?) and holds manifest and settings form to\nit: a socket in src/ (createServer / listen / createSocket, comments stripped) without a\ndeclaration; a declaration nothing backs; malformed entries; native.port not a number or\nnot the fixed value; the legacy keys bindAddress / BIND; the port field not of type port,\na protocol-fixed one not disabled and pinned to min = max (the jsonConfig schema allows no\nreadOnly on port fields); native.bind missing, the bind field not an ip field offering\n0.0.0.0, or a fixed bind that is not 0.0.0.0; and native.bind on an adapter that declares\nno listener — its native.port is the port of the peer.\n\nMeasured before tagging: dry-run over the twelve fleet adapters reports exactly the five\nlisteners (hueemu, hassemu, govee-smart, yamaha, fakeroku) and leaves the seven clients\nclean; a repochecker --local run on a hueemu copy carrying native.bind, a numeric\nnative.port and a disabled port field shows no new finding; four mutation probes\n(disabled rule, createSocket pattern, bind rule, fixed-value rule) each turn tests red.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c2274c6329c583eef452d9c2e60bc6b2864b021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/4c2274c6329c583eef452d9c2e60bc6b2864b021"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/9d2dd8f25b6b06daac24d53cd4b22d44aef912c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https