_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/19c8fe4b741fe2e646fb50064bc737914f5c89a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:48:13Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:48:13Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"Johannes Krobath"},"message":"fix: restore five mistranslation patterns the port dropped\n\nThe python original of the admin-i18n audit carried nine trouble patterns;\nthe first port to this package kept four. `Lüszel`, `Stall` and the three\ntranslated adapter names (`Paketapp`, `paquetapp`, `paccoapp`) are back, each\none standing for an incident that shipped. Matched case-sensitively so\n`Install` is not read as `Stall`; a scan over 121 i18n files in the fleet finds\nno hit either way today — these are regression guards, not open findings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74ddffa6c4d948f90d7d2eed6e88ea47db10c4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/74ddffa6c4d948f90d7d2eed6e88ea47db10c4d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/19c8fe4b741fe2e646fb50064bc737914f5c89a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/19c8fe4b741fe2e646fb50064bc737914f5c89a0","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDE5YzhmZTRiNzQxZmUyZTY0NmZiNTAwNjRiYzczNzkxNGY1Yzg5YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3","sha":"03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3"}],"sha":"19c8fe4b741fe2e646fb50064bc737914f5c89a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/19c8fe4b741fe2e646fb50064bc737914f5c89a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:04:33Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"krobi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:04:33Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"krobi"},"message":"fix(ci): install npm 11 before publishing, add a changelog\n\nThe 0.2.0 upload failed with a 404: npm 10 — what Node ships — cannot authenticate\nthrough trusted publishing, so the request went out anonymous and npm answered as if\nthe package did not exist. The ioBroker deploy action solves it the same way.\n\nCHANGELOG.md is written for the developer pulling the package in: new checks, changed\nfindings, changed defaults, changed signatures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be39d0022b016f4fcf393b707ad032360ca5ecac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/be39d0022b016f4fcf393b707ad032360ca5ecac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3","node_id":"C_kwDOUA7Na9oAKDAzYTJiM2FiMjU1NTJlOTIxOTljNmFmM2YxMmFlYWI3MGI4MDliZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commit/ffb5c0b48fa24fd0fbd57b14bb16187d9ce2974f","sha":"ffb5c0b48fa24fd0fbd57b14bb16187d9ce2974f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/ffb5c0b48fa24fd0fbd57b14bb16187d9ce2974f"}],"sha":"03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/03a2b3ab25552e92199c6af3f12aeab70b809bd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/krobipd","id":27220902,"login":"krobipd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjIwOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/commits/ffb5c0b48fa24fd0fbd57b14bb16187d9ce2974f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:00:00Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"krobi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:00:00Z","email":"krobi@power-dreams.com","name":"krobi"},"message":"feat: admin-i18n and readme-requirements checks, release 0.2.0\n\nadmin-i18n compares the translatable texts of the settings page against the shipped\nlanguage files: missing languages, missing individual texts, both i18n layouts side\nby side, a manifest naming the wrong dialect, and four machine mistranslations that\nare embarrassing where they land.\n\nreadme-requirements compares what the README promises against what the adapter\nactually requires — js-controller, admin and Node. Only the offline half of the\npython original moved: comparing against the live stable channel needs network and\nstays in the release tooling.\n\nBoth verified against the python original across eleven adapters, with planted\nviolations. Adapter-specific mistranslation entries were dropped; they were names\nfrom one fleet, not general.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27b90b821cdb4346c61d77e8fb67035c237c09ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/trees/27b90b821cdb4346c61d77e8fb67035c237c09ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/krobipd/iobroker-adapter-checks/git/commits/ffb5c0b48fa24fd0fbd57b14bb16187d9ce2974f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27220902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krobipd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http