il":"asmitdash@users.noreply.github.com","name":"asmitdash"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:20:39.646Z","repositoryId":1343180754,"sha":"4cd37c105f24f7b26c7934ab317502a85ad0be02"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:20:39.646Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187498981?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety","id":187498981,"login":"11fsociety","node_id":"U_kgDOCy0B5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/bd5cbd2015d43be42231727752a6e64fdced9e51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:28:28Z","email":"187498981+11fsociety@users.noreply.github.com","name":"11fsociety"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:28:28Z","email":"187498981+11fsociety@users.noreply.github.com","name":"11fsociety"},"message":"Post-audit hardening pass (LvP -97 -> +67.6, MAJOR bump)\n\nThis commit is the output of a multi-agent kenway-guided hardening sprint\nagainst the state at 762aea4 (PR #1 as merged on asmitdash/CVS). It closes\n9 High and 15 Med severity findings from the retrospective audit. Full LvP\ntrajectory: -97.0 (Redesign) -> +26.6 (PATCH, borderline MINOR) -> +67.6\n(MAJOR).\n\nAuth + session\n- POST /api/auth/register no longer accepts role from the client; self-\n  registration forces role=dealer, admin JWT required to create anything\n  else (server/controllers/auth.controller.js).\n- console.log(''Decoded Token'', decoded) removed from auth.middleware.js.\n- Refresh tokens now bcrypt-hashed on save; refresh handler compares via\n  bcrypt (models/index.js, auth.controller.js). One-way migration -- see\n  docs/ops/deploy-readiness.md for the log-out-on-deploy note.\n- Login rate limit 5/min per IP on /api/auth/login; failedLoginAttempts +\n  lockedUntil on User; 15-min lockout after 5 failures.\n\nSystem bootstrap\n- POST /api/system/connect + auto-provision/* + configure/s3 gated behind\n  SetupState.complete === false. _writeEnvFile rejects newline, CR,\n  backtick, and shell substitution characters; values written quoted so\n  Mongo Atlas / Redis Cloud URIs with query strings work.\n- Object.assign(process.env, ...) writes replaced with a runtime singleton\n  (server/config/runtime.js).\n\nHTTP hardening\n- helmet + scoped CORS regex (project-specific Vercel origins) + explicit\n  express.json({ limit: ''1mb'' }).\n- Path-traversal guard via path.basename() in qa.controller.js.\n- Unified multer factory (server/middleware/upload.js) with 50 MB / 5 files\n  / 20 fields caps; disk storage for large uploads.\n\nDependencies\n- multer bumped to ^2 (CVE-2025-7338, CVE-2024-42809).\n- xlsx (CVE-2023-30533, CVE-2024-22363) removed; imports migrated to\n  exceljs across dealer/salesRecord/claimsRecord/rtoRecord controllers.\n- Dead finalRecord controller/route/model deleted (last xlsx consumer).\n- express-rate-limit and zod added to dependencies (were required by code\n  but missing from the manifest; boot-time bomb on any fresh install).\n\nAdmin singletons + LLM surface\n- PUT /api/document-guidelines, /api/verification-rollups,\n  /api/claim-eligibilities, /api/rule-schema now validate:\n  * Whitelisted char set on labels and keywords, max 200 chars per field.\n  * Reject on prompt-injection regex hits (/ignore|system:|assistant:|<\\|/i).\n  * Max 200 docs, 50 fields/doc, 100 rollups, 100 claims.\n  * Unique keys per array; operator names against a shared whitelist.\n- ReDoS: server/services/ruleEvaluator.js swapped native RegExp for re2.\n- Seeded 3 rollups (customer/vehicle/document_verification) + 4 claims\n  (retail/loyalty/exchange/corporate) so fresh installs produce meaningful\n  verdicts instead of \"invalid\"/\"inconsistent\" defaults.\n\nPython service\n- Consolidated: 11 MB server/python-service legacy tree deleted; new\n  python-service/ orchestrator is the single source. All `from services.*`\n  imports rewired to `from engines.bedrock.*`; 18 modules import clean.\n- Per-request boto3 client -- deleted module-level bedrock_runtime and\n  MODEL_ID. process_pdf now takes aws_access_key_id, aws_secret_access_key,\n  aws_region, text_model_id as arguments; zero os.environ mutation in the\n  request path.\n- Node -> Python authenticated via constant-time bearer check\n  (PYTHON_SERVICE_TOKEN); fail-closed 503 if token unset server-side.\n- FastAPI CORS locked to NODE_SERVICE_ORIGIN (default 127.0.0.1:5000);\n  uvicorn binds loopback by default.\n- Legacy build_verification_status_json path gated behind\n  `if not guidelines:` so the dual-path drift is dead when Node supplies\n  guidelines (always, in practice).\n- Rollup operator dispatch is explicit string-compare on a fixed whitelist\n  (verified: no getattr, no __eval__ injection surface).\n\nTerraform / infra\n- Bedrock IAM scoped from `resources = [\"*\"]` to a whitelisted model ARN\n  list.\n- Self-managed VPC with public + private subnets, NAT gateway, EIP;\n  workers now `associate_public_ip_address = false`.\n- systemd unit runs as cvs-worker (non-root) with NoNewPrivileges,\n  ProtectSystem=strict, ProtectHome, PrivateTmp.\n- Artifacts S3 bucket: AES256 SSE + versioning.\n\nTest scaffolding + docs\n- Supertest smoke suite added (server/tests/routes/*.smoke.test.js) with\n  hermetic mongodb-memory-server bootstrap. Not yet run; devDeps added.\n- docs/design/admin-validation-ux.md -- inline validation + error mapping\n  UX for the singleton PUT endpoints.\n- docs/design/bedrock-prompt-hardening.md -- XML-wrap + strict-output-\n  schema defense stack for future Frank pass (Layer 1/2 deferred).\n- docs/ops/deploy-readiness.md -- ops runbook, PLATFORM_MASTER_KEY\n  sentinel plan, refresh-token migration warnings, missing budget alerts.\n- docs/ops/manual-qa-attack-plan.md -- 8-part attack-surface probe plan.\n\nExplicit skip\n- startup.txt admin password (admin123) preserved. Prototype-grade product.\n  Enforce first-login rotation before any real deployment.\n\nKnown deferred items (see docs/ops/deploy-readiness.md for the full list)\n- Bedrock prompt hardening Layers 1/2 (XML wrap + strict output-schema\n  validation).\n- aws_budgets_budget for Bedrock spend.\n- PLATFORM_MASTER_KEY mismatch sentinel + rekey path.\n- pipeline.py 3-arg TypeError (dormant, extractor path unreached).\n- infrastructure/llm.py load_dotenv + env-cred fallback (dormant, same\n  reason).\n\nBaseline audit: LvP dossier v1.0 (2026-08-21) methodology.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0c811a63f707512bb6599520ffcd2b175bd6587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/f0c811a63f707512bb6599520ffcd2b175bd6587"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/bd5cbd2015d43be42231727752a6e64fdced9e51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/187498981?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/11fsociety/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":