/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/762aea4c1e50e413c26e43c98f1f4fd9e8b92291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:46:41Z","email":"115637270+asmitdash@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Asmit Dash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:46:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #1 from asmitdash/local-changes\n\nMake extraction, verification, and rules configuration admin-editable","tree":{"sha":"103ea3470530e99b9e2fd70b453260433032c6e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/103ea3470530e99b9e2fd70b453260433032c6e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/762aea4c1e50e413c26e43c98f1f4fd9e8b92291","verification":{"payload":"tree 103ea3470530e99b9e2fd70b453260433032c6e3\nparent 485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d\nparent 49c4ffb43a73ecdf7a1f18f93059f04a74e83b76\nauthor Asmit Dash <115637270+asmitdash@users.noreply.github.com> 1787410001 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787410001 +0530\n\nMerge pull request #1 from asmitdash/local-changes\n\nMake extraction, verification, and rules configuration admin-editable","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqibZRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZuAQAKmcBqj0gVZpAYTU6SnEfyl5\ns92x5znAWZyaK9h9mATP+2XvrR0hmGSoPQUllbJj1eE2QWRJV95bfy/lft3EWpkw\ns66Tq9xfo2tSnNGIqTWDx9l5jwMqg4PqoS6GM8SdMru2chZhWzo8tWFQNuIfjZz+\n4aVc1+T6yo/uRf4geVPP+o+Zqzu3iHeClcLUowJClikoCyhgb2F/WWGkKt+G1PQQ\nPSSBdQneIZPlG50UfVpbclNXvMTdi9WMRBHAVsgI5mbeaMzT0QxmoHk/GCN/0UD3\nnEiNIsLci0i4ZJJG4gyNefsWsD6FqcwrW6jMyRVt5vExLTj1VCtTHS+qUvbZywWW\nSOHr2yBQouzTmwzaJzFWZoy4hsePk+uPrDak5DSqnzwaeM/OK8kgGG4PDMjMjFOu\nfAo7NiQMzvD4HxwzXXeeF8HRmy+RIHiCSJwJi/4boj/Mqh8n9fIiigc/JSRwWioT\nAkQHthfA6l8Qz+AMxXmjL2ROxdRImWoMubp/0wvrkxDPjEyCKQnLMMw0dXt/zjsn\nJP3FyHZR/3mDlssoEapsDazXtePlz12DQsBuN