{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153927455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sarat-Alane","id":153927455,"login":"Sarat-Alane","node_id":"U_kgDOCSy_Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/49c4ffb43a73ecdf7a1f18f93059f04a74e83b76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:35:27Z","email":"sarat.k.alane@gmail.com","name":"Sarat Alane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:35:27Z","email":"sarat.k.alane@gmail.com","name":"Sarat Alane"},"message":"Make extraction, verification, and rules configuration admin-editable\n\nAdds four new Mongo singletons + admin UIs and refactors the Bedrock\npipeline to consume them at runtime, eliminating hardcoded brand-specific\nvocabulary from the extraction/verification/eligibility path.\n\nStreams:\n- Rule Meta-Schema (server: RuleSchemaDefinition model + controller +\n  routes; client: RuleSchemaPage). Wires the schema through the API;\n  RulesEditorPage still consumes hardcoded values pending a follow-up.\n- Document Guidelines + Verification Rollups + Claim Eligibilities\n  (server: 3 new models/controllers/routes; client: 3 new admin pages;\n  python-service: check_library, prompt_builder, rollup_evaluator, and\n  eligibility_evaluator). pdf_processor now builds the Bedrock prompt\n  dynamically from the guidelines singleton and overlays the rollup and\n  eligibility evaluator output on top of the legacy computation. The\n  auditPipeline controller piggybacks all three singletons on the\n  guidelines_json field sent to /process.\n\nSee CHANGES_SUMMARY.md and changes/*.md for the full rationale and\nphase-by-phase implementation notes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"103ea3470530e99b9e2fd70b453260433032c6e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/103ea3470530e99b9e2fd70b453260433032c6e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/49c4ffb43a73ecdf7a1f18f93059f04a74e83b76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153927455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sarat-Alane","id":153927455,"login":"Sarat-Alane","node_id":"U_kgDOCSy_Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/49c4ffb43a73ecdf7a1f18f93059f04a74e83b76","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9P0toAKDQ5YzRmZmI0M2E3M2VjZGY3YTFmMThmOTMwNTlmMDRhNzRlODNiNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d","sha":"485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d"}],"sha":"49c4ffb43a73ecdf7a1f18f93059f04a74e83b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/49c4ffb43a73ecdf7a1f18f93059f04a74e83b76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153927455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sarat-Alane","id":153927455,"login":"Sarat-Alane","node_id":"U_kgDOCSy_Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:47:09Z","email":"sarat.k.alane@gmail.com","name":"Sarat Alane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T08:47:09Z","email":"sarat.k.alane@gmail.com","name":"Sarat Alane"},"message":"fix(cvs): drop dead brand check that blocked sales-record Excel import\n\nPOST /api/sales-records/import was 400-ing with \"Brand context is missing\nfrom your token\" because the controller still pulled `req.brandFilter.brand`,\nbut Phase 0''s brand strip removed `brand` from the SalesRecord model and\nfrom the tenantScope middleware (which now sets brandFilter to {} for\nadmins/auditors). The check could never pass on a clean install.\n\nRemoved the early-400, the `brand: brand` field on imported rows, and the\n`brand` half of the {chasisNumber, brand} upsert key (chasisNumber alone is\nthe natural key now). Same dead `brand` references cleaned out of list /\nexport / create / bulk-delete handlers and their reservedKeys arrays. The\nreq.brandFilter plumbing itself stays — it''s still load-bearing for dealer\nscoping ({dealerCode} on dealer tokens).","tree":{"sha":"b5a98a1e3b78e1519cb647022db10f3a9673c4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/b5a98a1e3b78e1519cb647022db10f3a9673c4d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153927455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sarat-Alane","id":153927455,"login":"Sarat-Alane","node_id":"U_kgDOCSy_Hw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarat-Alane","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9P0toAKDQ4NWNmZDQzNDM5ZGZlODkzOTBlNTQ3NzE0N2FjY2UxYTI5ZDI2NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d","sha":"26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d"}],"sha":"485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/485cfd43439dfe89390e5477147acce1a29d264d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:20:35Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T06:20:35Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"message":"fix(setup): provision Mongo as single-node replica set (change streams)\n\nThe previous implementation booted mongo:7 standalone with auth, which\nbreaks server boot because the platform watches MongoDB change streams\n(server/services/changeStream.service.js) and change streams only run on\nreplica sets. Standalone-mode mongod accepts the initial connection but\nerrors with `Location40573 — The $changeStream stage is only supported on\nreplica sets` as soon as the watcher starts.\n\nVerified live (c:/tmp/cvs-live):\n- Pre-fix Mongo container produced the change-stream error on every boot.\n- Fixed container starts mongod with --replSet rs0 --bind_ip_all, runs\n  rs.initiate({_id:''rs0'',members:[{_id:0,host:''localhost:27017''}]}) once\n  via mongosh exec, waits up to 60s for hello.isWritablePrimary, and\n  returns the replica-set URI to the wizard.\n- Server boots clean against the new container — change streams initialize\n  with no error, /api/system/status reports needsConfiguration:false.\n- Idempotent re-call returns mode:''reused'' and the same URI.\n\nAuth removed: combining auth with a replica set requires a shared keyfile\nacross members, which is overkill for a localhost-bound dev container.\nRedis was already no-auth localhost-only for the same reason. Both are\ndocumented as dev infra in the service header.","tree":{"sha":"b42eaa4ee571695a7e83430df754d9694b9483a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/b42eaa4ee571695a7e83430df754d9694b9483a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9P0toAKDI2OTE3ZGZiZTQ4NzU2OWM2M2E3MDc1MTZiNGI3NGY0MTBkYTE4MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950","sha":"7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950"}],"sha":"26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/26917dfbe487569c63a707516b4b74f410da180d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:41:48Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T05:41:48Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"message":"feat(setup): auto-provision MongoDB + Redis via Docker, S3 wizard step\n\nThe Connection page is now a real setup wizard. Operators no longer need\nto know Mongo/Redis URIs or hand-edit server/.env — the wizard provisions\nboth as local Docker containers and validates them by attempting a real\nclient connection. Manual paste-the-URI mode is preserved as a fallback.\n\nServer:\n- New provision.service.js: Docker-detect probe, idempotent provisioning of\n  cvs_mongo (random root password) and cvs_redis on the project''s standard\n  ports. Re-running reuses existing containers; pulls happen lazily on\n  first run. Each provision call probes the resulting URI by connecting\n  with a 60s/30s timeout so the wizard can''t move forward unless the\n  service actually answers.\n- /api/system/auto-provision/mongo: provisions, persists MONGO_URI to\n  server/.env, hot-reconnects mongoose. Pre-auth (matches /connect).\n- /api/system/auto-provision/redis: provisions, persists REDIS_URL.\n  redisRestartRequired:true returned because Socket.io''s adapter binds at\n  boot. Pre-auth.\n- /api/system/s3/configure: validates credentials with S3 HeadBucket\n  before persisting AWS_*  + S3_BUCKET_NAME / AWS_S3_BUCKET. 400s on bad\n  region / revoked keys with the AWS error surfaced. Behind protect +\n  checkRole(admin, superadmin) — by the time anyone hits this, Mongo +\n  login are already up. Flips SetupState.steps.s3Configured.\n- /api/system/status now reports docker.available and s3.{configured,\n  bucket, region} alongside mongo/redis. needsConfiguration still excludes\n  S3 — the platform boots without it; uploads just fail until set.\n- SetupState gains a steps.s3Configured boolean.\n\nClient:\n- ConnectionPage rewritten with Auto / Manual tabs per service. Auto tab\n  is disabled with a hint when Docker isn''t reachable. New S3 section\n  always visible with Access Key / Secret / Region / Bucket fields, posts\n  to /system/s3/configure, surfaces validation errors verbatim.\n- Live status row gains Docker and S3 pills.\n- \"Continue to platform\" button shows once Mongo + Redis are both green.\n- api.js: autoProvisionMongo / autoProvisionRedis / configureS3 helpers.","tree":{"sha":"664db69e0af2f9b40b735cbb087c756a074b51aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/664db69e0af2f9b40b735cbb087c756a074b51aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9P0toAKDc2NTJmOTE3NzIzODI5ZWJiYWNjN2FhMWM5YTJkNGQxZThiMjU5NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547","sha":"225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547"}],"sha":"7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/7652f917723829ebbacc7aa1c9a2d4d1e8b25950"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:08:34Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T04:08:34Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"message":"feat(cvs): gate dealer document uploads on auditor''s retail-file import\n\nDealers can now only submit per-record documents after the auditor (or admin)\nhas uploaded the retail Excel file at least once. Locked state is surfaced\nexplicitly in the dealer UI instead of failing at upload time.\n\n- Bulk Excel /import is now auditor/admin-only on sales/RTO/claims routes;\n  successful sales import flips SetupState.steps.retailMasterUploaded.\n- New requireRetailMaster middleware blocks dealer first-lot/final-lot\n  uploads with 403 RETAIL_MASTER_MISSING when the flag is off.\n- New GET /api/setup/upload-gate exposes just the boolean for any\n  authenticated user (so the dealer UI can read it without leaking full\n  setup state).\n- New DealerUploadDataPage replaces the auditor-style table for the\n  /dealer/upload-data route — per-record drag-and-drop upload widgets that\n  render a \"Locked — awaiting auditor\" cell until the gate is open.\n- Auditor''s UploadDataPage shows a status hint (\"Dealer uploads enabled\" /\n  \"locked until you import the retail file\") so they know what their action\n  unblocks downstream.","tree":{"sha":"4060e861e9f91adc5b053047ebc069b72a9e5d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/4060e861e9f91adc5b053047ebc069b72a9e5d14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9P0toAKDIyNTQyNWRkZTg5ZjkwY2I4YjIyYTc1NDA1MTJlZjg3ZjNjNmQ1NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/11fsociety/CVS/commit/69dbccc9730ab0edc90d712cbe4d293470617612","sha":"69dbccc9730ab0edc90d712cbe4d293470617612","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/69dbccc9730ab0edc90d712cbe4d293470617612"}],"sha":"225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/225425dde89f90cb8b22a7540512ef87f3c6d547"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/69dbccc9730ab0edc90d712cbe4d293470617612/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T06:47:10Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T06:47:10Z","email":"asmitdash44@gmail.com","name":"asmitdash"},"message":"feat(cvs): family relationship resolution for KYC-vs-RC mismatch\n\nAdds a deterministic resolver that infers the relationship between the\nclaimant and the master-record holder using Indian KYC kinship markers\n(S/O, W/O, D/O, H/O), father''s-name reciprocity on PAN/DL, and shared\naddress signals. Resolves the headline cases where a spouse claims on\nthe other spouse''s RC, or loyalty earned on one vehicle is consumed on\na second vehicle bought in the spouse''s name.\n\n- server/services/familyRelationResolver.js + relationshipUtils.js\n- server/services/ruleEvaluator.js: new family_linked operator\n- server/models/Rule.js: family_linked added to op enum\n- SalesRecord/RTORecord: relationshipVerdict field\n- auditPipeline.controller.js: resolver runs before rule evaluation\n- client RelationshipBadge in RecordDetailDrawer with hover-evidence\n- 17 new tests (11 resolver + 6 operator), 27/27 npm test green\n- README: new \"Family Relationship Resolution\" section","tree":{"sha":"722df115e6c2ef365b8a8a9a27229b7a769d108e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/722df115e6c2ef365b8a8a9a27229b7a769d108e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/69dbccc9730ab0edc90d712cbe4d293470617612","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash"