"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/commits/4cd37c105f24f7b26c7934ab317502a85ad0be02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T01:59:36Z","email":"asmitdash@users.noreply.github.com","name":"asmitdash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T01:59:36Z","email":"asmitdash@users.noreply.github.com","name":"asmitdash"},"message":"Initial commit: CVS — Claim Verification System\n\nGeneric vehicle-dealer claim approval platform. IP-clean rebuild\ncovering all seven plan phases (0–6) plus UI revamp + Connection page\nbootstrap.\n\n- React + Vite client with Inter / sectioned sidebar / depth treatment\n- Node + Express server with audit log + correlation IDs + secret store\n- Python FastAPI orchestrator dispatching to Bedrock or self-hosted\n  (Paddle + Bedrock Vision) engines\n- Admin-configurable rules engine + FieldDefinition + PlatformTaxonomy\n- Terraform + Packer infra for self-hosted EC2 fleet (SSM-driven code push)\n- 10/10 parity tests passing locally","tree":{"sha":"b1c0ef9d060724864fea2cb8b17cc36ede0bc8e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/trees/b1c0ef9d060724864fea2cb8b17cc36ede0bc8e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/11fsociety/CVS/git/commits/4cd37c105f24f7b26c7934ab317502a85ad0be02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115637270?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/asmitdash","id":115637270,"login":"asmitdash","node_id":"U_kgDOBuR8Fg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asmitdash/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g