nte\" (desliga ao fechar o painel); monitor exibe \"Tela N · WxH\"\n  (índice 0-based = Tela 1); answerScreenQuestions envia session_id\n- testes: +155 linhas em test_screen_questions.py (fingerprints, detect,\n  rota/403), useScreen.test.ts novo (loop/dedupe/parada), snapshots e\n  useChat atualizados — backend 580 e frontend 26 passando","tree":{"sha":"db727af0f3600a57622281fb4a1c2e3f946ebd98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/db727af0f3600a57622281fb4a1c2e3f946ebd98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/ddf22af9501720aed382f053aea6787cde4c1a03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/ddf22af9501720aed382f053aea6787cde4c1a03","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9o99oAKGRkZjIyYWY5NTAxNzIwYWVkMzgyZjA1M2FlYTY3ODdjZGU0YzFhMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commi