omments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/b8149f056e2aa91f1eb2f0253889ff5fff0b29fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:49:10Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:49:10Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"security: PIN local p/ permissões perigosas, rate limits, bind localhost, proteção CSV/filename\n\n- local_auth.py: PIN via STUDYAGENT_PIN (env) + X-StudyAgent-Pin, comparado com\n  hm.compare_digest; fail-closed (401) quando não configurado\n- Tutor (F1): ativar mouse_control/keyboard_control/command_execution exige PIN\n  em set_permission, set_permission_group e grant_temporary_permission\n- Actions (F3): approve/reject com rate limit 20/min e 404 para proposta inexistente\n- Rate limits (F4): flashcards/planos de estudo 10/min, transcribe/speak 30/min,\n  audio stream 20/min, face present/recognize 30/min, register 10/min\n- Câmera (F2): GET /api/facial/list e DELETE /api/facial/{name} exigem permission camera\n- CSV injection (F5): _sanitize_csv escapa células iniciadas com =+-@ tab/CR;\n  filename de download sanitizado de ;\"\\ CR/LF\n- Screen (F6): shutil.which(''tesseract'') no lugar de os.popen; remove feed_streamer morto\n- Bind local: start.sh, install.sh e docker-compose publicam a API só em 127.0.0.1\n- Frontend: api.ts envia X-StudyAgent-Pin (sessionStorage) e PermissionsPanel pede\n  PIN antes de ativar permissões perigosas\n- README/.env.example: documentam STUDYAGENT_PIN e STUDYAGENT_HOST","tree":{"sha":"8a2f5d296f29fb6d72e22b1c028e844366fa6245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/8a2f5d296f29fb6d72e22b1c028e844366fa6245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/b8149f056e2aa91f1eb2f0253889ff5fff0b29fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verifi