tter":{"date":"2026-08-28T11:56:39Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"feat: complete vision system rewrite + screen capture fixes\n\nVision engine overhaul (planner, vision_router, screen):\n- Robust monitor discovery via xrandr (names, positions, virtual desktop geometry)\n- Automatic backend selection: cosmic-screenshot for Wayland/COSMIC, mss for X11\n- Human numbering (tela N) vs technical index (monitor N) support\n- Build black-image/black-capture rejection to avoid hallucinating on garbage\n- Full intent classification (error/code/exercise/read/question/describe)\n- Extended VISION_SYSTEM_PROMPT with strict format (O QUE VEJO/CONTEÚDO/ANÁLISE)\n- Detailed image notes + OCR as auxiliary evidence\n\nScreen capture:\n- Enable DISPLAY/WAYLAND env in systemd service (capture failed with\n  ''Cannot connect to display'')\n- Re-enable screen_capture/camera/file_access/internet/mouse/keyboard\n  permissions in config\n\nTests: update regressions to new vision behavior + fix registry ordering;\n408 backend + 18 frontend passing. Lint (ruff) + tsc clean.","tree":{"sha":"f1fc995af63176f0b4ed9d2926ee8a961b33d1d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/f1fc995af63176f0b4ed9d2926ee8a961b33d1d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/29a678176bf89eced318102520f7f27d266f9b88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","no