","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/a14cb9f07b07f7055343fc3208dbbb682fca19d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T03:50:21Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T03:50:21Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"feat: Agent Loop V2 + Observability + Evidence Panel + Exercise V2 + Permission V2 + Context V2 + Deployment + Integration Tests + Caching + RAG V2 + Keyboard Shortcuts\n\n- Agent Loop V2: per-tool circuit breakers, retry with exponential backoff (200/400ms), MAX_STEPS=5 anti-loop, structured logging per tool\n- Observability: structured_logging.py (request_id/session_id context vars), health.py (full_health_check with 6 components), chat.py request_id propagation\n- Evidence Panel: frontend panel showing intent, monitor, badges, OCR length, pipeline stages, issues, tools used\n- Exercise Engine V2: generate_adaptive(), generate_review(), get_weak_topics_exercises(), grade_and_track() with update_difficulty()\n- Permission System V2: audit log, PERMISSION_GROUPS, PERMISSION_HIERARCHY, set_group(), grant_temporary(), require_group()\n- Memory & Context V2: _estimate_tokens(), MAX_CONTEXT_CHARS=12000, _trim_history() in assemble() and assemble_vision()\n- Deployment Hardening: Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, nginx.conf, .env.example, env_validation.py\n- Integration Tests: 36 tests (E2E pipeline, tool execution, memory persistence, planner regression, vision pipeline regression)\n- Caching Layer: TTLCache with LRU eviction, OCR cache (128/2h), vision cache (64/30m), document cache (32/24h), health check integration\n- RAG V2: embedding cache, reranking with heading bonus, metadata per chunk, page_range filter, enhanced chunk_document()\n- Keyboard Shortcuts: Ctrl+Shift+E (evidence), Ctrl+Shift+S (screen), Ctrl+Shift+X (exercises), Ctrl+Shift+F (flashcards), Ctrl+Shift+L (live), Ctrl+Shift+H (health), Escape (close panels)\n\n387 tests passing | ruff clean (new code) | TypeScript strict","tree":{"sha":"2934a801720369c15554c13315d3686d57627769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/2934a801720369c15554c13315d3686d57627769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/a14cb9f07b07f7055343fc3208dbbb682fca19d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/a14cb9f07b07f7055343fc3208dbbb682fca19d9","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9o99oAKGExNGNiOWYwN2IwN2Y3MDU1MzQzZmMzMjA4ZGJiYjY4MmZjYTE5ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https: