ermission(), discover(), registry_summary()\n- Circuit Breaker: CLOSED→OPEN→HALF_OPEN→CLOSED with configurable thresholds\n- Agent Loop V2: Circuit breaker in _run_tool_loop, stats recording per tool call\n- Observability: GET /api/health (Ollama, Tesseract, SQLite, ScreenCapture, Registry)\n- Evidence Panel: EvidencePanel.tsx (intent, monitor, badges, OCR, pipeline, tools)\n- Structured Logging: request_id context propagation, StructuredLogger, Timing\n- Exercise Engine V2: generate_adaptive(), generate_review(), get_weak_topics()\n- Deployment: Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, frontend/Dockerfile, nginx.conf\n- Environment Validation: Python, Tesseract, Ollama, disk space, data dirs\n- Graceful Shutdown: startup/shutdown hooks, DB cleanup\n- Integration Tests: 36 new tests (E2E pipeline, regression, error recovery, smoke)\n- Total: 369 tests passing, TypeScript clean, Vite build OK","tree":{"sha":"95fc65059333f4f2b1653ada86cfca4b8aa018d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/95fc65059333f4f2b1653ada86cfca4b8aa018d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/3357f6f4bfbeea154fe03032c62fefeb838f30a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user