b.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"test: critical vision pipeline tests (sections 53-56)\n\n17 tests validating ''leia o monitor 2'' end-to-end:\n- Planner sets SCREEN_READ intent + monitor=2\n- Capture calls ScreenManager.capture_monitor(monitor_id=2)\n- Image bytes sent to LLM (not empty)\n- Response is NOT a greeting\n- VisionContext has image + OCR\n- System prompt is VISION_SYSTEM_PROMPT (not tutor)\n- Monitor 99 → error message\n- Failed capture → no content hallucination\n- Black image → error response\n- Code error (ZeroDivisionError) detected\n- Code read from screen\n- User message preserved in vision context","tree":{"sha":"4a788ad13c4dec5734e20ba99197236d23c9d808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/4a788ad13c4dec5734e20ba99197236d23c9d808"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/fa9eb178327201806ccd1c4a079c5b92d322f055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOAL