users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"feat(orchestrator): core infrastructure — errors, evidence, plan, context, executor, validator, policies\n\nPhase 2 of Professional Evolution V3:\n\n- orchestrator/errors.py: Error hierarchy (OrchestratorError, ToolError, CaptureError,\n  VisionError, OCRError, ModelError, ValidationError, PermissionError, TimeoutError,\n  MaxRetriesError, HallucinationError)\n- orchestrator/evidence.py: EvidenceStore with typed evidence (SCREEN, OCR, VISION,\n  WINDOW, INTENT, DOCUMENT, RAG, WEB, USER, TOOL), confidence tracking, timing\n- orchestrator/execution_plan.py: ExecutionPlan/ExecutionStep with dependency graph,\n  status lifecycle (PENDING→RUNNING→SUCCESS/FAILED/SKIPPED/CANCELLED)\n- orchestrator/execution_context.py: ExecutionContext tracking session, message, intent,\n  monitor, evidence, artifacts, tools_used, timestamps\n- orchestrator/executor.py: ToolExecutor with retry, permission checks, evidence collection\n- orchestrator/validator.py: ResponseValidator (hallucination detection, greeting-with-screen\n  detection, no-visual-pattern detection, confidence thresholding)\n- orchestrator/policies.py: ToolPolicy, RetryPolicy, TimeoutPolicy with defaults per tool\n- orchestrator/orchestrator.py: AgentOrchestrator main class\n- tests/test_orchestrator.py: 61 tests covering all components\n\n300 tests passing (239 existing + 61 new), ruff clean.","tree":{"sha":"ed79cb20b6a2324f85a04add7bf6401e4b453d1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/ed79cb20b6a2324f85a04add7bf6401e4b453d1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/791ab44509e65b1131474f5ac097c95d287ffe52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.