/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/fd20862925e25ccbafb30369282a8e0cd6d3c3ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T19:30:15Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T19:30:15Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"fix(vision): complete pipeline corrections - screen/camera separation, monitor validation, doc ordering\n\n- agent.py: remove screen_image param, analyze_screen() uses use_screen=True\n  instead of image_b64, _vision_pipeline passes user_question+intent to engine\n- planner.py: resolve doc_id BEFORE capture/whole_doc decisions (was always False)\n- vision/engine.py: process_capture() now accepts user_question and intent params\n- vision_router.py: VisionContext gains user_question, intent, prompt_context()\n- screen.py: remove min(max()) clamping - invalid monitor raises ValueError\n- chat.py: add screen_capture permission check for use_screen requests\n- llm.py: validate empty images, log model selection, check empty responses\n- frontend: api.ts camera_image field name\n\n239 tests passing, ruff clean.","tree":{"sha":"8ae9425eaa29e3b8ad6d5f41130d6414a4a65e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/8ae9425eaa29e3b8ad6d5f41130d6414a4a65e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/fd20862925e25ccbafb30369282a8e0cd6d3c3ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https