"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/00cf80dbaf668485a7bd59d504e4346ae243dfcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:53:24Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:53:24Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"refactor(vision): fix double vision call, align attribute names, clean duplicates\n\nIssues fixed:\n- VisionEngine.analyze() was calling LLM separately, then agent._run_tool_loop\n  called LLM again — image sent TWICE. Replaced with pure process_capture()\n  that does OCR + window detection without LLM calls.\n- ScreenCaptureResult: success→is_valid, VisionContext: pipeline_errors→errors\n- VisionRequest: monitor→monitor_id (consistent naming)\n- engine.py: removed unused imports, pure data processor only\n- screen.py: removed duplicate standalone functions, kept ScreenManager\n- Tests aligned to match actual attribute names\n- External test file fixed (wrong import paths, removed VisionEngine.analyze refs)\n\nTests: 239 passing, ruff clean","tree":{"sha":"2f04f767bd07efa113bae8adec312defb5840402","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/2f04f767bd07efa113bae8adec312defb5840402"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/00cf80dbaf668485a7bd59d504e4346ae243dfcb","verification":{"payload":nu