owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/fe203f890df5b332d5e8effdffbba73a8c87fa12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:10:56Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T17:10:56Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"fix(vision): architectural redesign - dedicated vision pipeline with structured objects\n\nROOT CAUSE FIX: System prompt never changed when images were present.\nThe model received the same 82-line tutor/socratic system prompt with\nan image attachment, causing it to default to greeting behavior.\n\nArchitectural changes:\n- VisionRequest: structured input for vision pipeline\n- ScreenCaptureResult: validated capture output\n- OCRResult: structured OCR with is_useful flag\n- VisionContext: complete visual context for tutor\n- VISION_SYSTEM_PROMPT: short, directive prompt that REPLACES the\n  generic tutor prompt when images are present (the actual fix)\n- detect_vision_intent(): regex-based intent detection (read/error/code/exercise)\n- _vision_pipeline(): dedicated capture→validate→OCR→context flow\n  with explicit pipeline stages and [VISION] logging\n- assemble_vision(): ContextManager method using vision system prompt\n- validate_capture(): ScreenManager validates image not None/black\n- read_text_structured(): OCR returns OCRResult instead of raw string\n- /api/screen/diagnostics: now runs actual capture/OCR/vision tests\n\nFiles changed:\n- vision_router.py: +198 lines (dataclasses, VISION_SYSTEM_PROMPT, intent detection)\n- agent.py: +143 lines (_vision_pipeline, dedicated vision flow)\n- context_manager.py: +61 lines (assemble_vision, _build_visual_context_block)\n- planner.py: +9 lines (vision_intent field, detect_vision_intent)\n- screen.py: +16 lines (validate_capture)\n- ocr.py: +13 lines (read_text_structured)\n- screen router: +39 lines (real diagnostics)\n- 3 test files: +239 lines (30+ new tests)\n\nTests: 234 passing, ruff clean","tree":{"sha":"820359fd2dbfdd6af170efaaa337ee446315457a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/820359fd2dbfdd6af170efaaa337ee446315457a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/fe203f890df5b332d5e8effdffbba73a8c87fa12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/fe203f890df5b332d5e8effdffbba73a8c87fa12","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9o99oAKGZlMjAzZjg5MGRmNWIzMzJkNWU4ZWZmZGZmYmJhNzNhOGM4N2ZhMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/586e906265bf78ecdce74f291d611910314ad6f0","sha":"586e906265bf78ecdce74f291d611910314ad6f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/586e906265bf78ecdce74f291d611910314ad6f0"}],"sha":"fe203f890df5b332d5e8effdffbba73a8c87fa12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/fe203f890df5b332d5e8effdffbba73a8c87fa12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/586e906265bf78ecdce74f291d611910314ad6f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:49:00Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:49:00Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"Vision Engine: deep pipeline fix for screen comprehension\n\nRoot cause: Pipeline technically works (image reaches qwen2.5vl:7b) but\nmodel was ignoring image and responding with generic greeting.\n\nChanges:\n\n1. System prompt (context_manager.py):\n   - Added REGRA #1 — IMAGEM TEM PRIORIDADE ABSOLUTA with explicit\n     step-by-step instructions for visual analysis\n   - Includes correct/incorrect response examples\n   - Forces model to LOOK at image before any text response\n\n2. Image note (vision_router.py):\n   - New format: [CONTEÚDO VISUAL DA TELA — ANALISE ANTES DE RESPONDER]\n   - Explicit mandatory 3-step instructions: look, identify, respond\n   - Specific guidance for exercises, errors, code, text\n   - Explicit ''NÃO dê saudação'' instruction\n\n3. Diagnostic logging (agent.py):\n   - [VISION] logs at each pipeline step: intent, capture, OCR, model\n   - Tracks monitor, resolution, OCR length, response length\n\n4. Diagnostics endpoint (screen.py):\n   - GET /api/screen/diagnostics returns:\n     - monitor count and list\n     - OCR availability\n     - Vision model name\n     - Ollama availability\n     - Vision model test (sends test image)\n     - Permission status\n\n5. Listener (listener.py):\n   - Detects screen-related keywords and sends use_screen=true\n   - Monitors: tela, monitor, screen, ler, exercício, questão, etc.\n\n6. Tests updated for new image note format\n\n201 tests passing, ruff clean, tsc clean","tree":{"sha":"589cbdbf3254f603aeb275d5ca66d9b405b0cec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/589cbdbf3254f603aeb275d5ca66d9b405b0cec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/586e906265bf78ecdce74f291d611910314ad6f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsi