}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/6f3887d5c2f3be43b34d806e196d0103dc0165fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:38:01Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:38:01Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"Fix: screen comprehension and exercise resolution via voice\n\nProblem: voice commands like ''ler a tela 2'' triggered generic greeting\ninstead of analyzing screen content and solving exercises.\n\nRoot causes:\n1. System prompt had weak CONTEXTO VISUAL section + MENSAGENS CURTAS\n   overrode screen analysis when wake word detected\n2. Image note format was passive (''responda com base na imagem'')\n3. Listener didn''t send use_screen=true for screen-related keywords\n\nChanges:\n- context_manager.py: Replaced CONTEXTO VISUAL + MENSAGENS CURTAS with\n  comprehensive ''IMPORTANTE — SE HOUVER IMAGEM'' section that:\n  - Makes image PRIORIDADE ABSOLUTA over any greeting\n  - Explicitly instructs exercise resolution workflow\n  - Requires reading full problem, identifying subject, analyzing alternatives\n  - Guides Socratic approach for screen content\n- vision_router.py: Image note now states PRIORIDADE MÁXIMA with\n  mandatory instructions for exercise/text/graph/code analysis\n- listener.py: Detects screen keywords (tela, monitor, exercicio, questao,\n  resolve, subject names) and sends use_screen=true to API\n- Tests updated for new image note format\n\n201 tests passing, ruff clean","tree":{"sha":"5a83df1837dbdcc617241cb6b40aae05d9daca02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/5a83df1837dbdcc617241cb6b40aae05d9daca02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/6f3887d5c2f3be43b34d806e196d0103dc0165fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/6f3887d5c2f3be43b34d806e196d0103dc0165fa","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9o99oAKDZmMzg4N2Q1YzJmM2JlNDNiMzRkODA2ZTE5NmQwMTAzZGMwMTY1ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/cf4f561f47f1a3a531a5a24686dec6be3bfaaa9e"