i.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commits/9ba9bf35c1abe21a6f4a5aae75ceaf44c0f54694/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T13:12:34Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T13:12:34Z","email":"ANTONIOALGMAR@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ANTONIOALGMAR"},"message":"Phase 10: Product infrastructure — install, doctor, start/stop, update, backup\n\nShell scripts for complete product lifecycle:\n\ninstall.sh:\n- Full installation: Python venv, npm, Ollama models, systemd services\n- Pre-requisite checks with clear error messages\n- Creates data directories and systemd unit files\n\ndoctor.sh:\n- Health check: system tools, backend, frontend, services, ports\n- Color-coded output (pass/warn/fail)\n- Checks SQLite table count, model availability, HTTP health\n\nstart.sh / stop.sh:\n- Service management: systemd preferred, direct process fallback\n- Ollama auto-start, API readiness check\n- PID file management for direct process mode\n\nupdate.sh:\n- Git pull + automatic backup before update\n- Dependency updates for both backend and fro