eak_14, topics_20, all_strong\n- level_estudante, level_graduado, level_especialista, level_mestre\n\nLeaderboard:\n- Total XP, weekly XP, achievements, streak, topics mastered\n- Recent activity feed with XP sources\n\nIntegration:\n- grade_and_track() awards exercise XP automatically\n- review_card() awards flashcard XP automatically\n- Frontend StatsPanel: level bar with progress visualization\n\n201 tests passing, ruff clean, tsc clean","tree":{"sha":"e73916e40e8daa0411616f2d6111cded72e39db2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/e73916e40e8daa0411616f2d6111cded72e39db2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/390dc55671174dd6d8bfe1720d107c766ea3c20b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/commit/390dc55671174dd6d8bfe1720d107c766ea3c20b","node_id":"C_kwDOUA9o99oAKDM5MGRjNTU2NzExNzRkZDZkOGJ