le with difficulty, timestamps, weighted scores\n- calculate_weighted_score() with 4 factors (difficulty 30%, consistency 25%, recency 25%, volume 20%)\n- update_from_exercise() and update_from_flashcard_review() persist to topic_results\n- classify_topics/suggest_review/all_mastery use weighted_score\n- Rolling window eviction of old topic_results in advanced_profile\n\nPhase 4 - Smart Tutor:\n- Socratic system prompt (default mode asks questions before giving answers)\n- 6 explicit modes: tutor, professor, exercicios, revisao, resumo, simples\n- student_dashboard() for concise summary injected into system prompt\n- Contextual awareness: references previous screens, weak topics, recent exercises\n\nPhase 5 - Integrated Learning:\n- error_notebook table and error_notebook.py module\n- Auto-log wrong answers from grade_and_track()\n- Pipeline: errors -> flashcards via generate_from_errors()\n- 5 new router endpoints for error notebook CRUD\n- Mastery hint in study plans with error context\n\nPhase 7 - Enhanced Dashboard:\n- mastery_by_subject(), weekly_summary(), error_summary()\n- enhanced_dashboard() combining all stats\n- New router endpoints for enhanced data\n- Frontend StatsPanel: mastery bars, weekly summary, error notebook stats\n- Phase 7 CSS for mastery bars, warning cards, section headers\n\nCentralized DB (Phase 2): app/db.py with WAL mode, thread-local connections\nTest fixtures centralized via _MODULES_USING_DB list\n187 tests passing, ruff clean, tsc clean","tree":{"sha":"817c47d9eeb56546e120aa7d58a564112fadbb8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/817c47d9eeb56546e120aa7d58a564112fadbb8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/8f5bea0ad8b48b99d4fbca73687d7adbde92c382","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.githu