s há 3+ dias), profile_insights\n- Integração automática: exercises.grade_and_track() atualiza mastery\n  ao corrigir; flashcard review atualiza mastery do deck topic\n- context_manager: injeta perfil +weak topics no system prompt do agente\n- frontend ProfilePanel: formulário de perfil + análise visual (pontos\n  fracos/fortes/sugestões) com cores semânticas\n\nP7 — Automação com confirmação:\n- backend/app/tutor/automation.py: proposta de ação (5 tipos válidos),\n  approve/reject com histórico, prompt de propostas injetado no agente\n- frontend ActionConfirm: barra flutuante com propostas pendentes,\n  botões ✓ executar / ✕ recusar\n- 108 testes passando (18 novos: profile, mastery, automation)\n- TypeScript + ruff limpos","tree":{"sha":"2ca26d1ca1cf2b43ed0874f3321bb132b8baa98c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/trees/2ca26d1ca1cf2b43ed0874f3321bb132b8baa98c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ANTONIOALGMAR/StudyAgent/git/commits/590d644e4992341416d6c48f3a805e4d909527da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86206750?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ANTONIOALGMAR","id":86206750,"login":"ANTONIOALGMAR","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjA2NzUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ANTONIOALGMAR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu