_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claudioed","id":4073304,"login":"claudioed","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzMzMDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/facility-layout/commits/d75cca4fbb7c822fbacd28a5dbc855b9160328af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:17:02Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:17:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(events): move JSON wire shape out of domain events into adapter DTOs (tier-2 1a) (#150)\n\n* test(events): pin byte-exact wire golden files before moving JSON shape to adapters\n\nCaptured from the domain events'' own struct-tag serialisation (pre-refactor): full CloudEvent bytes for every event type on both streams, plus the LogPublisher payload.\n\n* refactor(events): move JSON wire shape from domain events to adapter DTOs\n\nDomain events in internal/domain/shared lose every json tag; cloudevents.WireData maps each event to an adapter-owned DTO with the same field names and order. Used by the integration + analytics publishers (and therefore the outbox) and the log publisher. Wire bytes are unchanged: the golden files captured before the refactor still pass byte-for-byte.\n\n* test(architecture): forbid json/db struct tags in internal/domain\n\nFitness sensor over non-test files under internal/domain/** (comment lines skipped, empty explicit allowlist) with bad/good fixture test.\n\n* test(events): extract golden helpers to satisfy gocognit","tree":{"sha":"a40411c101822ed8308f6376be3ae9a4cc803341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/facility-layout/git/trees/a40411c101822ed8308f6376be3ae9a4cc803341"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/facility-layout/git/commits/d75cca4fbb7c822fbacd28a5dbc855b9160328af","verification":{"payload":"tree a40411c101822ed8308f6376be3ae9a4cc803341\nparent ca2b6ecdb352ba67fc19b1aa03028f9de819ab03\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791289022 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791289022 -0300\n\nrefactor(events): move JSON wire shape out of domain events into adapter DTOs (tier-2 1a) (#150)\n\n* test(events): pin byte-exact wire golden files before moving JSON shape to adapters\n\nCaptured from the domain events'' own struct-tag serialisation (pre-refactor): full CloudEvent bytes for every event type on both streams, plus the LogPublisher payload.\n\n* refactor(events): move JSON wire shape from domain events to adapter DTOs\n\nDomain events in internal/domain/shared lose every json tag; cloudevents.WireData maps each event to an adapter-owned DTO with the same field names and order. Used by the integration + analytics publishers (and therefore the outbox) and the log publisher. Wire bytes are unchanged: the golden files captured before the refactor still pass byte-for-byte.\n\n* test(architecture): forbid json/db struct tags in internal/domain\n\nFitness sensor over non-test files under internal/domain/** (comment lines skipped, empty explicit allowlist) with bad/good fixture test.\n\n* test(events): extract golden helpers to satisfy gocognit","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxOa+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJx8QAKa3M5Xjxf1ps0Cz2YDyqE64\numcMcek6RZWzcYI4VvmVzpH4N6H+QR550Cj0SGWR0cFAOURko7Q3xfTEvzfP7hM4\n/FJK5rNWMzEVegxGt7lDeSmD