":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/e01cc0094e61bb1acd05a89d0890562c6194ffca","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGUwMWNjMDA5NGU2MWJiMWFjZDA1YTg5ZDA4OTA1NjJjNjE5NGZmY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/732d2499d101779b299112a2316e849574c3c322","sha":"732d2499d101779b299112a2316e849574c3c322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/732d2499d101779b299112a2316e849574c3c322"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/ea980057c8308010db82f230c6a2fb1613f805cb","sha":"ea980057c8308010db82f230c6a2fb1613f805cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/ea980057c8308010db82f230c6a2fb1613f805cb"}],"sha":"e01cc0094e61bb1acd05a89d0890562c6194ffca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/e01cc0094e61bb1acd05a89d0890562c6194ffca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/ea980057c8308010db82f230c6a2fb1613f805cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:20:02Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T09:20:02Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"bench: cover the wire, the SDK and the 0.3.0 knobs; re-measure the README\n\nThe suite stopped at 15 files while 0.2.0 and 0.3.0 added remote clients,\nthe wire envelope, requests across a transport, the SDK and two perf knobs\nwhose whole point is what they cost. Six scenarios for exactly that:\n\n  16  request() to a remote and from a remote, against a local one\n  17  buildFrame / parseFrame — the per-frame ingress tax\n  18  deep-freeze in place vs payloads: ''clone''\n  19  maxBytes measured by the runtime vs reported by the transport\n  20  the SDK''s lazy client — queue at 0/1/16/64 and flush\n  21  a state topic''s retained value on subscribe\n\n19 is the one worth knowing: maxBytes is free when the transport reports\nthe frame size (WebSocket, SSE) and costs ~15x on a 4 KB frame when it does\nnot (postMessage, MessagePort, BroadcastChannel), because the runtime then\nhas to measure the frame itself.\n\nTwo traps the new files had to sidestep, written down in benchmarks/README\nso the next case does not fall into them: re-emitting one already-frozen\nobject makes ''freeze'' look free, and a setTimeout in the measured path\ncosts ~1.3 ms and buries anything at us scale.\n\nThe published numbers were stale, and two were wrong in kind rather than\nin magnitude: \"p99 500 ns\" was the p50 (the p99 is 1.33 us), and the\nDevTools-shape observer costs ~2% of throughput, not \"< 1%\". Re-measured\neverything as the median of three runs and said so, with the date and the\nmachine, so the next reader can tell what the numbers refer to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bc6b0110e298c7a5de6f46a098930d7b3303d80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/1bc6b0110e298c7a5de6f46a098930d7b3303d80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/ea980057c8308010db82f230c6a2fb1613f805cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/ea980057c8308010db82f230c6a2fb1613f805cb","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGVhOTgwMDU3YzgzMDgwMTBkYjgyZjIzMGM2YTJmYjE2MTNmODA1Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/a97f2b9192020db0aec36cc6e946bdc70d926cc9","sha":"a97f2b9192020db0aec36cc6e946bdc70d926cc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/a97f2b9192020db0aec36cc6e946bdc70d926cc9"}],"sha