github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c1bd818103e5daa17d2b13661ddbaab99b342c3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:41:16Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:45:10Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"stand: cart stores in different tabs converge\n\nEach tab runs its own cart-store. A snapshot from another tab reached\nthe UI (it subscribes to cart.snapshot.v1 from anyone) but never the\nstore, so the second tab showed the cart and could not change it:\nremove answered removed: false and nothing moved. The same gap made a\nfreshly opened tab''s empty boot snapshot wipe the other tab''s picture.\n\nThe snapshot carries updatedAt (Unix ms, 0 for the boot state). The\nstore subscribes to cart.snapshot.v1 and, for frames from other tabs\n(fromExternal): newer → adopt and re-emit with the same updatedAt;\nolder → re-emit the current cart (how a new tab picks it up); equal →\nnothing, which ends the exchange. Concurrent edits in two tabs stay\nlast-write-wins, as remotes.ts already said.\n\ne2e: the cross-tab test now removes in the second tab and checks both,\nand opens a third tab to prove nothing is wiped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0899d3bbbb921eef434bed3187a1eabb346ba3d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/0899d3bbbb921eef434bed3187a1eabb346ba3d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/c1bd818103e5daa17d2b13661ddbaab99b342c3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/c1bd818103e5daa17d2b13661ddbaab99b342c3e","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGMxYmQ4MTgxMDNlNWRhYTE3ZDJiMTM2NjFkZGJhYWI5OWIzNDJjM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/ccf434bea4795d9e1f5bab4e24feab731a6c6040","sha":"ccf434bea4795d9e1f5bab4e24feab731a6c6040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/ccf434bea4795d9e1f5bab4e24feab731a6c6040"}],"sha":"c1bd818103e5daa17d2b13661ddbaab99b342c3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c1bd818103e5daa17d2b13661ddbaab99b342c3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/4c767036d5f5d6422e3780b2857435f75c1fd6cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:25:35Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:25:35Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"docs: first-paint wording qualified, no hard-coded versions, link-only API index\n\n- React/Vue: \"retained value before first paint\" holds when the runtime\n  is already there at mount; a lazy client (module scope, before\n  initBroker) delivers it when it binds. Said so in the hook docs, the\n  READMEs and the root package table.\n- SECURITY.md and the spec headers named 0.1.1; versions now come from\n  npm and the changelogs, the spec says \"since 0.2.0\" once.\n- docs/content/api is an index of links; the export lists it repeated\n  had already drifted from index.ts.\n- Changeset for the review fixes (broker, client minor; create-registry,\n  react, vue patch) and the CHANGELOG entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdf492546396f5a7cb12b245831ad86b356a84c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/cdf492546396f5a7cb12b245831ad86b356a84c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/4c767036d5f5d6422e3780b2857435f75c1fd6cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/4c767036d5f5d6422e3780b2857435f75c1fd6cf","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDRjNzY3MDM2ZDVmNWQ2NDIyZTM3ODBiMjg1NzQzNWY3NWMxZmQ2Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8","sha":"d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8"}],"sha":"4c767036d5f5d6422e3780b2857435f75c1fd6cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/4c767036d5f5d6422e3780b2857435f75c1fd6cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:23:53Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:23:53Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"create-registry: codegen reads contract fields from the TypeScript AST\n\nname, kind, response and retention were scraped with line-based regexes\nover the whole file, so a payload type with its own `kind:` or\n`response:` field on a separate line broke the build (unknown kind, or\n\"response is only meaningful on a request\"). The generator now parses\nthe file with the TypeScript compiler (already a dependency of every\nregistry) and reads only the top-level properties of `export default\n{ ... }`, unwrapping satisfies / as const. Validation messages are\nunchanged; the demo registry regenerates byte-for-byte.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b05ff0462be991df89e6a8887b1a67ab480bb8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/2b05ff0462be991df89e6a8887b1a67ab480bb8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGQ2YmI3YTViYjhhZDlmNzFjNWExNDY4OTkwYmFkODc4YTQzYzI5Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7","sha":"0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7"}],"sha":"d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/d6bb7a5bb8ad9f71c5a1468990bad878a43c29f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:23:53Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:23:53Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"broker: on() takes exact topic names; payloads: ''clone'' option\n\n- A wildcard in on() was half-supported: replay matched history by\n  pattern, but the subscription index is keyed by exact name, so nothing\n  ever arrived live. Both the runtime and the lazy client now refuse a\n  pattern with a TypeError; patterns stay where they work — accepts /\n  forward on remote clients and hooks.\n- Freezing in place stays the default (no copy on the hot path) and is\n  now stated on emit() itself, not only in deepFreeze''s source. Hosts\n  that prefer to pay for a copy set initBroker({ payloads: ''clone'' }):\n  the payload goes through structuredClone before the freeze, the\n  emitter''s object is untouched, and a payload structuredClone cannot\n  copy is answered NACK SERIALIZATION_FAILED (log: emit.payload.not_cloneable).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4133d8793371d2be10a1974fe4119efecb855ca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/4133d8793371d2be10a1974fe4119efecb855ca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDBjOTZkOWUyZjExNGMxNmZmOGFmOGFkMWViNjRjMGQwMGRjMzM3Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb","sha":"fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb"}],"sha":"0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/0c96d9e2f114c16ff8af8ad1eb64c0d00dc337b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:20:05Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:20:05Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"client: never throw at module scope on a stale runtime; whenRuntimeReady rejects; isolated bind\n\n- createClient threw RUNTIME_TOO_OLD synchronously when the host''s\n  runtime was older than the SDK — at module scope that is a crash at\n  import time. It now returns a blocked lazy client: on() records\n  nothing, emit()/request() answer NACK RUNTIME_TOO_OLD (new routing\n  reason), the reason is logged once. A lazy client that was waiting and\n  then sees a too-old runtime blocks itself the same way and settles its\n  queue. getRuntime() and createRemoteClient() still throw.\n- whenRuntimeReady() threw synchronously in the \"runtime already there\n  but too old\" branch; the README promised a rejection and both adapters\n  rely on it. It rejects now.\n- LazyClient.#tryBind: an onSubscribe rejection on one subscription\n  aborted the loop and left the emit/request queue stuck forever. Each\n  subscription binds in isolation; a rejected one is dropped with a\n  console line (the runtime has already published subscription.rejected),\n  the rest bind and the queue flushes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f686fcd00ac20fa8a811dcf8083e57540460352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/1f686fcd00ac20fa8a811dcf8083e57540460352"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGZlOGNjYzAyYzg5NzAzNmI2MDA0YThkYTgwNzIyODgyZWU2ZTU3ZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26","sha":"1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26"}],"sha":"fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/fe8ccc02c897036b6004a8da80722882ee6e57eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:17:33Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:17:33Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"broker: maxBytes for every transport, request deadline enforced, send failures surface\n\n- maxBytes never fired: the check wanted a string, but every built-in\n  transport hands the runtime a parsed object. Text transports (WebSocket,\n  SSE) now report the wire length alongside the frame (TransportFrameMeta\n  in the onMessage callback, optional second argument, so custom\n  transports are unaffected); structured-clone transports are measured as\n  JSON text, only when the limit is configured.\n- An inbound request''s deadline was carried and parsed but never applied,\n  so a hung local handler kept the request pending forever. The budget is\n  deadline − timestamp (a duration in the sender''s clock, immune to clock\n  offset) and is passed to the pipeline as the request timeout; a frame\n  whose deadline had already passed is answered NACK TIMEOUT without\n  running the handler.\n- WebSocket, postMessage and BroadcastChannel transports logged send\n  failures to the console and returned, so remote.send.failed could never\n  fire for them. They now throw (the runtime reports TRANSPORT_THREW);\n  send after destroy stays a silent no-op as the conformance kit demands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"378622a04a73583d65fda3f409e18f63138b87c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/378622a04a73583d65fda3f409e18f63138b87c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDE5NjBhM2EzZGJiZjE4NjRmMzFjN2I4NmJjMjAzZDU1MmZhZDFhMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/ccf434bea4795d9e1f5bab4e24feab731a6c6040","sha":"ccf434bea4795d9e1f5bab4e24feab731a6c6040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/ccf434bea4795d9e1f5bab4e24feab731a6c6040"}],"sha":"1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/1960a3a3dbbf1864f31c7b86bc203d552fad1a26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/f1309406f2bb499dcc0f662dc821fcacd5b5964e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:57:19Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:57:19Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"docs: root README shows the React and Vue adapters; lighter quickstart\n\nA reader could not tell from the README that hooks existed: every\nexample was the plain SDK. Under the single-API example there are now\ntwo collapsible blocks, React and Vue, with the same scenario as the\nTypeScript one and a link to each package README.\n\nThe quickstart is rewritten to be read in one go: install lines, the\nhost in three lines, a module in seven, the same module as React hooks\nin nine, then four bullets with links (boot order, adapters, contracts\nregistry, DevTools). The DevTools mounting code and the long paragraph\nabout boot order and remotes are gone from it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffaa59a5a607c4156fd76b402c6160e088a87711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/ffaa59a5a607c4156fd76b402c6160e088a87711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/f1309406f2bb499dcc0f662dc821fcacd5b5964e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedw