followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c936d2bad211a06a075e279f598d47369f034a6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:35:12Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:35:26Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"docs: registry template, stand README, guides\n\ncreate-registry README and the registry README template (Russian):\nTopicContract with kind, retention on events (rules, generated\nTOPIC_KINDS entry shape), createClient<Topic, TopicPayloads,\nTopicContracts> from @hedwigjs/client, initBroker({ topics }) as the\nwhole host setup, DevTools mounted as a component. The stand''s\ncontracts README now describes this registry (16 topics, 5 domains,\nwhat retains) instead of a stale copy of the template with a\nnon-existent mountDevTools. Stand README: MFEs on @hedwigjs/client and\nbound hooks, cart snapshot as state, late mount via useStateTopic,\nremote-request-demo, retention on the stand, e2e, restart:demo,\ndeploy paths, DevTools behind the FAB. CONTRIBUTING: 6 MFEs, stop and\nrestart scripts. Guides: bring-your-own-contracts on three generics and\nTopicContract, contract-based-topics with retention, index lists what\nis documented next to the code; demo-architecture.md retired to a\npointer. Shipped empty index.generated.ts matches the codegen; stale\ncode comments (late mount, ai-chat, topicsRegistry) fixed.\n\nVerified: link checker (0 broken), stale-phrase grep, create-registry\nCLI scaffolded in /tmp with an event that declares retention — codegen\nand tsc clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d360c158f2ddec70f80e6da22e0d47f69537ec8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/0d360c158f2ddec70f80e6da22e0d47f69537ec8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/c936d2bad211a06a075e279f598d47369f034a6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/c936d2bad211a06a075e279f598d47369f034a6d","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGM5MzZkMmJhZDIxMWEwNmEwNzVlMjc5ZjU5OGQ0NzM2OWYwMzRhNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c","sha":"b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c"}],"sha":"c936d2bad211a06a075e279f598d47369f034a6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c936d2bad211a06a075e279f598d47369f034a6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:34:50Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:34:50Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"docs: root README, doc indexes, RFC statuses\n\nRoot README: three topic kinds with contract-declared retention (no\nhistory flag), modules import createClient from @hedwigjs/client with\nthree generics, request answers on .data, package table with the\nschema and conformance subpaths, stand tables complete (late-mount,\nremote-request-demo, tabs remote, checkout iframe owner), stop:demo\nports, deploy trigger paths, Development section (scripts, CI), layout\ntree with client/react/vue, roadmap replaced by status.\npackages/README: adapter roadmap removed. Introduction: DevTools is\npublished, remote clients instead of adapters, SDK split and kinds.\nAPI index: real packages and spec pages (no @hedwigjs/registry, no\nadapters). RFC index and RFC-0003: Implemented; remote.destroyed,\nresponse.sent, state.retained; steps 8–10 landed. RFC-0001/0002 carry\nsuperseded pointers. SECURITY: supported versions and threat model link.\nCHANGELOG: docs entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37fb948ed2f31c9f4fa94330d35e623158af1a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/37fb948ed2f31c9f4fa94330d35e623158af1a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGIwNTAwMDE2NWFlNzM3NjY0OTQ1MjE2NzhhYzAyZTRmNDExMjk4MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120","sha":"3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120"}],"sha":"b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/b05000165ae73766494521678ac02e4f4112980c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:34:50Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:34:50Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"docs: package references rewritten against the code\n\nBroker README: quickstart shows the host/module split (initBroker with\nTOPIC_KINDS, createClient<T, P, C> from @hedwigjs/client); new \"Host and\nmodules\" section (runtime handle, LazyClient, RUNTIME_* errors, Module\nFederation does not share the broker); createClient is not idempotent —\nonConflict documented; the MF singleton/requiredVersion advice is gone;\nBrokerConfig, SubscriptionOptions (retained), full RoutingReason (15) and\nsystem-event (17) tables, Inspector methods, wire exports, RemoteClient\nmembers; retention section kept as written for the contract model.\n\nClient README: every export and error code, three generics, adapters.\nDevTools README: five tabs, explicit system-event subscriptions (no\nonAny/wildcards), enabled defaults to false (no NODE_ENV), pills (kind,\nvia, retained, trace), TopicContractInfo.kind, React 18/19.\nReact/Vue READMEs: RequestHandle/BoundHooks names, MaybeRefOrGetter,\nVue lifecycle rules. Benchmarks README: dead legacy section removed.\nSpec: capabilities include wire.v1 and remote.requests; ingress order;\nreal version numbers. Changesets README: ignore list, provenance, build\nbefore a manual publish.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6931c4e11132a6223542fcdbef3cc1c7071e8d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/6931c4e11132a6223542fcdbef3cc1c7071e8d23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDNjMzIwNzljMzljOGM0ZDJjNTE3OGUwMGEzMDRhZDRiYjExOWIxMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913","sha":"7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913"}],"sha":"3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/3c32079c39c8c4d2c5178e00a304ad4bb119b120"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:14:36Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T15:14:36Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"retention declared in the contract; per-topic buffers; emit flag removed\n\nWhat a topic keeps for late subscribers is a property of the topic, so it\nlives in its contract: an event may declare `retention: { last: N }`,\na `state` topic keeps its last value. The registry''s TOPIC_KINDS carries\nit, initBroker({ topics: TOPIC_KINDS }) is all a host does. This replaces\nboth the per-emit `history: true` flag (the producer is the wrong place\nto decide, and a forgotten flag left the buffer silently empty) and the\nshort-lived \"record everything\" default (a shared ring where chatty\ntopics evicted the useful ones).\n\nbroker\n- MessageHistory: one bounded buffer per retaining topic; amortised O(1)\n  record; state buffers ignore enabled/maxPerTopic/ttl; getStats() lists\n  every declared topic with limit and fill (RetentionInfo)\n- BrokerConfig.history is host caps only: enabled (default true),\n  maxPerTopic, ttl; topics accepts kind | { kind, retention }\n- retention ignores origin: a frame from a remote client is retained like\n  a local emit, for events and state alike; retained state now lives in\n  the same per-topic buffer (one mechanism, different numbers)\n- replay on a topic that retains nothing logs broker.replay.no_retention\n- MessageOptions.history removed (client); TopicPolicy exported\n- benchmarks 09/10 measure the new model (10 was broken since step 6)\n\ncreate-registry\n- TopicContract: retention?: { last: number } on events; TopicPolicy;\n  codegen validates (no retention on requests, state is last: 1) and\n  emits { kind, retention } entries into TOPIC_KINDS\n\ndevtools\n- Replay Buffer renders the declared table: topic · kind · count of limit,\n  entries underneath; empty only when no contract declares retention\n\nstand\n- notification.show.v1 keeps 10, chat.message-sent.v1 and\n  chat.reply-completed.v1 keep 50; shell passes TOPIC_KINDS only;\n  e2e asserts a WebSocket frame is retained and the DevTools table\n\ndocs touched: broker README (history section, config block, quickstart),\nspec delivery-semantics (retention), guide, client/devtools READMEs,\nchangeset (supersedes history-default-on), CHANGELOG\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"263fa0de6e35c1fb2b181cfd8d144caa4e21ff0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/263fa0de6e35c1fb2b181cfd8d144caa4e21ff0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDdiMTg4OGU5NWY2NTRjYjYwNzYwMTFjODNhYmQ2ZTE2MmFiZjk5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0","sha":"1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0"}],"sha":"7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/7b1888e95f654cb6076011c83abd6e162abf9913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:33:38Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:33:38Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"react, vue: bindHooks / bindComposables — hooks with the client filled in\n\nA module that owns one client for its whole lifetime creates it once at\nmodule scope; passing it to every hook was noise. bindHooks(client)\n(React) and bindComposables(client) (Vue) close over the client and\nreturn useTopic / useStateTopic / useRequest without the first argument.\nPlain partial application; the contract-driven types are unchanged, the\nreturned members are real hooks.\n\n- new `packages/react/src/bindHooks.ts`, `BoundHooks` type; Vue\n  `bindComposables`, `BoundComposables`\n- tests for both; READMEs get a \"skip the client argument\" section\n- stand: cart, menu and notifications MFEs export bound hooks from\n  `clients/bus.ts`; LateMountDemo and RemoteRequestDemo keep useClient\n  to show the component-owned path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b8df83dacd724c8818b0fc27d4c57cb9010fac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/1b8df83dacd724c8818b0fc27d4c57cb9010fac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDFhOGQ2MGFlMTE3MGNkYjI3NzFjOWYxNDg2MWQxYzAwYTczYzI5ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede","sha":"90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede"}],"sha":"1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/1a8d60ae1170cdb2771c9f14861d1c00a73c29f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:28:19Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:28:19Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"broker: history records every multicast event by default\n\nThe buffer used to keep only messages emitted with `history: true`.\nAfter the move to `state` topics no emit site on the stand set the\nflag, so the DevTools Replay Buffer tab was always empty even with\nhistory enabled in initBroker — the flag was a footgun, not a feature.\n\n- `history.enabled` now records every local multicast event; requests\n  and frames from remote clients are still never recorded\n- `history: false` keeps a single message out of the buffer;\n  `history: true` is still accepted and is now the default\n- tests: default recording, opt-out, late subscriber replays unflagged\n  events; DevTools empty-state hint and broker README updated\n- stand: `stop:demo` also frees port 3006 (analytics survived it)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31a4a48dddec66f2ae765568fee7bc22cca2445f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/31a4a48dddec66f2ae765568fee7bc22cca2445f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDkwMjMwZWUwMjQxZGNjYmRmOGMxMjBiYWUyOWZhOGRkYWJkNTZlZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab","sha":"40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab"}],"sha":"90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/90230ee0241dccbdf8c120bae29fa8ddabd56ede"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:05:14Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T14:05:14Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"devtools: support React 18 as well as 19\n\nThe panel''s sources only ever needed React 18 (useSyncExternalStore,\ncreateContext), but the webpack externals listed bare `react` and\n`react-dom` only, so `react/jsx-runtime` was inlined from the React\ninstalled at build time (19). A React 18 host then crashed at first\nrender with \"Cannot read properties of null (reading ''useMemo'')\" — two\nReact copies in one tree. Every react/* and react-dom/* request is now\nan external and resolves to the host''s copy.\n\n- peerDependencies: react / react-dom \"^18.2.0 || ^19.0.0\"\n- packages/devtools/react18-smoke: standalone project (own lockfile,\n  excluded from workspaces so it can hold React 18.3 next to the\n  workspace''s React 19) that renders the built bundle under React 18\n  in jsdom with a clean-console guard; wired into the root `npm test`\n- changesets ignore @hedwig-internal/*; README, CONTRIBUTING, CHANGELOG\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5325100362cc7b35d5689738bd458eab259efa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/c5325100362cc7b35d5689738bd458eab259efa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKDQwNzgwYjZkZTZiMWE2MmM1NGYxM2RhYjU5OTBiNzU4YmMzNWEzYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc","sha":"c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc"}],"sha":"40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/40780b6de6b1a62c54f13dab5990b758bc35a3ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:51:06Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:51:06Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"ci: build/typecheck/test/e2e workflow, provenance on publish, governance minimum (step 10)\n\n- .github/workflows/ci.yml: build in dependency order, npm run typecheck\n  across every workspace, unit suites, stale-codegen check for the\n  contracts registry, Playwright stand suite (report uploaded on\n  failure), changeset check on pull requests.\n- release.yml: builds all public packages, runs unit tests, publishes with\n  npm provenance (NPM_CONFIG_PROVENANCE + OIDC id-token). deploy-stand.yml\n  builds client and react too and triggers on their paths.\n- Governance: CODEOWNERS, pull-request checklist, Dependabot (npm weekly,\n  actions monthly), .nvmrc (22), CONTRIBUTING.md rewritten with the\n  everyday commands, contract/codegen rule, changesets and release rules;\n  .changeset/README lists all six packages; CI badge in the README.\n- Root scripts: typecheck (every workspace). Verified locally: typecheck\n  clean, 628 unit tests + 7 backend tests green, codegen fresh, changeset\n  status lists all six packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c24dc74f419e495624d4645f9d9197df4baf473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/5c24dc74f419e495624d4645f9d9197df4baf473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUBQ29toAKGM2NzIzZjkzN2JlMzhkY2I5MDI5YTlhMGMyOGZmYmRlMDkwMzExZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hedwigjs/hedwig/commit/12d5dedc952abac3a506f2b23ed9c6d607436b1d","sha":"12d5dedc952abac3a506f2b23ed9c6d607436b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/12d5dedc952abac3a506f2b23ed9c6d607436b1d"}],"sha":"c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/c6723f937be38dcb9029a9a0c28ffbde090311dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pipinov","id":790368,"login":"pipinov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDM2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/commits/12d5dedc952abac3a506f2b23ed9c6d607436b1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:48:10Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T13:48:10Z","email":"alexpipinov@gmail.com","name":"alexpipinov"},"message":"feat(broker,demo): transport conformance kit and Playwright e2e for the stand (step 9)\n\n@hedwigjs/broker/conformance: transportConformance(factory) returns\nframework-agnostic { name, run } cases — capability flags, ready, envelope\nround trip, ordering of a 25-frame burst, reverse direction when duplex,\ninbound-only send is a no-op, unsubscribe stops delivery, idempotent\ndestroy, onClose on close(); createMemoryTransportPair() as the reference.\nBuilt as a second tsup entry (dist/conformance). The built-in MessagePort,\nBroadcastChannel and WebSocket (ws server + our transport on both ends)\ntransports pass it in the broker suite (38 cases); a reordering and a\nnon-destroying transport fail it. ws / @types/ws as devDependencies.\n\nReference stand: Playwright suite examples/advanced/e2e/stand.spec.ts —\ncart + retained state, ACL denials, SSE chat, WebSocket notification,\nrequest to the backend, checkout iframe, cross-tab, DevTools — 8 tests,\n~20 s, in Playwright''s own headless Chromium; webServer boots the stand.\nnpm run e2e at the root and in the demo. Broker README conformance\nsection, changeset, CHANGELOG, gitignore for Playwright artifacts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b66ff84a901dddbca7adc484fe164f295abf1a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/trees/4b66ff84a901dddbca7adc484fe164f295abf1a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hedwigjs/hedwig/git/commits/12d5dedc952abac3a506f2b23ed9c6d607436b1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/790368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pipinov/followers","following_url":