32Z","email":"sforot9@gmail.com","name":"변우진"},"message":"feat: host를 매니페스트 기반 라우팅 셸로 전환, 새로고침 빈 화면 버그 수정\n\n- host가 하드코딩된 탭 대신 각 remote의 pages-manifest.json을 런타임에 fetch해서\n  라우트/네비게이션을 조립하도록 변경 (remote 추가/변경 시 host 재배포 불필요)\n- react-router-dom 도입, NavBar로 nav 레이아웃을 design-system에 위임\n- output.publicPath가 없어서(기본값 auto) 중첩 경로(/catalog/1 등)에서 새로고침하면\n  <script src=\"main.js\">가 상대경로로 풀려 404 나던 버그를 publicPath: \"/\"로 고정\n- catalog/cart-remote의 exposes를 buildPageExposes로 자동화하고 pages-manifest.json을\n  같이 배포하도록 wiring\n- 앱별 package-lock.json 제거 (루트 하나만 유지)","tree":{"sha":"cd7aae5d0f8e62b6b5e5c5d68c201546db7f9636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Byunwoojin/federated-storefront/git/trees/cd7aae5d0f8e62b6b5e5c5d68c201546db7f9636"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Byunwoojin/federated-storefront/git/commits/dc35a046c0d3df58cf23a4f379d8a6b3be16e040","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68841691?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Byunwoojin","id":68841691,"login":"Byunwoojin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQxNjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Byunwoojin/federated-storefron