계 셀렉터\n- order: 주문 생성/상태 변경, 완료 시 stock에 판매 수량 기록\n- stock: 상품별 누적 판매 수량 추적 + 재고 검증(findInsufficientStockItems).\n  order 슬라이스가 트리거하지만 재고 데이터 자체는 주문 이력과 별개 도메인이라\n  분리된 슬라이스로 둠\n- 여러 remote가 Module Federation으로 공유하는 유일한 상태 패키지라, 여기 없는\n  상태는 remote 간에 아예 공유할 방법이 없음","tree":{"sha":"b89f1097ae41f8cd82ff39308ece1d939cf2814a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Byunwoojin/federated-storefront/git/trees/b89f1097ae41f8cd82ff39308ece1d939cf2814a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Byunwoojin/federated-storefront/git/commits/9feaec3a61705004f205580e74f7367ac936f4d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68841691?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Byunwoojin","id":68841691,"login":"Byunwoojin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQxNjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byunwoojin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Byunwoojin/federated-storefront/commit/9feaec3a61705004f205580e74f7367ac936f4d8","node_id":"C_kwDOUBVuctoAKDlmZWFlYzNhNjE3MDUwMDRmMjA1NTgwZTc0ZjczNjdhYzkzNmY0ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Byunwoojin/federated-storefront/commit/e78c328bb7f5d01e2322e9bbebb7f0d4a5dbe7f5","sha":"e78c328bb7f5d01e2322e9bbebb7f0d4