il":"chishiki37@users.noreply.github.com","name":"chishiki37"},"message":"Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4 MTP-3 single-Spark recipe: concurrency scaling (C1/C4/C8) + MTP acceptance content-sensitivity finding\n\n- Winning recipe re-verified on edgexpert-1d49 (GB10): single-stream 21.0 tok/s matches banked 19.5-20.7 baseline\n- New concurrency data: C4 76.8 tok/s (3.66x), C8 132.9 tok/s (6.33x), gentle per-stream degradation\n- Finding: MTP draft acceptance is content-dependent (56% prose vs 85% code -> 21.0 vs 31.5 tok/s single-stream)\n- Correctness 3/3, GPU healthy (64-66C, no throttling)\n- Raw JSONs + stdlib harness + serve script included","tree":{"sha":"af2df2c47151954543144bb4056d9913615ca0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chishiki37/qwen38-27b-nvfp4-mtp3-single-spark/git/trees/af2df2c47151954543144bb4056d9913615ca0c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chishiki37/qwen38-27b-nvfp4-mtp3-single-spark/git/commits/0e44e11ab7c251c1e129abff0780d29cae987081","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260160803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chishiki37","id":260160803,"login":"chishiki37","node_id":"U_kgDOD4G9Iw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chishiki37/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ch