son y se anota en el README cuál de los dos manda,\npara no repetir la confusión.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1eaed880988ffd8e2caa35f5cbd0e5bbbbd5e421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/1eaed880988ffd8e2caa35f5cbd0e5bbbbd5e421"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/f45321b5c683e7e85c53faf3fb085dbd39f0741c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/f45321b5c683e7e85c53faf3fb085dbd39f0741c","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKGY0NTMyMWI1YzY4M2U3ZTg1YzUzZmFmM2ZiMDg1ZGJkMzlmMDc0MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab","sha":"65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab"}],"sha":"f45321b5c683e7e85c53faf3fb085dbd39f0741c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/f45321b5c683e7e85c53faf3fb085dbd39f0741c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T03:07:45Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T03:07:45Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"chore: ampliar las etiquetas de prueba para la evaluación\n\nQuedaba una sola LPN sin imprimir. Los rechazos son repetibles porque no\nconsumen la etiqueta, pero los casos de éxito sí: una vez impresa, la siguiente\nsolicitud es reimpresión. Con tres evaluadores, el primero en probar el camino\nfeliz se lo dejaba cerrado a los demás.\n\nSe agregan 10 etiquetas a NP-458721 (éxito con dos productos) y 3 a NP-458726\n(éxito en el límite exacto de inventario).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64ac33b0978e0844e0cef93d93b076230270a61b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/64ac33b0978e0844e0cef93d93b076230270a61b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKDY1ZmE4OGI0NjY1NjM4YjAyZTgwODk1ODk3ZjRjODE4ZGI2YmY2YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887","sha":"7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887"}],"sha":"65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/65fa88b4665638b02e80895897f4c818db6bf6ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:49:41Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:49:41Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"fix: acotar los campos de ancho variable del ZPL\n\nNi el código de zona ni el de ETQ tienen longitud fija. Con ^CF a tamaño fijo,\nZONA-PICKING-A se salía del borde derecho de la etiqueta, y ZPL no avisa:\nsimplemente lo corta al imprimir.\n\nSe acotan con ^FB (field block) y un tamaño de fuente menor. Detectado al\nrevisar el PNG renderizado, que es justamente para lo que sirve tenerlo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddcacd95732f7280208fdb575adaabd39af43002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/ddcacd95732f7280208fdb575adaabd39af43002"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKDdkNzk3YmI2ODFjNDdmODRhMTg5MDdjOGY5NTBhODc1MDRiYjA4ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955","sha":"34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955"}],"sha":"7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/7d797bb681c47f84a18907c8f950a87504bb0887"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:39:59Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:39:59Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: componer el ZPL de la semilla con los datos de cada ETQ\n\nEl anexo trae como ZPL el ejemplo genérico de Zebra: una guía de envío para\nJohn Doe en Intershipping, Inc., con código de barras 12345678. No menciona la\nETQ, el LPN ni los productos.\n\nEso bastaba mientras el ZPL se devolvía como texto opaco. Al renderizarlo como\nimagen descargable deja de servir: el evaluador abriría el .png y vería una\netiqueta sin relación con la operación, que parece un defecto más que una\ndemostración. Generar la imagen por separado con los datos reales sería peor,\nporque el .zpl y el .png de la misma descarga contarían historias distintas.\n\nAhora MockZplComposer compone el ZPL de cada ETQ desde su documento: ETQ, LPN en\ncódigo de barras ^BC, documento origen, zona y productos. No es la generación de\netiquetas que el enunciado deja fuera de alcance —es la simulación del proceso\nde olas que las pre-genera— y por eso vive en la capa de datos mock, no en la\nlógica de negocio. El ZPL original del anexo se conserva íntegro en\nmocks/_anexo_tableOrders.original.json.\n\nEl ZPL lleva un bloque de metadatos como comentario ^FX, campo legal que la\nimpresora ignora, para que el cliente pueda dibujar la vista previa desde el\npropio archivo y no de otra fuente que pudiera divergir.\n\nEl seeder actualiza el ZPL de las etiquetas existentes: sin eso, un ambiente ya\ndesplegado seguiría mostrando la guía de envío genérica para siempre.\n\n6 pruebas nuevas (102 en total). El ZPL es posicional y sin validación: un dato\ncon un carácter de control no lanza excepción, solo saca la etiqueta corrida.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bdbcba180058fa1a4e613fe78b54319a3fbaf67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/3bdbcba180058fa1a4e613fe78b54319a3fbaf67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKDM0NzgwYmFkMmYxN2YzMzA3MTIwZjEyMzgzOTg0NzIxNTQ2ZjI5NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0","sha":"8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0"}],"sha":"34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/34780bad2f17f3307120f12383984721546f2955"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:14:27Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:14:27Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: entrega de la etiqueta como archivo descargable\n\nLa impresión se simulaba solo como evento lógico: el ZPL viajaba en la respuesta\npero nunca llegaba a ser un archivo en manos del operario. Ahora\nGET api/print-requests/{id}/label lo entrega como .zpl.\n\nUna solicitud aprobada da derecho a UNA descarga, registrada con fecha y\nusuario. La etiqueta física sale de la impresora una sola vez, y permitir\nbajarla indefinidamente convertiría el control de reimpresiones en un trámite\ndecorativo: cualquiera obtendría copias sin motivo ni autorización.\n\nEl alcance por rol es el mismo del historial: el operario descarga lo suyo,\nsupervisor y admin toda la operación. La restricción viaja al query, así que no\nexiste el camino en el que alguien lea la solicitud de otro aunque luego se le\nniegue el archivo. \"No existe\", \"no fue aprobada\" y \"es de otro usuario\"\ncomparten motivo: distinguirlos confirmaría que la solicitud existe.\n\nCuando procede, la respuesta es el archivo y no el envelope; cuando no procede\nsí es el envelope, porque ahí hay un motivo que comunicar.\n\n7 pruebas nuevas (96 en total). Verificado por mutación: al quitar el control de\nunicidad muere la prueba de la segunda descarga.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb8b65486c9a8eacebb8e17e037f67ebe81f54e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/fb8b65486c9a8eacebb8e17e037f67ebe81f54e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKDhmYTQzMDlhNjVlNGYxOTY5YTkzZDE1ZDMwMGE1MDExYmY3ODI3ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f","sha":"36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f"}],"sha":"8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/8fa4309a65e4f1969a93d15d300a5011bf7827e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T01:28:28Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T01:28:28Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: flujo de autorización de reimpresiones\n\nUn operario que necesitaba reimprimir recibía REPRINT_NOT_AUTHORIZED y ahí\nterminaba. Pero es él quien detecta la etiqueta rota o el atasco de impresora,\ny el supervisor no está en el terminal: el bloqueo sin salida empujaba a pedir\nprestada una sesión ajena, justo lo que el control pretendía evitar.\n\nR4 pasa de rechazar a derivar. La solicitud queda en PENDING_APPROVAL —tercer\ndesenlace, junto a APPROVED y REJECTED— con el motivo que escribió el operario,\ny un Supervisor o Admin la resuelve desde una bandeja ordenada por antigüedad.\n\nEl motivo ahora se exige a todos, incluido el rol autorizado: sin justificación\nno hay nada que autorizar.\n\nAutorizar no imprime a ciegas. El motor de reglas se vuelve a ejecutar con los\ndatos del momento de la decisión, porque entre la solicitud y la autorización\nel documento pudo anularse o el inventario agotarse. Un visto bueno no puede\nvolver válida una impresión que dejó de serlo. Eso obligó a extraer\nPrintContextBuilder: ambos momentos necesitan el mismo contexto, resuelto con\nlos datos vigentes en cada uno.\n\nLa decisión se registra sobre la misma fila que creó el operario, con\nsolicitante y autorizador en columnas distintas: confundirlos impediría\nresponder quién aprobó el duplicado. La traza de la segunda evaluación se anexa\nsin borrar la primera.\n\n12 pruebas nuevas (89 en total). Verificado por mutación: al aprobar sin\nrevalidar reglas mueren los dos casos de documento anulado e inventario agotado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"816979fcf0055fb99c96351eca5faf511ac6b15d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/816979fcf0055fb99c96351eca5faf511ac6b15d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKDM2Mjg4ZTQ4OTA5MTViMTYzODU4ODM1YWIwMTc1MzY3NmMwNGI4NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca","sha":"b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca"}],"sha":"36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/36288e4890915b163858835ab01753676c04b84f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T00:56:51Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T00:56:51Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"fix: sembrar etiquetas nuevas sobre documentos existentes\n\nEl seeder omitia el documento completo si ya existia, de modo que agregar una\netiqueta a un documento vigente nunca llegaba a un ambiente ya desplegado. En\nla operacion real eso es justo lo comun: una ola posterior genera etiquetas\nnuevas sobre el mismo documento.\n\nAhora la idempotencia es por LpnId y no por documento.\n\nSe agregan 8 etiquetas a NP-458721 (LIBERADA). El camino feliz de HU-01 se\nagotaba con una sola impresion: tras imprimir la unica etiqueta del documento,\ntoda solicitud posterior es reimpresion y un operario recibe\nREPRINT_NOT_AUTHORIZED, que es correcto pero deja al evaluador sin forma de\nver el caso exitoso.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e63c24137de2f2844519c3b51081cb55afac770","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/9e63c24137de2f2844519c3b51081cb55afac770"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKGIyYTVkODQ3MTQ3MzUzZjk4ODIyZGRhNDQ5YWFmMjRkMmM1YzQ3Y2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/e5e205a49b30e0036e8154e0f980f0b1f599b58a","sha":"e5e205a49b30e0036e8154e0f980f0b1f599b58a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/e5e205a49b30e0036e8154e0f980f0b1f599b58a"}],"sha":"b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/b2a5d847147353f98822dda449aaf24d2c5c47ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/e5e205a49b30e0036e8154e0f980f0b1f599b58a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:42:26Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:42:26Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"fix: aceptar la cadena de conexion en formato URI de la plataforma\n\nRender entrega la conexion como postgresql://usuario:clave@host/base y Npgsql\nno parsea ese formato: espera pares clave=valor. Sin la conversion el servicio\nfalla al primer acceso a datos con un error de formato que no menciona la causa.\n\nLa clase vive en la capa de persistencia, no en el host: manejar la cadena de\nconexion es asunto de datos. Se fuerza SslMode.Require, que en Npgsql 8 cifra\nsin validar el certificado — Render lo emite con su autoridad interna, que no\nesta en el almacen de la imagen base.\n\n9 pruebas nuevas (77 en total): esta ruta solo corre en el ambiente publicado,\nasi que sin ellas un error no aparece hasta el despliegue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c27f0577dc72dba31fb5e9a519fa607f3cc2b8b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees