},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/c35476f2ff1e4b548105452941f5bac49f1040c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:14:24Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:14:24Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"docs: justificar por que no se partio de las plantillas base\n\nLa plantilla Angular es un micro-frontend del Hub de Proveedores sin login\npropio (recibe la sesion por postMessage de una app contenedora), lo que es\nincompatible con HU-01 y la seccion 9, y ademas impide que el evaluador la\nejecute. La plantilla de backend es Python; el rol y la solucion son .NET.\n\nSe documenta tambien que sus convenciones SI se adoptaron: la estructura por\ncapas mapea uno a uno con PYTHON_BACKEND_TEMPLATE, y su api_response.py ya\ndistingue ''no exitoso'' de ''error'', que es exactamente el supuesto H6.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <no