476f2ff1e4b548105452941f5bac49f1040c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/c35476f2ff1e4b548105452941f5bac49f1040c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/6ae71db37d388025885de05da0479c580929026f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:10:24Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T21:10:24Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"docs: runbook reescrito para responder el escenario real de la seccion 7\n\nEl enunciado plantea un caso especifico: multiples tiendas con fallas\nINTERMITENTES entre 9 y 10 AM. Eso descarta caida total y problema local, y\napunta a saturacion en el pico de inicio de turno.\n\n- Estructura alineada a las preguntas del enunciado: Diagnostico (que revisar,\n  metricas, logs, causa raiz), Comunicacion (usuario y contingencia), Cierre\n- Hipotesis ordenadas por probabilidad para ESTE caso, con el rate limiting\n  agotandose en el pico como principal\n- Contraste de volumen contra un dia normal como metodo para distinguir\n  ''lo que se proceso'' de ''lo que no llego a procesarse''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e127d535c718f73d060af133149d1416d9494a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/e127d535c718f73d060af133149d1416d9494a17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/6ae71db37d388025885de05da0479c580929026f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commit/6ae71db37d388025885de05da0479c580929026f","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqpKtoAKDZhZTcxZGIzN2QzODgwMjU4ODVkZTA1ZGEwNDc5YzU4MDkyOTAyNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api