cretos con sync:false, conexion via fromDatabase\n- README con credenciales, LPN de prueba, reglas, endpoints y hallazgos H1-H6\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: las cinco decisiones que definen la solucion y sus limitaciones\n- docs/c4/ con contexto, contenedor, componente y flujo (7 diagramas Mermaid,\n  validados renderizandolos con mermaid-cli)\n- domain-model.md con ER, mapeo BD-Backend-Frontend y maquinas de estado\n- INCIDENT-RUNBOOK.md con consultas reales sobre PrintRequests y PrintAuditLogs\n\nDespliegue en Render y Cloudflare pendiente por decision del usuario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2457a07fc486a80a95bf0adf0f1b13c8457ab2de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/2457a07fc486a80a95bf0adf0f1b13c8457ab2de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/8e6398ca5d4a90a9b11fa1119a2fec24272e01cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user