es Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:33:02Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: hardening - rate limiting, cifrado AES, correlationId y errores (HU-011)\n\n- Rate limiting por politica (Auth/Printing/Query) particionado por usuario o IP;\n  health check exento para que Render no lea un 429 como caida\n- AesEncryptionService AES-256-CBC con IV aleatorio por operacion como prefijo:\n  un IV fijo delata cuando dos textos son iguales. Encryption:IV deja de exigirse\n- Login acepta encryptedPayload ademas de credenciales en claro\n- CorrelationIdMiddleware y ExceptionHandlingMiddleware: 500 sin filtrar pila ni SQL\n- CORS expone X-Correlation-Id y Retry-After: sin eso el navegador los oculta\n- ForwardedHeaders para que la particion por IP no colapse tras el proxy de Render\n- 11 pruebas nuevas de cifrado (68 en total)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81c6959733dd38c574d23f45a54ab98e4bdef119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/81c6959733dd38c574d23f45a54ab98e4bdef119"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/12e8cb85d094ad7bb9c6e2d29a2d9513b1a29a04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a