r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/commits/e6a24ed23017c62b421e0e70fdb4f36200d94db9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:08:51Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T20:08:51Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"test: pruebas unitarias de reglas R0-R4 y casos de uso (CP-01..CP-12)\n\n- 57 pruebas xUnit sobre reglas en aislamiento y casos de uso con dobles en memoria\n- Builder de escenarios y repositorios en memoria en TestSupport/\n- Verificacion por mutacion: 3 defectos deliberados detectados y revertidos\n- docs/test-cases.md con la matriz, la evidencia y CP-13 declarado pendiente de B7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92be8096e55f23878c418a161cec31513b745a03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/trees/92be8096e55f23878c418a161cec31513b745a03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/Homecenter.Microservice.Api.LabelPrinting/git/commits/e6a24ed23017c62b421e0e70fdb4f36200d94db9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/receiv