_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commits/e21020dae7bc0fc5d5cc0a6e915a7f488f442425/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:11:13Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:11:13Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"fix: favicon con el isotipo de Homecenter y pie de pagina centrado\n\nEl favicon era el de Angular (magenta/purpura) — la plantilla base tampoco\nlo habia cambiado. Se reemplaza por el isotipo: SVG para navegadores\nactuales y PNG 64x64 para Safari anterior a 16.4, que aun no admite\nfavicon vectorial. Se elimina favicon.ico para que ningun navegador\nrecaiga en el logotipo de Angular.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eed5c110cf754aabc7aa5d4f1c4b55d85cf04874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/trees/eed5c110cf754aabc7aa5d4f1c4b55d85cf04874"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/commits/e21020dae7bc0fc5d5cc0a6e915a7f488f442425","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizat