ers/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commits/343fbc957ae67f6622259d5ba6fdb8a9c3b9c14b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:07:17Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T22:07:17Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: identidad visual de Homecenter y rediseno de la interfaz\n\nActivos oficiales, no reconstruidos de memoria: logotipo y isotipo en SVG\nextraidos de Homecenter_Logo.svg, y Lato self-hosted desde la plantilla base.\n\n- Tokens de marca en styles.css via @theme de Tailwind: azul #0072CE,\n  amarillo #FBD600 del logotipo y los semanticos de _variables.scss\n- BrandLoaderComponent con la animacion de loading.scss de la plantilla\n  (dos puntos que cruzan, amarillo a azul), con prefers-reduced-motion\n- Encabezado con logotipo, navegacion y la franja azul/amarilla de marca\n- Login en dos paneles; el de marca solo desde lg para no empujar el\n  formulario fuera del pliegue en movil\n- Controles de 44-50px: se opera de pie y a veces con guantes\n\nEl amarillo del spinner de la plantilla (#FCE454) se unifico al del\nlogotipo (#FBD600) para no arrastrar dos amarillos distintos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"681a1bc7eb950af91378da42ff29752daf1ec9ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/trees/681a1bc7eb950af91378da42ff29752daf1ec9ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/commits/343fbc957ae67f6622259d5ba6fdb8a9c3b9c14b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfe