ave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: cifrado del payload de credenciales y manejo de 429 con Retry-After\n\n- crypto.util.ts: AES-256-CBC con Web Crypto, interoperable con el backend\n  (IV aleatorio como prefijo). Documenta que complementa a HTTPS, no lo reemplaza\n- AuthService envia encryptedPayload cuando el ambiente lo habilita, con\n  degradacion a texto plano si el navegador no expone Web Crypto\n- errorInterceptor: usa Retry-After para decir cuantos segundos esperar y adjunta\n  el correlationId a los fallos tecnicos, que es lo unico citable ante soporte\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ea1e80e157dbca9537afa461ecd9477ddd38aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/trees/7ea1e80e157dbca9537afa461ecd9477ddd38aab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/commits/15a765200ce55372d86b32e20804a723c49339ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/