-08-23T20:09:06Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: historial de impresiones con filtros, paginacion y responsive (HU-008)\n\n- HistoryFacade con estado por signals, alcance OWN/ALL informado por el backend\n- HistoryFiltersComponent: LPN, zona, usuario, resultado, evento y rango de fechas\n- HistoryTableComponent: tabla desde lg, tarjetas por debajo\n- PaginationComponent en shared/ui con rango de registros real\n- Ruta /historial protegida por authGuard y enlace en la navegacion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcad4e37720436d1b2df4fc5a8fa6bbfbacdfe01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/trees/dcad4e37720436d1b2df4fc5a8fa6bbfbacdfe01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/commits/7e68fcd0f1be6a985aab593de4b4be50ccc455f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g