Galeano"},"message":"chore: update tsconfig.app.json to include rootDir in compilerOptions","tree":{"sha":"fc41296d7802100558bcc9af4577b93c6fa95095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/trees/fc41296d7802100558bcc9af4577b93c6fa95095"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/commits/1284e695ea7e311e9fbd46660b59bea470de868c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commit/1284e695ea7e311e9fbd46660b59bea470de868c","node_id":"C_kwDOUBqrJ9oAKDEyODRlNjk1ZWE3ZTMxMWU5ZmJkNDY2NjBiNTliZWE0NzBkZTg2OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commit/89ca33fc9dc25c6315162279d4e3d060dcddc7d2","sha":"89ca33fc9dc25c6315162279d4e3d060dcddc7d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commits/89ca33fc9dc25c6315162279d4e3d060dcddc7d2"}],"sha":"1284e695ea7e311e9fbd46660b59bea470de868c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commits/1284e695ea7e311e9fbd46660b59bea470de868c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/commits/89ca33fc9dc25c6315162279d4e3d060dcddc7d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:30:47Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T17:30:47Z","email":"anfegave98@hotmail.com","name":"Andres Galeano"},"message":"feat: autenticacion, formulario de impresion y resultado (HU-002, HU-004..HU-007, HU-009 / B5)\n\nFrontend operativo del flujo de impresion, con la capa de sesion que quedaba\npendiente del bloque B2.\n\nAutenticacion\n- AuthService, AuthFacade con signals, TokenStorageService.\n- jwtInterceptor: adjunta el token solo a peticiones dirigidas al apiUrl, para no\n  filtrar la credencial a terceros.\n- errorInterceptor: traduce fallos HTTP a mensajes presentables y limpia la sesion\n  ante un 401. No toca los rechazos de negocio, que llegan con HTTP 200.\n- authGuard y roleGuard como comodidad de navegacion; la autorizacion vinculante\n  sigue siendo la del backend.\n\nImpresion\n- PrintFormComponent: LPN, zona, usuario en solo lectura desde el JWT y motivo de\n  reimpresion condicional y obligatorio solo cuando aplica.\n- LabelPreviewComponent: documento, zona y productos con disponibilidad; tabla en\n  escritorio y tarjetas en movil.\n- PrintResultComponent: exito o rechazo con su motivo, badge Impresion/Reimpresion,\n  detalle por producto del rechazo de inventario, correlationId y ZPL.\n- PrintingFacade: distingue aprobacion, rechazo de negocio y fallo tecnico.\n\nVerificado contra el API local: login de los tres roles, impresion aprobada,\nrechazo por inventario con detalle, rechazo por documento ANULADA, LPN inexistente,\nreimpresion de supervisor con motivo y expiracion de sesion. Sin errores de CORS\nni de consola; sin desbordamiento horizontal en 375 px.","tree":{"sha":"e176de0a04d1d89dae443e97fddf4532ed7a3302","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/trees/e176de0a04d1d89dae443e97fddf4532ed7a3302"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anfegave98/homecenter-labelprinting-site/git/commits/89ca33fc9dc25c6315162279d4e3d060dcddc7d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30412619?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anfegave98","id":30412619,"login":"anfegave98","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDEyNjE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anfegave98/or