thub.com/users/jmjp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/96a4f11f0ef513cc1fd311a798938d8a71ede8ff","node_id":"C_kwDOUB5wZdoAKDk2YTRmMTFmMGVmNTEzY2MxZmQzMTFhNzk4OTM4ZDhhNzFlZGU4ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20","sha":"c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20"}],"sha":"96a4f11f0ef513cc1fd311a798938d8a71ede8ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/96a4f11f0ef513cc1fd311a798938d8a71ede8ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:45:52Z","email":"fluxa-bot@local","name":"Fluxa Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:45:52Z","email":"fluxa-bot@local","name":"Fluxa Bot"},"message":"fix(agent-ui): generic /api proxy + SSR with cookie auth\n\n- Adiciona apps/agent-ui/.env.production com NEXT_PUBLIC_FLUXA_API_URL\n  para bakear a URL do core no build (resolve ''invalid JSON from\n  /api/v1/conversations'' causado por fetch SSR sem Authorization).\n- Adiciona route handler generico em apps/agent-ui/src/app/api/[...path]/route.ts\n  que proxya /api/{conversations,agents,workflows}/... para o core,\n  lendo o token do cookie auth_token e repassando como Bearer.\n  Substitui os catch-all por recurso (que nao capturam a raiz no\n  App Router do Next 15) por um unico handler generico que roteia\n  pelo primeiro segmento. Exclui ''auth'' para deixar o handler\n  dedicado em /api/auth/[...path] intacto.\n- Reescreve apps/agent-ui/src/app/page.tsx para chamar os proxies\n  locais via fetch SSR com Cookie em vez de createClient direto\n  no core (que nao envia Authorization header). Constrói a URL\n  absoluta via headers() para o fetch SSR funcionar.\n\nSmoke test:\n- /api/conversations sem cookie: 401 application/json\n- /api/conversations com cookie: 200 + lista real do core\n- /api/agents com cookie: 200 + lista real\n- /api/workflows com cookie: 200 + lista real\n- /api/auth/me (regressao): 401 sem bearer, 200 com bearer valido\n- GET / com cookie: HTML 22KB, 3 conversas renderizadas,\n  sem ''Nao foi possivel atualizar todos os dados''.","tree":{"sha":"91f59110d2b80a5d6d548eab0fcb8306571bdc80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/91f59110d2b80a5d6d548eab0fcb8306571bdc80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20","node_id":"C_kwDOUB5wZdoAKGM1M2I5NTI3ODM4MzU4ZmE5NmExZDZiMTg3MTY5ODU3NTFhNDhhMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9","sha":"6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9"}],"sha":"c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/c53b9527838358fa96a1d6b18716985751a48a20"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T20:15:20Z","email":"root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T20:15:20Z","email":"root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"message":"fix(agent-ui): force-dynamic nas paginas /login e /register\n\nEvita cache estatico do Next.js que serve versao antiga\ndos chunks apos rebuild. (NOTA: force-dynamic so funciona\nem server components — em client components e'' no-op.)\n\nTambem o cache HIT vem do Traefik/CDN Dokploy. Para forcar\ncache-busting do CDN, fazer hard reload Ctrl+Shift+R ou\nanexa ?v=<hash> na URL.","tree":{"sha":"0c4fdeb418bfda5b3f4a3c80441531c84874f882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/0c4fdeb418bfda5b3f4a3c80441531c84874f882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9","node_id":"C_kwDOUB5wZdoAKDZkODhlNGIzZGUwNGFkYjU4OTA0ZDhjNTI4NDUzYmZjZWRhMDEyYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/a58d7ee591e5e607b0f3d113d394c2b443c81c72","sha":"a58d7ee591e5e607b0f3d113d394c2b443c81c72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/a58d7ee591e5e607b0f3d113d394c2b443c81c72"}],"sha":"6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/6d88e4b3de04adb58904d8c528453bfceda012c9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/a58d7ee591e5e607b0f3d113d394c2b443c81c72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:10:17Z","email":"root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:10:17Z","email":"root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"message":"chore: timestamp force rebuild","tree":{"sha":"d530548cbff8297c81b494842da6ee1f7b10326b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/d530548cbff8297c81b494842da6ee1f7b10326b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/a58d7ee591e5e607b0f3d113d394c2b443c81c7