ps://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/8630df68efd90b71480af25f9419bf25bc76ad38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/e78985dc42b515a26bf7ab2c80600af3bf18934e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/e78985dc42b515a26bf7ab2c80600af3bf18934e","node_id":"C_kwDOUB5wZdoAKGU3ODk4NWRjNDJiNTE1YTI2YmY3YWIyYzgwNjAwYWYzYmYxODkzNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855","sha":"f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855"}],"sha":"e78985dc42b515a26bf7ab2c80600af3bf18934e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/e78985dc42b515a26bf7ab2c80600af3bf18934e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:45:59Z","email":"root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:45:59Z","email":"root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net","name":"root"},"message":"fix(dockerfile): Next standalone output + Dockerfile unico por app\n\nResolve o problema de MODULE_NOT_FOUND no runtime do Next.js\nem monorepos pnpm dentro de Docker. O standalone output do Next\ngera um bundle com deps copiadas planas (sem symlinks), evitando\no problema classico de symlinks quebrados no COPY.\n\nMudancas:\n- apps/{agent,admin}-ui/next.config.mjs: adiciona output: ''standalone''\n  e remove bloco experimental (nao usado, gera warning)\n- Dockerfile.agent-ui: builda e roda o agent-ui na porta 9090\n- Dockerfile.admin-ui: builda e roda o admin-ui na porta 9091\n- Dockerfile (generico com ARG APP): removido por causa de problema\n  com expansao de ARG no CMD (Docker ARG nao expande em exec form CMD)\n\nValidado local:\n- docker build -f Dockerfile.agent-ui -t fluxa-agent-ui:v6 .\n- docker run --rm -p 19090:9090 fluxa-agent-ui:v6\n- curl http://localhost:19090/ retorna HTTP 200 com HTML do Agent UI\n- ''fetch failed'' no HTML e'' esperado (core nao ta rodando local)\n\nNo Dokploy: aponte o Dockerfile path pro arquivo certo:\n- agent-ui: Dockerfile.agent-ui\n- admin-ui: Dockerfile.admin-ui","tree":{"sha":"0b34039b0809dfde1461965114854b2398dbc225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/0b34039b0809dfde1461965114854b2398dbc225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855","node_id":"C_kwDOUB5wZdoAKGY4NzE3YjU2ZWUxYTE1NWQwNjM1YWQ0ZjMzMjgxYThkMjYyY2E4NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commit/80106828b437f55c6298ba57ba872b1819ae6424","sha":"80106828b437f55c6298ba57ba872b1819ae6424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/80106828b437f55c6298ba57ba872b1819ae6424"}],"sha":"f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/f8717b56ee1a155d0635ad4f33281a8d262ca855"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35924459?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmjp","id":35924459,"login":"jmjp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTI0NDU5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmjp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/commits/80106828b437f55c6298ba57ba872b1819ae6424/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:16:43Z","email":"35924459+jmjp@users.noreply.github.com","name":"João Miguel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T02:16:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dockerfile): usa node direto com path /app/node_modules/.pnpm/ (#4)\n\nProblema: pnpm usa symlinks que se perdem no COPY do Docker,\ncausando ''Cannot find module react/jsx-runtime'' no runtime.\n\nSolucao: chamar o binario Next diretamente de\n/app/node_modules/.pnpm/node_modules/next/dist/bin/next\n(a path real do monorepo pnpm). O .next/ compilado tem require()\nrelativo que resolve via path normal do Node.\n\nOutros fixes:\n- EXPOSE 9090 (Dokploy ja usa 3000)\n- 9090 no CMD pra sobrescrever via env\n- Removido pnpm/copypack do runtime (desnecessario)\n\nCo-authored-by: root <root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net>","tree":{"sha":"52ef1ba49d36ea4bd80c5959da66c89c45ed7fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/52ef1ba49d36ea4bd80c5959da66c89c45ed7fe2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/80106828b437f55c6298ba57ba872b1819ae6424","verification":{"payload":"tree 52ef1ba49d36ea4bd80c5959da66c89c45ed7fe2\nparent fa66ac04da3cfd45512a87363f87d83c3a735086\nauthor João Miguel <35924459+jmjp@users.noreply.github.com> 1787537803 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787537803 -0300\n\nfix(dockerfile): usa node direto com path /app/node_modules/.pnpm/ (#4)\n\nProblema: pnpm usa symlinks que se perdem no COPY do Docker,\ncausando ''Cannot find module react/jsx-runtime'' no runtime.\n\nSolucao: chamar o binario Next diretamente de\n/app/node_modules/.pnpm/node_modules/next/dist/bin/next\n(a path real do monorepo pnpm). O .next/ compilado tem require()\nrelativo que resolve via path normal do Node.\n\nOutros fixes:\n- EXPOSE 9090 (Dokploy ja usa 3000)\n- 9090 no CMD pra sobrescrever via env\n- Removido pnpm/copypack do runtime (desnecessario)\n\nCo-authored-by: root <root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqi6mLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb2wQAE8GU5PmnV8+PLbWzSRI8vYZ\nk4BJAWEz3wpQ7P8OJxvUxzpRzVl3VUb3D8Sn5z9GGygqB7Qjwd2WrMUq52riNBpv\nHEhjMTfqBAiC2XyPvXXlXyS8MgZojd79k76IHntihE+0JIPHF1A/nW6QJkhsx5e8\nVkCbOgrqx0SFc+Rfe3MJrGNaJ9W87RWu5pA8Ei18oM3wa16ukb4wiuKueXPt4Cna\n9VQ5K3CnbYffVXWP+NpZU7rg6rT2uXCo5G6pjTpHV1/SkQMEi5SN3vw+Iu6WjIgf\nEGL/JXfBh8hskEGLQqTM8cv3i02zhaLQsuzo1+Yh47AsKxh2BCnONiH2dZm0nSpZ\nwDOMXLAEsixhBcojTv848ES5PMxWsrvrWRI9OP1Bg2PvQvrbx3JISek4OzPe7xeL\n+50VcqDcfN4E91EfMrEwJ33GQyeRTZo0nOQT4Zb3IN3PoJuZupc2vMAlXFRN5/Wc\nSH994cLNRhdwSMBvzIhJW0UXF+GX0hNih60Q0Z25i1fzzb4atIYAAW0Je7Q08xWN\n0sKt8+giocI9yridDCKgt8+JSqseRaWP3hB+F8FJStwCLsSyGPORIVumcZu+ZH5i\ngBjORVH0S4m9x+s+4ibranIs+S2JFBhCaaSemMKw5MMzvZIojGI4fzKeGAFLlh1k\nnozaei6pjHmBlnuxDKz3\n=D87V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-24T02:16:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin