":"2026-08-24T01:09:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: Dockerfile generico com build-arg APP para deploy Dokploy (#3)\n\nUso:\n  docker build --build-arg APP=agent-ui -t fluxa-agent-ui .\n  docker build --build-arg APP=admin-ui -t fluxa-admin-ui .\n\nMulti-stage:\n- deps: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile (cache de layer)\n- builder: builda so o app alvo, com CI=true (pnpm nao tenta TTY)\n- runtime: alpine + shadow + usuario nao-root (uid 10000)\n\nAdicionado apps/agent-ui/public/.gitkeep e apps/admin-ui/public/.gitkeep\npara garantir que o diretorio existe no COPY do Docker.\n\nCo-authored-by: root <root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net>","tree":{"sha":"e21c932d38ccc5839157ccab24bb004f00b0ea35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/trees/e21c932d38ccc5839157ccab24bb004f00b0ea35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jmjp/fluxa-ui/git/commits/fa66ac04da3cfd45512a87363f87d83c3a735086","verification":{"payload":"tree e21c932d38ccc5839157ccab24bb004f00b0ea35\nparent 64b407e606762a8b82cc7b5cd0a5c8630d951c21\nauthor João Miguel <35924459+jmjp@users.noreply.github.com> 1787533777 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787533777 -0300\n\nchore: Dockerfile generico com build-arg APP para deploy Dokploy (#3)\n\nUso:\n  docker build --build-arg APP=agent-ui -t fluxa-agent-ui .\n  docker build --build-arg APP=admin-ui -t fluxa-admin-ui .\n\nMulti-stage:\n- deps: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile (cache de layer)\n- builder: builda so o app alvo, com CI=true (pnpm nao tenta TTY)\n- runtime: alpine + shadow + usuario nao-root (uid 10000)\n\nAdicionado apps/agent-ui/public/.gitkeep e apps/admin-ui/public/.gitkeep\npara garantir que o diretorio existe no COPY do Docker.\n\nCo-authored-by: root <root@vmi3420114.contaboserver.net>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqi5nRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeHUQADbJT6wztEVxufk1rwBZrDQx\nrl5Scb/4/iO03qL/gnRn6FKIrQtvZN6QsxUUl1bx2zFcZxjZkW+Qt2nDEjsqqV5P\nIShnIjf9+L3eNR