7147818b4150410cd915","sha":"13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915"}],"sha":"e1c3ae7e65b002afc755792877e5838e33832bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/e1c3ae7e65b002afc755792877e5838e33832bc6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:10:32Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T03:10:32Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"message":"feat: complete detector fixture coverage (v0.3.0)\n\nAdd true/false-positive fixture pairs for every detector added in the\nstack expansion, plus the remaining Angular 17 / NX pairs:\n\n- react-effect-leak (React 19 useEffect cleanup)\n- module-federation-skew (Webpack 5 singleton version skew)\n- alloydb-nonsargable (PostgreSQL non-sargable scan; plan required)\n- solr-deep-paging (SOLR 9.x start offset vs cursorMark)\n- redis-stampede (cache-aside no lock/no TTL vs single-flight + jitter)\n- angular-rxjs-leak (Angular 17 subscribe teardown)\n- nx-boundary-violation (NX enforce-module-boundaries)\n\nEach pair ships an EXPECTED.md keeping detectors at Candidate until the\nnamed runtime evidence is attached. Update fixtures/README coverage table;\ndetector gap list now empty.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"609de347f0e9839bc293ff0d795a92551ce8b4c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/trees/609de347f0e9839bc293ff0d795a92551ce8b4c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/commits/13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915","node_id":"C_kwDOUCOo3doAKDEzZWY3MDA4YzBjNzdhN2FhZWIxNzE0NzgxOGI0MTUwNDEwY2Q5MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e","sha":"2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e"}],"sha":"13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/13ef7008c0c77a7aaeb17147818b4150410cd915"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:07:21Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:07:21Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"message":"feat: expand target stack, add setup skill, and clarify docs (v0.3.0)\n\nExtend the targeted technology stack beyond legacy AngularJS 1.x/Spring/Oracle to\nalso cover Angular 17 (NX 17.3.x), Java 21, Spring Boot 2.7.18, Hibernate 5.6.x,\nand Oracle 19c. Add a new detectors-angular-nx.md reference and version-specific\nnotes to the Spring and Oracle detectors; teach inventory_workspace.py to detect\nnx.json/angular.json and a modern-Angular layer.\n\nAdd a start-here stabilization-init skill (and stabilize-init command) that gathers\nall inputs, organizes a background-material folder into evidence/BACKGROUND_DOSSIER.md,\nand hands it to Phase 0. Phase 0 and stabilize-baseline now read the dossier.\n\nAdopt a plain-language (\"explain like they''re five\") communication principle across\nthe whole workflow.\n\nRewrite README usage into per-stage sections with working examples for install,\ninvocation, and interaction. Add CLAUDE.md requiring docs/README to be updated\nbefore every push. Bump plugin + marketplace to 0.3.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c97210e627304cd6c425197a61ff1e1203c952d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/trees/1c97210e627304cd6c425197a61ff1e1203c952d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/commits/2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e","node_id":"C_kwDOUCOo3doAKDJkZWU3YThjYjhiODU5NmM3M2IwNDlhNGFlNzZiYmIzNWQ3Nzg5M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4","sha":"1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4"}],"sha":"2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/2dee7a8cb8b8596c73b049a4ae76bbb35d77893e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:49:21Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:49:21Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"message":"chore: bump version to 0.2.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4fb01bfbbcb1f7b83d8f1568a8142c4342da97a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/trees/4fb01bfbbcb1f7b83d8f1568a8142c4342da97a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/commits/1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4","node_id":"C_kwDOUCOo3doAKDFjZTE5YjYyZjYzZTJmNWM3OWQ3NzM3MTc5ZWJlN2E0OTEyZTQ0YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed","sha":"9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed"}],"sha":"1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/1ce19b62f63e2f5c79d7737179ebe7a4912e44b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:47:51Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:47:51Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"message":"feat: fixtures, dedupe merge, CI, and plan-scan note\n\nAddresses the four review recommendations:\n\n1. fixtures/ — true/false-positive pairs (N+1 Java, AngularJS listener leak,\n   Oracle full scan) with EXPECTED.md each, proving detectors distinguish a real\n   defect from a look-alike and that DB claims need a plan.\n2. normalize_findings.py --merge — collapse same-fingerprint findings into one\n   canonical record (strongest status/confidence wins; repos/impact/evidence\n   unioned). Adds STATUS_STRENGTH and a self-check (12 total).\n3. CI — .github/workflows/ci.yml runs helper self-checks and a stdlib manifest/\n   front-matter validator on push (no Claude CLI dependency).\n4. validate_plan.py --plan note: run against a filled plan, not the blank template.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b8fe868e26e4f547cfbf063bde1b7eb504b9cd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/trees/3b8fe868e26e4f547cfbf063bde1b7eb504b9cd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/commits/9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed","node_id":"C_kwDOUCOo3doAKDlkM2IwZTg1NTk0OThiMjQ0Y2YwMWZjNTE2NWFjNWY0NGY5OTJhZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870","sha":"5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870"}],"sha":"9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/9d3b0e8559498b244cf01fc5165ac5f44f992aed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:09:37Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:09:37Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"message":"docs: prescriptive playbook, charter gate, and review fixes\n\n- Add docs/PLAYBOOK.md: step-by-step run with per-gate decisions, artifacts,\n  and proceed conditions (the prescriptive procedure the README pointed at loosely)\n- Add templates/CHARTER.md: the artifact the remediation authorization gate reads\n  (previously referenced in 5 files but never templated)\n- Add templates/DECISION_RECORD.md for L6-L7 boundary changes\n- Wire charter + decision record into commands, SKILL, workflow, artifact-schemas\n- Fix inventory_workspace.py crashing when --out parent dir is missing\n- README: Python 3.8+ prereq, workspace scaffold step, playbook as entry point\n- plugin.json: homepage + repository now that the repo is published\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6b8c275b3af6e99b42a469642ee05b08ff9ab1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/trees/c6b8c275b3af6e99b42a469642ee05b08ff9ab1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/commits/5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870","node_id":"C_kwDOUCOo3doAKDVhMjI3NzZlM2I1N2U2NDhhMDQ4NjVhM2RhZTA2Yzk4Y2ZhMzQ4NzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6","sha":"8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6"}],"sha":"5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/5a22776e3b57e648a04865a3dae06c98cfa34870"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:03:42Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T04:03:42Z","email":"logan.mcleod@alldata.com","name":"Logan McLeod"},"message":"feat: legacy-stabilizer skill and plugin\n\nStabilization-first assessment and remediation workflow for legacy\nAngularJS 1.x / Java Spring Boot / Oracle polyrepos. Dual-mode package:\nportable skill core (SKILL.md + references + scripts + templates) plus\nClaude Code plugin adapters (commands, subagent, manifests).\n\n- Assessment-first, remediation opt-in and authorization-gated\n- Evidence states over verdicts; no fabricated coordinates/metrics\n- Working Python helpers (inventory, normalize, plan-gate) with self-checks\n- Not a security tool by design\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43534b2f3136a6df4706c822bddd1f16c484aeef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/trees/43534b2f3136a6df4706c822bddd1f16c484aeef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/git/commits/8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commit/8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6","node_id":"C_kwDOUCOo3doAKDhlYTBkYzhkMDQ3ZTZhMWUxMDdjYWE3NTQ2NGYxNmRlYzM0ZGZlZDY","parents":[],"sha":"8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits/8ea0dc8d047e6a1e107caa75464f16dec34dfed6"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/loganmcleod/legacy-stabilizer/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=e1c3ae7e65b002afc755792877e5838e33832bc6&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A02%3A07.099Z"}');
