starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/33ee5a27baa3884601023590f875a8311af95bf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:19:37Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:19:37Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"feat(privacy): 13-section Privacy Notice + config-driven partner disclosure (Parts 8,9,23,21)\n\n- Privacy page rebuilt to the production-ready 13-section structure (who we are,\n  data, purposes, legal basis, recipients, partners, security, retention,\n  rights, contact, cookies, automated decision-making, changes). Legally\n  sensitive fields (legal basis, retention, DPO, legal characterisation) carry a\n  loud [LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED] marker — nothing legal is invented.\n- config/privacy.ts: structured PartnerPrivacyProfile list + PRIVACY_NOTICE_VERSION.\n  The five potential partners are listed as recipients with all legal identity\n  fields marked [LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED] and verified:false — shown as pending,\n  never as confirmed partners. Adding a partner is a config entry; the privacy UI\n  never needs rewriting.\n- Demo seed: Demo Partner A now sets egn_required=True so the demo exercises the\n  EGN identity step; B and C do not.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"6e629a291a9059ce70b4d4d2d3647bd33bbe2495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/6e629a291a9059ce70b4d4d2d3647bd33bbe2495"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/33ee5a27baa3884601023590f875a8311af95bf3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e629a291a9059ce70b4d4d2d3647bd33bbe2495\