url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/8be0db7f81e7bedd85cddee7db82ac6ed35faea1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:15:20Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:15:20Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"feat(flow): post-selection EGN + final confirmation screens (Parts 3-7,22,24)\n\nExtend the results flow into: browse -> (persist selection) -> EGN (only when a\nselected partner requires it) -> final confirmation -> submit. The successful\nmatching, multi-select and success screens are unchanged.\n\n- Results page: phase state machine. Continue persists the selection (one\n  referral per chosen partner), then routes to the EGN step if any selected\n  partner has egn_required, else to confirmation.\n- EGN step: dedicated Veyra screen — numeric-only 10-digit input, inline\n  validation, privacy notice + link to the Privacy Notice. EGN is held only in\n  component state (never localStorage/sessionStorage/URL) and dropped once\n  accepted; sent via POST body to /identity/.\n- Final confirmation: lists exactly the selected partners (''Данните ще бъдат\n  предоставени на:''), single/multiple messaging, privacy link, credit warning;\n  submits to /submit/. Safe generic error on failure.\n- API client: getSelection/submitEgn/submitApplication; matches now carry\n  egn_required/is_demo (backend _serialize). i18n strings for both new screens\n  in bg/en.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"c4da69707692d9c4a9a1d2bf4d21a8d0638d0e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/c4da69707692d9c4a9a1d2bf4d21a8d0638d0e05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/8be0db7f81e7bedd85cddee7db82ac6ed35faea1","verification":{"payload