o99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/25f53c651df3970f556c22b2e1dab90ca38c3187/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:10:36Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:10:36Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"feat(egn): secure EGN identity, partner submissions & privacy model (Parts 2-21)\n\nBackend architecture for post-selection EGN collection and multi-partner\nsubmission, keeping matching EGN-free.\n\n- Encryption: apps/core/crypto.py (Fernet) with EGN_ENCRYPTION_KEY env; EGN\n  stored only as an opaque token + egn_last4; plaintext never stored, logged,\n  or returned. ApplicantIdentity model (one per application, nullable).\n- Identity service + POST /identity/ endpoint: validates exactly 10 digits,\n  encrypts, returns only the masked value; refused before partner selection.\n- Partner model: per-partner egn_required (never global); PartnerPrivacyProfile\n  (verified-only, publishable gate); PartnerSubmission (no EGN duplicated).\n- Adapters: PartnerAdapter base + IuteAdapter placeholder (no invented\n  endpoints/credentials, server-side IUTE_* env) + DemoAdapter; registry\n  enforces demo isolation so demo data never reaches a real partner.\n- Submission service: submits only to SELECTED partners, includes EGN only for\n  partners that require it (decrypted transiently), records safe audit events\n  (EGN_COLLECTED/SUBMITTED_TO_PARTNER/…) with no EGN in metadata.\n- Consent: append-only ConsentRecord referencing selected partners + the exact\n  privacy-notice version. Settings: AMOUNT_* already added; EGN_*, IUTE_*,\n  PRIVACY_NOTICE_VERSION, EGN_RETENTION_DAYS.\n- Admin: EGN shown only masked (******1234), never in clear or exports.\n- Endpoints: /selection/ (drives EGN step + confirmation), /identity/, /submit/.\n- Migrations for all new models; existing applications without EGN keep working.\n- Tests: 18 EGN/security/privacy/demo-isolation cases; updated cryptography dep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"7bc35a989268ad80fd6cfd9b7e1d5dde48ae0931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/7bc35a989268ad80fd6cfd9b7e1d5dde48ae0931"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/25f53c651df3970f556c22b2e1dab90ca38c3187","verification":{"payload":"tree 7bc35a989268ad80fd6cfd9b7e1d5dde48ae0931\nparent 58952db4ed763445e3d001ecdc59e24c3cf7b15e\nauthor Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788365436 +0000\ncommitter Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788365436 +0000\n\nfeat(egn): secure EGN identity, partner submissions & privacy model (Parts 2-21)\n\nBackend architecture for post-selection EGN collection and multi-partner\nsubmission, keeping matching EGN-free.\n\n- Encryption: apps/core/crypto.py (Fernet) with EGN_ENCRYPTION_KEY env; EGN\n  stored only as an opaque token + egn_last4; plaintext never stored, logged,\n  or returned. ApplicantIdentity model (one per application, nullable).\n- Identity service + POST /identity/ endpoint: validates exactly 10 digits,\n  encrypts, returns only the masked value; refused before partner selection.\n- Partner model: per-partner egn_required (never global); PartnerPrivacyProfile\n  (verified-only, publishable gate); PartnerSubmission (no EGN duplicated).\n- Adapters: PartnerAdapter base + IuteAdapter placeholder (no invented\n  endpoints/credentials, server-side IUTE_* env) + DemoAdapter; registry\n  enforces demo isolation so demo data never reaches a real partner.\n- Submission service: submits only to SELECTED partners, includes EGN only for\n  partners that require it (decrypted transiently), records safe audit events\n  (EGN_COLLECTED/SUBMITTED_TO_PARTNER/…) with no EGN in metadata.\n- Consent: append-only ConsentRecord referencing selected partners + the exact\n  privacy-notice version. Settings: AMOUNT_* already added; EGN_*, IUTE_*,\n  PRIVACY_NOTICE_VERSION, EGN_RETENTION_DAYS.\n- Admin: EGN shown only masked (******1234), never in clear or exports.\n- Endpoints: /selection/ (drives EGN step + confirmation), /identity/, /submit/.\n- Migrations for all new models; existing applications without EGN keep working.\n- Tests: 18 EGN/security/privacy/demo-isolation cases; updated cryptography dep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLFEvGRO\nevGaKFvtITY86o21T96JY7HhNC2/f5FAsbusBolhQYTdmwLq+jyte+BLNyxYoJGzNBIz1DUb/o09\n3g4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194582360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99","id":194582360,"login":"vulko99","node_id":"U_kgDOC5kXWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/starred{/owner}{/