/api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7fb2e7b12c7af8068e6e33a7678680d66041b81a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T06:53:01Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T06:53:01Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(deploy): trigger a production build\n\nNetlify skipped the deploy for 49fce2c — the merge that carries the\nhow-it-works connector fix — with \"This deploy didn''t run because a new one\nwas scheduled for the same branch.\" Nothing replaced it, so the published\ndeploy is still 5a1b827 (PR #25) and the connector fix has never been built.\n\nThe code is correct and already merged; only the build is missing. Normally\nthis would be Deploys -> Trigger deploy in the Netlify UI, but that needs\ndashboard access we do not have, and a push to the production branch is the\none trigger available from the repository side.\n\nEmpty on purpose: there is nothing to change. Everything intended for this\ndeploy is already on the branch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df40cabd1e04997b880e63a45a8edd0f28feabd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/df40cabd1e04997b880e63a45a8edd0f28feabd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/7fb2e7b12c7af8068e6e33a7678680d66041b81a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon