d508bd2a4b8711e85613be51f1ded5"}],"sha":"49fce2c54c8814878614f2295d26b77fa23960a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/49fce2c54c8814878614f2295d26b77fa23960a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/3765815dd9d508bd2a4b8711e85613be51f1ded5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T06:31:12Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T06:31:12Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(how-it-works): make the step connector span the gap instead of straddling the card\n\nReported: the two connector lines between the 01/02/03 cards look wrong and\nmisplaced.\n\nTwo cards carry one and the third does not, which is correct — they join\nadjacent cards, and three cards have two gaps. A third would dangle off the\nright edge of the last card. That part was working.\n\nThe position was not. The grid is gap-6 (24px), and the line was\nleft-[calc(100%-0.75rem)] w-6: it started 12px BEFORE the card''s right edge and\nran 24px, so half of it lay over the card itself and it stopped halfway across\nthe gap without reaching the next card. What showed was a short dash beside the\nnumber rather than a line joining two steps.\n\nleft-full w-6 starts at the card''s edge and runs the gap''s own width, so it\nspans the gap exactly and meets both cards. Both values derive from gap-6; the\ncomment says so, since changing the grid gap now requires changing w-6 with it.\n\nNot verified visually — the browser pane would not navigate to localhost, the\nloopback address or the live site. The change is arithmetic against a known\n24px gap rather than a judgement about appearance, which is why that is\nacceptable here; the vertical offset (top-7) is untouched for the same reason,\nsince that one IS a visual judgement.\n\ntypecheck, lint, build 76/76 clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df40cabd1e04997b880e63a45a8edd0f28feabd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/df40cabd1e04997b880e63a45a8edd0f28feabd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/3765815dd9d508bd2a4b8711e85613be51f1ded5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users