ader): let the bar sit on the dark hero instead of banding across it","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql0INCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwPgQAK3uqc038aYlAj0nMXgNJpdb\nsWXYi5DiUrnoCnornBO2N5qL1GzoTQ4LGDwVFTriE0xHfwehHx9/iDKGuw4DceWr\nwsQbXM/RfGDKo5AOoPaKaFtvlKOY70f1fvjyMkYq1Q2ippR4BAgDIu+5snjIOEZg\no+lXxu9xYoW1fxA1Mg/bLP61JCXyCPzjR/pAb9FQ3G5LVsAlP10wXvLiaxOP0xbG\nova1o5/bAY7JQ+HKBI15VTQa6pzAxZjMDevBb7hr+9zlGbpZQ2mbpnQt0a3a+ng4\n+CNrEeVj7UPey2f4jC+G/bzUWXQfRWyed3ZFHsATkKLZ0Bka8FTyjYmGD4qCqDl6\nT/8McXU802MXCJLsgaYBpNUiVm00y7YEdch2r4thLsjseSermqsyJREEQ0brd6by\ngAytU/uI96HlZs/WBa0t5E13TbjLvxbRasebLq1iki+jHqShKC+wnKebPTGRUyVs\nUH200Ezz1LqZrDwPvfv+bSvTM3FoyuY9YYVK5cp4Ne3hAFjt4/vqsGZfs5y7xK/q\nHJ8drwjbFwL2tfRcju4rQuQSQQhRd+sfx443UvHScbhLeT0ndm2vdCBbPkw2gM/g\n7SDePdsOdVZMpamBrRqJj/RnrzMrS3nYdwiePt8vLwOGntplgXv6EEjHxF4rUNif\n9j22YyFsto4PyyM5rDCg\n=LpRX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T21:22:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/d8a610c30ff1e914b3a1e1582b9a60c68e8d4c75","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGQ4YTYxMGMzMGZmMWU5MTRiM2ExZTE1ODJiOWE2MGM2OGU4ZDRjNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b","sha":"7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211","sha":"ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211"}],"sha":"d8a610c30ff1e914b3a1e1582b9a60c68e8d4c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/d8a610c30ff1e914b3a1e1582b9a60c68e8d4c75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:17:14Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:17:14Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(header): let the bar sit on the dark hero instead of banding across it\n\nThe responsible-borrowing hero already ran up behind the navigation bar --\n.under-nav puts its top at y=0 and the stacking order is right. What looked\nlike a white gap above it was the bar''s own glass: rgba(245,247,250,0.55),\na near-white panel that is correct on every other page and, painted over a\ndark hero, reads as a band the hero starts below.\n\nSo the fix is tone, not layout. While a dark hero is behind it the bar drops\nits panel entirely and switches its contents to light ink -- white wordmark,\nappmuted links, the dark-tone LanguageToggle and menu button that already\nexisted for the application flow. Nothing is painted over the hero, so it\nreads as one surface from the top of the page.\n\nTwo states have to give the tone back, both because light ink on light\nground is unreadable:\n\n  - scrolled past the hero. The bar measures the hero''s own data-dark-hero\n    marker rather than a scroll threshold, so it turns at the hero''s actual\n    edge instead of at the 8px the `scrolled` state uses.\n  - the mobile menu open. The panel is its own light surface, and a dark bar\n    above it would leave the panel as the only readable half.\n\nhasDarkHeroPath answers the route at render time so the first paint is\nalready dark; an effect could only correct it afterwards, and a flash of\nlight bar over a dark hero is precisely the defect being fixed. The marker\nis what the scroll handler measures -- the route list only seeds that first\npaint, and a missing marker falls back to light.\n\nVerified against a production build in both locales, desktop and mobile:\nthe hero reaches y=0 with a transparent bar and white wordmark; the tone\nreturns to the light glass and dark wordmark once the hero''s bottom passes\nthe bar and while the menu is open; and the home page is untouched --\nstill glass-bar at 0.55 with the dark wordmark and no marker present.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ed80914546ef6c5422d5b4495a5cb049f875ab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/0ed80914546ef6c5422d5b4495a5cb049f875ab2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGJhNjllY2Q1OTQ4Y2EwMjdhMjJmNWYwMGVjOWJjZWE5NzYzNjIyMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b","sha":"7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b"}],"sha":"ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/ba69ecd5948ca027a22f5f00ec9bcea976362211"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2182