wDOUCSFDdoAKDc3OTJmYWRmY2Q3ZGE4NDI0YjkyMmY5Y2ZjNTNiYzVjNzVhMzc2MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/a420ed894964e8c554fa7fceaa362164235ef803","sha":"a420ed894964e8c554fa7fceaa362164235ef803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/a420ed894964e8c554fa7fceaa362164235ef803"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/f3fa8ad279bc1d99ae6b3419eb705e247b804619","sha":"f3fa8ad279bc1d99ae6b3419eb705e247b804619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/f3fa8ad279bc1d99ae6b3419eb705e247b804619"}],"sha":"7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7792fadfcd7da8424b922f9cfc53bc5c75a3760b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4f35869b10daec1d8a15645646b5ecedc3e39df3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:09:50Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:09:50Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(legal): render the statutory warning in every locale, and stop leaking a placeholder\n\nTwo findings from a verification sweep over the merged tree. Both were mine.\n\n1. English pages carried the credit warning ONLY in translation.\n\nCreditWarning rendered `{m.warningGloss || CREDIT_WARNING}` — an OR, so a\nlocale supplying a gloss REPLACED the mandated Bulgarian sentence instead of\nleading with it. Every /en page and all ten /en landings contained\n\"Warning! Taking out credit costs money.\" and zero occurrences of\n\"Вземането на кредит струва пари\".\n\nThe requirement is on the wording itself, so a translation of it does not\ndischarge the obligation. `legal.warningGlossNote` (\"Statutory wording, binding\nin Bulgarian\") already existed for exactly this and was never rendered — dead\ncode — and the component''s own docblock already described the supplementing\nbehaviour that the JSX below it did not implement.\n\nThe gloss now leads in the reader''s language and the Bulgarian follows beneath\nit, labelled, on the same notice. `lang=\"bg\"` is scoped to the statutory\nsentence alone, not the note beside it, which is in the reader''s language. The\nBulgarian pages are unchanged: the gloss is empty there, so the statutory\nsentence is still the only line. The docblock now names the `||` explicitly as\nthe bug to avoid, since it is an easy and silent thing to reintroduce.\n\n2. /contact and /en/contact served a raw [[TODO:CONTACT_PHONE]] to visitors.\n\nThe page used `isTodo` without `HIDE_UNFILLED`, so it rendered the red marker\nregardless of the flag, on builds where every other page correctly hid its\nunfilled values. The phone section is now omitted entirely when the value is\nunfilled and the flag is set — the rule CompanyIdentity already follows, since\na \"Телефон\" heading over a red marker is worse than no section — and the\nhand-rolled <mark> is replaced by the shared TodoMark so there is one\nrendering of an unfilled value rather than two.\n\nNothing is invented and nothing is weakened: with the flag off the marker\nreturns on both locales, and `check:legal` reports the value outstanding either\nway. Audited the rest of the tree for the same gap: no other file uses isTodo\nwithout the flag.\n\nVerified on a production build with pre-launch on, both locales:\n  - \"Вземането на кредит струва пари\" now present on /, /krediti,\n    /barzi-krediti, /kredit-online and /kalkulator AND on all five /en twins;\n    the English twins additionally carry the gloss and the binding-wording note\n  - no [[TODO:*]] token on any page in either locale; /contact keeps its other\n    sections and shows no orphan heading\n  - typecheck, lint, build 76/76 clean\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e5183a18931cf58b439df9fac4606fdddb50eb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/6e5183a18931cf58b439df9fac4606fdddb50eb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/4f35869b10daec1d8a15645646b5ecedc3e39df3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/4f35869b10daec1d8a15645646b5ecedc3e39df3","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDRmMzU4NjliMTBkYWVjMWQ4YTE1NjQ1NjQ2YjVlY2VkYzNlMzlkZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/a420ed894964e8c554fa7fceaa362164235ef803","sha":"a420ed894964e8c554fa7fceaa362164235ef803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/a420ed894964e8c554fa7fceaa362164235ef803"}],"sha":"4f35869b10daec1d8a15645646b5ecedc3e39df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4f35869b10daec1d8a15645646b5ecedc3e39df3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/f3fa8ad279bc1d99ae6b3419eb705e247b804619/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:06:05Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T21:06:05Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(legal): confirm the credit-warning wording against чл. 8 ЗПК\n\nCREDIT_WARNING_CONFIRMED was false with a [[TODO:WARNING_WORDING]] note asking\nfor the constant to be checked against the published statute before 20 Nov 2026.\n\nChecked. чл. 8, ал. 1 of the new Закон за потребителския кредит requires the\nwarning to be given „чрез използване на израза „Внимание! Вземането на кредит\nструва пари\" или друг подобен израз.\" The constant already held that string\nverbatim, so the wording needed no change.\n\nThe note above it pointed the wrong way, which is the part worth recording. It\nobserved that the directive''s own BG text reads „Внимание! Заемането на пари\nструва пари\" and implied the constant might need to match it. Bulgaria''s\ntransposition deliberately did not: it chose „вземането на кредит\" over\n„заемането на пари\". Following the directive text would have moved the site\naway from the national statute, so the comment now says so explicitly.\n\nчл. 8 also permits „или друг подобен израз\", so compliance never hinged on an\nexact string match — noted, because it sets the real risk level for anyone\nrewording this later.\n\nScope of the check, recorded in the docstring rather than left implicit: чл. 8\nas published for consultation (strategy.bg, closed 14 Jan 2026), corroborated\nby secondary legal coverage of the Act adopted 18 Mar 2026. The Държавен\nвестник text was not retrievable, so this is not a reading of the promulgated\ncopy. The flag is set because the wording matches the statute''s own exemplar\nand the article allows an equivalent expression, but the docstring asks for a\nlawyer to confirm against ДВ before 20 Nov 2026 rather than pretending that\nstep is done.\n\n`npm run check:legal` no longer reports the credit-warning warning. The 16\noutstanding regulated values are untouched — they remain blocked on company\nregistration and a signed partner, and none of them may be invented.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f155bb429c4d8f2067c36aeb34e9b34a57fff5f0","url":"https: