ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7afe9653f4d896bfd8dbcde2749d28289493306e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:35:04Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:35:04Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"feat(legal): per-partner legal/product data with a publication gate\n\nAdd a structured, per-partner source of truth for the mandatory\n''Задължителна информация'' — repayment term, product APR, applicable fees,\nregistered address and the ЗПК чл. 25 representative example — replacing the\npanel-wide placeholders with a model that scales to many partners.\n\n- config/partner-legal.ts: the PartnerLegal model, an internal partner\n  registry (draft stubs, no fabricated values), and validatePartnerLegal(),\n  which gates publication: every mandatory field present, the partner''s own\n  representative example internally consistent, the product APR within the\n  statutory cap, and reviewStatus === ''verified''. publishablePartners() and\n  partnerLegalReport() drive the UI and the internal onboarding checklist.\n- Keep ''Максимален ГПР'' (product) and ''Законов таван на ГПР'' (statutory cap)\n  as separate fields; the cap stays a single general figure, never a partner''s\n  APR. Fees are never assumed ''no fees'' — that state must be explicitly\n  confirmed. Representative examples are used verbatim, only consistency-checked.\n- components/PartnerProducts.tsx renders one polished block per verified\n  partner, matching the existing design; it renders nothing while none is\n  verified, so incomplete data stays internal and the public page is unaffected.\n\nNo partner values are supplied yet, so every entry is an incomplete draft and\nnothing is published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"ff7bb162a5bf0c440ed61b431051cdc0dd1fd043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/ff7bb162a5bf0c440ed61b431051cdc0dd1fd043"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/7afe9653f4d896bfd8dbcde2749d28289493306e","verification":{"payload":"tree ff7bb162a5bf0c440ed61b431051cdc0dd1fd043\nparent 35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac\nauthor Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788294904 +0000\ncommitter Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788294904 +0000\n\nfeat(legal): per-partner legal/product data with a publication gate\n\nAdd a structured, per-partner source of truth for the mandatory\n''Задължителна информация'' — repayment term, product APR, applicable fees,\nregistered address and the ЗПК чл. 25 representative example — replacing the\npanel-wide placeholders with a model that scales to many partners.\n\n- config/partner-legal.ts: the PartnerLegal model, an internal partner\n  registry (draft stubs, no fabricated values), and validatePartnerLegal(),\n  which gates publication: every mandatory field present, the partner''s own\n  representative example internally consistent, the product APR within the\n  statutory cap, and reviewStatus === ''verified''. publishablePartners() and\n  partnerLegalReport() drive the UI and the internal onboarding checklist.\n- Keep ''Максимален ГПР'' (product) and ''Законов таван на ГПР'' (statutory cap)\n  as separate fields; the cap stays a single general figure, never a partner''s\n  APR. Fees are never assumed ''no fees'' — that state must be explicitly\n  confirmed. Representative examples are used verbatim, only consistency-checked.\n- components/PartnerProducts.tsx renders one polished block per verified\n  partner, matching the existing design; it renders nothing while none is\n  verified, so incomplete data stays internal and the public page is unaffected.\n\nNo partner values are supplied yet, so every entry is an incomplete draft and\nnothing is published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKRg/qXv\nNAjroZyoMLhi53qaBvfiXcUAPikvaryphl2kC8vELEsN8bxEjnp84CLdnAAfNFZeuYShk+cyLdmW\n4gY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194582360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99","id":194582360,"login":"vulko99","node_id":"U_kgDOC5kXWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/7afe9653f4d896bfd8dbcde2749d28289493306e","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDdhZmU5NjUzZjRkODk2YmZkOGRiY2RlMjc0OWQyODI4OTQ5MzMwNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","sha":"35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac"}],"sha":"7afe9653f4d896bfd8dbcde2749d28289493306e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7afe9653f4d896bfd8dbcde2749d28289493306e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/2a493f15af7cb9206f88f643dddf4fd47079b52b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:33:58Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:33:58Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(netlify): omit unfilled regulated rows instead of marking them\n\nThe deploy rendered ten [[TODO:*]] markers on /about alone, and they are\npublicly reachable on every preview link. Netlify has neither the\nNEXT_PUBLIC_COMPANY_* values nor NEXT_PUBLIC_HIDE_UNFILLED set, so it got the\nloud fallback that config/company.ts uses when a value is missing.\n\nSetting the flag for Netlify builds swaps the red markers for omitted rows,\nwhich is what the flag was built for. Presentation only:\n\n  - no figure is substituted for a missing one, and none may be -- these are\n    company identifiers and regulated figures\n  - `npm run check:legal` still reports all 16 outstanding values\n  - the disclosures panel keeps its plain-language line in place of the red\n    banner: \"The company is being registered. The mandatory values will be\n    published before the site goes live.\"\n  - the statutory APR cap, a real published figure, still renders\n  - companyJsonLdFields() still omits unfilled identifiers rather than\n    publishing placeholder ones to structured data\n\nIt does not weaken the guard that matters. `prebuild` runs\nscripts/check-legal-values.mjs, which exits 1 on a production deploy\n(CONTEXT === \"production\") while any blocking value is unfilled; verified it\nstill refuses with the flag set. The markers were the visible reminder, the\nbuild refusal is the gate, and only the former changes here.\n\nVerified: /about and /krediti go from ten markers and red <mark> elements to\nzero, a local build with the flag passes, and a simulated production check\nstill exits 1 with \"16 unfilled regulated value(s)\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7f058d6d451b6fe9838f9ddbf7e817e42152aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/a7f058d6d451b6fe9838f9ddbf7e817e42152aad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/2a493f15af7cb9206f88f643dddf4fd47079b52b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c