ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/964ae19f220ba1dc6e4e8c7d188895dc5c552428","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDk2NGFlMTlmMjIwYmExZGM2ZTRlOGM3ZDE4ODg5NWRjNWM1NTI0Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1","sha":"92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51","sha":"9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51"}],"sha":"964ae19f220ba1dc6e4e8c7d188895dc5c552428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/964ae19f220ba1dc6e4e8c7d188895dc5c552428"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:05:51Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:05:51Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(deploy): close the application funnel on the Render demo again\n\nReverts the value set in 35e0fbd, which opened /apply + /results so\npartners could walk the funnel end to end.\n\nThe funnel collects a name, phone, email, income and employment status,\nand its consent text names Veyra as the data controller. config/launch.ts\ndefaults PRELAUNCH to ON precisely so that cannot happen before the entity\nis registered, and render.yaml is the one file that can turn it off.\n\nWorth recording why nothing caught this: check-legal-values.mjs refuses to\nbuild with an open funnel and no company ЕИК, but only when it considers\nitself a production build -- and that test is CONTEXT === \"production\", a\nNetlify variable Render never sets. On Render the guard printed a warning\nand the build carried on. The env-var default-deny is the only protection\nthat actually applies there.\n\nSet explicitly to \"true\" rather than removing the key, so the intent is\nvisible in the deploy file and the next person weighing a demo window has\nthe trade-off in front of them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f7e78cdc09b1704f655e4551f9a8ff644c81ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/2f7e78cdc09b1704f655e4551f9a8ff644c81ab6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDlhZWFjOTg5ZmE0ZmQ3MGFjNWIzZTRiMDRlMzVkMzczYjFjNjdmNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","sha":"35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac"}],"sha":"9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/9aeac989fa4fd70ac5b3e4b04e35d373b1c67f51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:05:27Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:05:27Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(git): ignore sibling copies of .env.local\n\nThe rule matched `.env.local` by exact name, so a `.env.local.bak` set aside\nwhile toggling NEXT_PUBLIC_PRELAUNCH was not ignored and was swept into a\ncommit by `git add -A`. Caught and removed before pushing, but the gap is\nworth closing rather than remembering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d27a2c66c81b1ca8334e7f1bd4ca332ba414309b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/d27a2c66c81b1ca8334e7f1bd4ca332ba414309b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDkyODUwZDE5NmU0MWFiODhhYTAxY2Y0Yjc0NjI0ZDVhYzUwNjBhYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5","sha":"7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5"}],"sha":"92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/92850d196e41ab88aa01cf4b74624d5ac5060aa1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:04:33Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:04:47Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"Merge origin/claude/veyra-mvp-spec-ujb2ba into the local branch\n\nTwo lines of work had diverged from c92ec2b and both touched the landing\npages and guides:\n\n  local   db73fbd  translated all 10 landing pages and both guides into\n                   English, keyed the copy by locale, deleted the\n                   Bulgarian-only machinery (lib/bg-only.ts, BgOnlyNotice,\n                   common.bgOnlyContent) and dropped the lang=\"bg\" override\n  origin  e007c09  fixed the pre-launch CTAs, which pointed two buttons at\n                   the calculator on every landing page\n          3398308  dropped the nav''s calculator entry while the funnel is\n                   closed, for the same reason\n          35e0fbd  opened the funnel on a Render demo\n\nEverything auto-merged except two conflicts, and both were the same seam.\nThe origin work deliberately read the BULGARIAN catalogue for the closing\ncall-to-action:\n\n    {PRELAUNCH ? bg.prelaunch.closingTitle : data.ctaTitle}\n\nwith the reasoning, correct at the time, that the card sat inside a\nlang=\"bg\" article whose copy was Bulgarian in every locale — so a localized\nstring there would have been English marooned in Bulgarian prose.\n\nThe local branch removes that premise. These pages are genuinely translated\nnow and the lang override is gone, so the Bulgarian catalogue became the\nthing that would look wrong: an English reader on /en/krediti would have hit\na Bulgarian closing card. Resolved by keeping origin''s pre-launch swap —\nwhich is a real fix, the closing copy must not promise an application the\nbutton cannot start — and reading it from the reader''s own catalogue:\n\n    {PRELAUNCH ? m.prelaunch.closingTitle : copy.ctaTitle}\n\nSame resolution in the guide article, plus its now-unused direct import of\nthe Bulgarian dictionary.\n\nVerified on a production build with PRELAUNCH on, which is the state the\nresolution affects and the production default:\n\n  - closing CTA is Bulgarian on /krediti and /guides/*, English on their /en\n    twins, on both the landing pages and the guides\n  - the landing pages are genuinely English on /en (lang=\"en\", no leftover\n    \"available in Bulgarian only\" notice, nothing noindex)\n  - the hero pair is calculator + guides, not calculator twice\n  - the nav''s calculator entry is gone while the funnel is closed; the one\n    remaining header link to it is the CTA itself\n  - the fold-block reveal from c92ec2b survives\n  - sitemap is 52 URLs, an even split across both locales\n\ntypecheck, lint and build (76/76) all clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5df4cbeb4cd7292b33e5ac7d0b0a68dd3a53932f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/5df4cbeb4cd7292b33e5ac7d0b0a68dd3a53932f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDdjZDI4ZjgwZmYzZGFhNjJhYjFjODE1YzIwNTNmNjYyZDliODE3ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1","sha":"db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","sha":"35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac"}],"sha":"7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/7cd28f80ff3daa62ab1c815c2053f662d9b817f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/6f7b99d78fba771c9cca5719123c20b0c9b3f6fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:03:16Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:03:16Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(ui): stop the reveal being disarmed before it can run\n\nReported as the responsible-borrowing page having no blur animation from the\n\"What to consider\" heading onwards. Two separate causes, plus a third found\nwhile checking the rest of the site.\n\nThe callouts section never animated at all. ScrollReveal deliberately leaves\nalone anything already on screen at mount -- arming it would hide content that\nhas already been painted -- and the dark hero on that page is short enough that\nthe section lands above the fold on desktop *and* on mobile (top 520 against a\n748 threshold at 375x812). So it fell between the two mechanisms: too high for\nthe scroll entrance, and never given the load one. It now carries `reveal\nreveal-late`, the same CSS blur-up as the hero with the stagger picked up where\nthe hero''s left off, so the page resolves top-down. `reveal-scroll` stays for\nthe narrower screens where it does start below the fold.\n\nEverything below it was disarmed 1.6s after load. The failsafe stripped\n`reveal-armed` from every armed section unconditionally, which turned a grace\nperiod for a broken observer into a deadline on the effect itself: scroll down\nafter it expired and nothing animated, because the sections had been disarmed\nwhile still off screen. On the home page all 7 armed sections went from armed to\nplain before any scroll. It now stands down once the observer proves itself\nlive, and restarts on `visibilitychange` -- a hidden tab does not run\nobservations at all, so counting that time would disarm a backgrounded page\nbefore it was ever looked at.\n\nFixing that exposed a third fault the blanket timeout had been masking. A wheel\nflick, Page Down or an anchor jump can carry a section from below the fold to\nabove the screen between two observations; IntersectionObserver only reports\nthreshold crossings, so none was ever crossed, no callback arrived, and the\nsection stayed armed -- invisible -- for the rest of the visit. On /krediti that\nleft the FAQ and mandatory-information blocks blank after a fast scroll to the\nbottom. The observer''s root now reaches far above the viewport so \"scrolled\nclean past\" still counts as intersecting: the callback fires with the section\nalready off the top, the animation plays unseen, and the content simply ends up\nvisible. It cannot make anything reveal early, because the bottom edge -- which\nis what a section approaches from -- is unchanged.\n\nChecked at 1440x900 and at 375x812 with mobile emulation, scrolling to the\nbottom of the home page, all ten landing pages, responsible-borrowing,\nhow-it-works, faq, kalkulator, the guides index and an article,\nkak-podrezhdame-ofertite and loans, using the same large jumps that exposed the\nregression. Nothing left below full opacity on any of them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b184c7b4285c607a7d9580bb01602d5e34dc011d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/b184c7b4285c607a7d9580bb01602d5e34dc011d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/6f7b99d78fba771c9cca5719123c20b0c9b3f6fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/6f7b99d78fba771c9cca5719123c20b0c9b3f6fe","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDZmN2I5OWQ3OGZiYTc3MWM5Y2NhNTcxOTEyM2MyMGIwYzliM2Y2ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","sha":"d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27"}],"sha":"6f7b99d78fba771c9cca5719123c20b0c9b3f6fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/6f7b99d78fba771c9cca5719123c20b0c9b3f6fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:57:07Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:57:40Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"feat(i18n): translate the landing pages and guides into English\n\nSwitching to English on /krediti left the whole article in Bulgarian, which\nread as a broken language toggle. It was not: the chrome switched correctly and\nthe page said \"This page is available in Bulgarian only.\" The landing pages and\nthe guides took their prose from lib/landing-content.ts and lib/guides-content.ts\nrather than from the message catalogues, so there was no English to switch to.\n\nNow there is. All 10 landing pages and both guides are translated, and the copy\nis keyed by locale -- Record<Locale, LandingCopy> instead of flat fields -- so\nthe type system refuses a page that ships in one language only. That was the\nactual hole: nothing stopped a new landing page from claiming an /en twin it\ndid not have.\n\nThe Bulgarian literals still sitting inside the components move into the\ncatalogues as landing.* and guides.*: the section headings, the related-links\nlabel, the \"Veyra is not a lender\" footnote, the reading time and updated date.\nRelated and guide link labels derive from each page''s own eyebrow and title, so\nthey follow the locale without a second copy of the same words. The lang=\"bg\"\noverride on the article is gone -- the prose now matches the document language\ninstead of contradicting it.\n\nSEO follows the content. PAGE_SEO_EN gains all 10 landings and /guides, guides\ncanonicalise per locale, both languages are cross-declared with Bulgarian as\nx-default, and the sitemap goes from 26 URLs to 52 -- an even split. Nothing is\nnoindex any more.\n\nThat makes the Bulgarian-only machinery dead, so lib/bg-only.ts, BgOnlyNotice\nand common.bgOnlyContent are deleted along with the branch they drove in\nbuildMetadata.\n\nThe English is a translation, not a rewrite: every \"Veyra is not a lender\",\n\"we do not guarantee approval\" and \"the decision belongs to the lender\" carries\nover, and nothing promises speed or ease of obtaining credit. Like the\nBulgarian, it has not been through native-speaker or legal review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dbf23f2d700453a06a0f7e69c03cd820b0ee065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/7dbf23f2d700453a06a0f7e69c03cd820b0ee065"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGRiNzNmYmQxNjBkZjU4NzE1MjhmMWEwZDU0YmM4M2U5MjFkNDBlYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6","sha":"c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6"}],"sha":"db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/db73fbd160df5871528f1a0d54bc83e921d40eb1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194582360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99","id":194582360,"login":"vulko99","node_id":"U_kgDOC5kXWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:52:42Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:52:42Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"chore(deploy): open the application funnel on the Render demo\n\nThe funnel is gated behind pre-launch mode (config/launch.ts), which defaults\nto ON and replaces /apply + /results with a \"not accepting applications\"\nnotice. The demo needs the form live so partners can walk the flow end to end,\nso set NEXT_PUBLIC_PRELAUNCH=false for the frontend service. No funnel or\ncompliance code is changed — this only flips the deploy flag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"842a847e0137b37ef04748c3baf7c3f18abc55e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/842a847e0137b37ef04748c3baf7c3f18abc55e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/35e0fbd98d2ba25ae9c9d0294efc85a2cbb2e5ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 842a847e0137b37ef04748c3baf7c3f18abc55e8\nparent f8d9e158e968b9de1e0d023e3acc875ace2bce56\nauthor Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788292362 +0000\ncommitter Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788292362 +0000\n\nchore(deploy): open the application funnel on the Render demo\n\nThe funnel is gated behind pre-launch mode (config/launch.ts), which defaults\nto ON and replaces /apply + /results with a \"not accepting applications\"\nnotice. The demo needs the form live so partners can walk the flow end to end,\nso set NEXT_PUBLIC_PRELAUNCH=false for the frontend service. No funnel or\ncompliance code is changed — this only flips the deploy flag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBXegtL3\ntWEM9W8Ve0kW4UdzZsr+M962vOVQwVSzfB0Adci41oTLjRBFAumXoIEnmM8xx1JLq02hyTVRUjZG\nyA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194582360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulk