ace2bce56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/3398308a405c19cbf7391a5a21942e617baa1dc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:48:02Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:48:02Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(header): drop the nav''s calculator entry while the funnel is closed\n\nThe bar''s CTA is a PrimaryCta, so pre-launch it is rewritten to point at\nthe calculator -- leaving the nav''s own \"Калкулатор\" entry as a second\nlink to the same page in the same row, and a second in the same column\non the mobile panel.\n\nFiltered on href against PRELAUNCH_CTA_HREF rather than dropping the\ncalculator by name, so the dedup follows if that constant ever moves.\nThe entry returns at launch, when the CTA points at /apply instead.\n\nNothing is lost by removing it: the CTA is a real link to the same page\nand renders everywhere the nav does, so the site-wide internal link to\n/kalkulator survives. Also noted on the breakpoint comment that its\n898px measurement describes the full five-item nav.\n\nVerified on production builds: pre-launch the desktop nav renders four\nitems with no calculator entry; with NEXT_PUBLIC_PRELAUNCH=false all five\nreturn and the pill points at /apply.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"091a6b0be75af373e47ded05ee44570092b78834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/091a6b0be75af373e47ded05ee44570092b78834"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/3398308a405c19cbf7391a5a21942e617baa1dc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/3398308a405c19cbf7391a5a21942e617baa1dc4","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDMzOTgzMDhhNDA1YzE5Y2JmNzM5MWE1YTIxOTQyZTYxN2JhYTFkYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae","sha":"e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae"}],"sha":"3398308a405c19cbf7391a5a21942e617baa1dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/3398308a405c19cbf7391a5a21942e617baa1dc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:38:15Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:38:15Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(cta): make the pre-launch calls to action match where they lead\n\nPrimaryCta rewrites itself to the calculator while the funnel is closed,\nand two things around it were never updated to follow.\n\nThe landing hero put a fixed calculator link beside it, so all ten SEO\npages rendered two buttons to /kalkulator side by side. CalculatorLink\nbecomes SecondaryCta and mirrors the same gate: guides while the funnel\nis closed, the calculator once it opens. The pre-launch destination is a\nnamed constant next to PRELAUNCH_CTA_HREF, and the pairing matches the\none PrelaunchNotice already uses. PrimaryCta stays the only thing that\ndecides where /apply lives.\n\nThe closing CTA cards then promised what their button could not deliver\n-- \"Кандидатствай онлайн с една заявка\" above a link to the calculator,\ninviting exactly the application pre-launch mode exists to prevent. They\nnow swap to copy about the calculator, leading with what the visitor can\ndo and stating the constraint second. The landing and guide cards read\nthe Bulgarian catalogue directly because they sit inside the lang=\"bg\"\narticle; home is fully localized and reads the visitor''s own. No page\ncopy was rewritten -- all ten tailored pairs return untouched at launch.\n\nVerified on production builds in both states and both locales.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fff525830ff75083373dbdd4b7381281807ba813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/fff525830ff75083373dbdd4b7381281807ba813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGUwMDdjMDk2Yjg1OTRjOWM0ZmZhMzNiMTVjZDdiMTcwNWYwM2MzYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","sha":"d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27"}],"sha":"e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/e007c096b8594c9c4ffa33b15cd7b1705f03c3ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:28:36Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:28:36Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(ui): animate the block that sits at the fold, which had no entrance at all\n\nOn the landing pages the first section under the header never moved, while\nevery section below it blurred in on scroll.\n\nScrollReveal skips any .reveal-scroll element already on screen when it runs:\n\n    const alreadyOnScreen = el.getBoundingClientRect().top < innerHeight * 0.92;\n    if (alreadyOnScreen) continue;\n\nThat rule is right and has to stay. The server''s HTML is painted before React\nhydrates, so arming a section that is already visible would flash it away and\nanimate it back in -- worse than no animation. But the consequence was that the\none block most likely to be at the fold got nothing.\n\nFixing it needs the hidden state to be in the server markup rather than applied\nafterwards, so there is no moment where the block is visible and then hidden.\nThat is what `.reveal` already does for page headers, so this is the same\nmechanism with a delay that picks up where the header''s stagger ends (0.28s),\nletting the page read as one sequence instead of two things starting at once.\nFail-safe in the same way: `both` leaves the element at the animation''s end\nstate, so a browser that never runs it still shows the content.\n\nApplied to the first section of the landing template (all 10 pages) and to the\nguides article body, which starts directly under its intro. PageShell pages\nalready had it without my noticing: their sections container sits inside the\n`.reveal` wrapper, so it animates as that wrapper''s fourth child.\n\nVerified on /krediti with the tab visible -- animation-name blur-up, 0.7s after\na 0.34s delay: held at opacity 0 / blur 10px through the header''s stagger, then\n0.66 / 3.36px at 450ms, 0.97 / 0.25px at 700ms, fully resolved by 1040ms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8441b8b4d3605c2fdc6ce317f5cd5658aa2aa819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/8441b8b4d3605c2fdc6ce317f5cd5658aa2aa819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGM5MmVjMmIwNGY2ODE3MTUzYWU4OTZkODdiYThhNzRhMmVmNjJkYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","sha":"d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27"}],"sha":"c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/c92ec2b04f6817153ae896d87ba8a74a2ef62da6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:21:34Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:21:34Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(chrome): keep the marketing header and footer off the application flow\n\nReported as a useless white strip above the footer on the application form.\nThe strip was the page background showing between the bottom of the dark app\nshell and a footer that should not have been rendered there at all.\n\nBoth SiteHeader and SiteFooter stood down on the funnel by testing\n`pathname.startsWith(\"/apply\")`. That was correct until locales moved into the\nURL, and then broke in two directions at once:\n\n  - `/en/apply` does not start with `/apply`, so the whole English funnel and\n    the English results page carried the marketing chrome\n  - the middleware rewrite means the server sees `/bg/apply` for the Bulgarian\n    page, so on those the header and footer were server-rendered and then\n    removed again on the client\n\nBoth now go through one locale-aware helper that strips the prefix first, so\nthere is a single definition instead of two copies drifting apart. The funnel\nkeeps its own chrome (the logo, language switcher and step counter in\nWizardStep), which is what should be there.\n\nAlso adds a Tools section to the home page. The application is one way into\nVeyra, not the only one, and the calculator previously appeared only in the nav\nand the footer: it now has a home on the front page alongside the guides and\nthe ranking-transparency page, all three usable without starting an\napplication. Card labels read \"Отвори\"/\"Open\" rather than the wizard''s\n\"Continue\", which would imply resuming something already in progress.\n\nThe new copy is descriptive only -- nothing claiming ease or speed of\nobtaining credit, per the note at the top of the Bulgarian catalogue.\n\nVerified: header and footer absent from /apply, /apply/*, /results and every\n/en twin, and still present on all marketing pages; the app shell now fills the\nviewport exactly, so there is no strip; funnel logo resolves to /en inside the\nEnglish funnel; tool cards link locale-correctly. 76/76 pages build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2228afced5c2257a1552377916e9c906a6cc7911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/2228afced5c2257a1552377916e9c906a6cc7911"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGQ0NGQ5YTEyMWEwZTBjYzUyYmYwODIyODMzMjJiYjIwYzZjYjVmMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43","sha":"4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43"}],"sha":"d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/d44d9a121a0e0cc52bf082283322bb20c6cb5f27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:03:27Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T19:03:27Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"feat(ui): extend the scroll reveal to the pages it had missed\n\nThe blur-and-rise entrance covered the home page, how-it-works,\nresponsible-borrowing, and the seven pages built on PageShell -- because\nPageShell''s Section carries it, so one edit covered all seven at once. Every\npage with a bespoke layout got only the load reveal on its header, and then\neverything below it simply sat there.\n\nThat was coverage following the component structure, not a decision. Fixed:\n\n- LandingPage (all 10 SEO landing pages at once): each content section, the\n  related-links row, the guides list, the disclosures panel, the FAQ and the\n  closing CTA\n- guides index and guide articles\n- faq (the accordion as one block, not per item -- eight separate reveals in a\n  list reads as flickering rather than as an entrance)\n- kalkulator (the calculator, and the trailing SEO section)\n- kak-podrezhdame-ofertite (all six sections)\n\nThe wizard steps and /results are deliberately left out. They use `.reveal` on\nstep change, which is the right entrance where each step replaces the last;\na scroll reveal would arm content that never scrolls.\n\nThe mandatory credit warning on /kalkulator is also left un-animated. It is\nregulated copy that should be readable the instant the page is.\n\nVerified with the browser tab fronted, which matters: in a hidden tab\nIntersectionObserver never fires and CSS transitions do not advance, so the\nreveal cannot be observed at all -- the fail-safe unarms everything instead,\nwhich is exactly what it is there for. Visible, on /krediti: 8 blocks, 7 armed\non load (the 8th above the fold, correctly skipped), and scrolling one into\nview takes it from opacity 0 / blur 10px to opacity 1 / blur 0 unprompted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"016fb86f7553a1821a8a586a6d523cd43fa21519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/016fb86f7553a1821a8a586a6d523cd43fa21519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDRmNmUwYWViYWFiMGM1Y2NmZGJjODYxNTRlMjAxOGM2MzUwNDVhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/927b1c18099e9ae113ec48970ff6cd803ded1a9c","sha":"927b1c18099e9ae113ec48970ff6cd803ded1a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/927b1c18099e9ae113ec48970ff6cd803ded1a9c"}],"sha":"4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4f6e0aebaab0c5ccfdbc86154e2018c635045a43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://ava