ts/5e9608109f04fa7b112cf922b8e6c12ea137fff1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:37:46Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:37:46Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(i18n): sync the English copy with the compliance rewrite\n\nPR #3 reworded the Bulgarian catalogue for ЗПК/Google Ads compliance — speed\nand ease claims removed, published criteria made explicit, consent narrowed to\nnamed recipients. The English catalogue still carried the old wording, so the\ntwo languages made materially different statements about the same product.\n\nBrings across: the meta title and description; the home headline, subhead,\nCTAs, trust row, feature and step copy (\"2 min to complete\" and \"three steps\"\ngone, \"against publicly published criteria\" in); and the partner-sharing\nconsent, which now says data goes only to the partners the applicant selects\nand names each as an independent controller.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3e4222f34001d71be091290930d039a8afb4812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/c3e4222f34001d71be091290930d039a8afb4812"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/5e9608109f04fa7b112cf922b8e6c12ea137fff1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","rece