aunch mode defaults ON, so the\nfunnel stays closed until NEXT_PUBLIC_PRELAUNCH=false is set deliberately.","tree":{"sha":"6e9408585c66a3b29d23784262c9f900a0ec8c1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/6e9408585c66a3b29d23784262c9f900a0ec8c1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/3816fec72701bc023ea7805edebd256d4ef42b59","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e9408585c66a3b29d23784262c9f900a0ec8c1f\nparent a78d008891f3b06e7a6d8db236c830645aaa63d2\nparent 3f80723ef3981d1ac9b88e53e1bae688f91d8952\nauthor Alaa <alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com> 1788261922 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788261922 +0400\n\nMerge PR #3: Bulgarian consumer-credit compliance\n\nImplements the website change brief for the Bulgarian market ahead of the\n20 November 2026 Consumer Credit Act deadline.\n\nMerged as logical commits rather than squashed, so each compliance surface\nstays independently reviewable and revertable.\n\nVerified on the deploy preview before merge: hero repositioned, speed/ease\nclaims gone, credit warning renders, disclosures render with loud\nplaceholders, /apply closed by pre-launch mode, robots.txt serves as valid\ntext/plain, 130 backend tests pass.\n\nNOT production-ready. TODO-LEGAL.md lists 16 outstanding regulated values,\nall blocked on registering the company. Pre-launch mode defaults ON, so the\nfunnel stays closed until NEXT_PUBLIC_PRELAUNCH=false is set deliberately.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlrYiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPT8QAETYES0NL1shkndoPy5ieXi6\nhARjNe9i6S80zUfFIfICwempu49bge6cpu30pYwdw9BfS7U3mHUEITjdT+70BqQa\nkzDvxF2RpeQ4oU8AhGF1j21Zv0LawUMTSBbKnG36s1MVn9OsCR7U1ApCpk/B/R75\nC52OMRgix+EZ3G7gh9Wr0qim6uwj+bO7iJJdeS2OXmOmy6cWkbWJZyD1Q7Ym1GtU\nqpUU8nSaV4Ce3u3x+K12i9TbIRFlH1WnDXonez1NK2e9xymUUPOKrimElaP3Or16\n4imuMUxfk25HWbotsMy4sYIehQ+DM6nzIiplNzKSzsO6OY5iNPSyqge25YAnc7lJ\n/TlgZSSsSox5DWQ/h1acDyqncY5U7pLLNloQj1YIVwF6N5jjrYh3Uch1xUNVoBBP\nmlSJEa4YhU5CGL1TwRrkx