1bc023ea7805edebd256d4ef42b59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/3816fec72701bc023ea7805edebd256d4ef42b59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/3f80723ef3981d1ac9b88e53e1bae688f91d8952/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:23:57Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:23:57Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"Merge base branch: resolve conflicts, make compliance surfaces locale-aware\n\nThe base branch gained 11 commits while this work was in flight, including\na Bulgarian/English language switcher in the site header.\n\nFour conflicts, all \"take both\":\n\n  app/page.tsx          their min-[480px] CTA breakpoint + my <PrimaryCta>\n  app/results/page.tsx  my CreditWarning import + their Phase2Application\n  LandingPage.tsx       their breakpoint + my CreditWarning and <PrimaryCta>\n  SiteHeader.tsx        their <LanguageToggle> + my <PrimaryCta>\n\nThe switcher also caused a real defect, not just a textual conflict. The\ncompliance components were written when English was unreachable, so they\nread getMessages(defaultLocale) directly — they would have stayed Bulgarian\nafter a reader switched to English. A ranking disclosure the reader cannot\nread is not a disclosure. Now locale-aware:\n\n  CreditWarning, LegalDisclosures, CompanyIdentity, PartnerList,\n  and the /kak-podrezhdame-ofertite page (plus its two hardcoded nav\n  labels, which the switcher turned into a bug).\n\nCREDIT_WARNING itself deliberately stays Bulgarian in every locale: it is\nstatutory wording mandated in Bulgarian, not copy to be translated. Noted\nin the component so it is not \"fixed\" later.\n\napp/layout.tsx and app/faq/layout.tsx keep getMessages(defaultLocale) on\npurpose — they feed metadata and JSON-LD, which should stay canonical\nrather than follow a per-visitor toggle.\n\nVerified after merge: typecheck, lint, 41 pages built, 130 backend tests\npassed, credit warning and disclosures render, /apply closed, language\ntoggle renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e9408585c66a3b29d23784262c9f900a0ec8c1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/6e9408585c66a3b29d23784262c9f900a0ec8c1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/3f80723ef3981d1ac9b88e53e1bae688f91d8952","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/us