ode_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/db76fe28d6040488d260064f122f1093375e17ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:08:05Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:08:05Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"feat(i18n): add a Bulgarian/English switcher to the site header\n\nThe I18n provider already persisted a locale choice per visitor, but nothing\nin the UI let anyone make that choice — English was reachable only by setting\nstorage by hand.\n\nLanguageToggle renders both locales as explicit segments rather than one\ncycling button: with two locales, showing both makes the current one and the\nalternative readable at a glance, which matters when the label you can read\nis the one you are switching away from. Sighted users get the compact code,\nscreen readers get the language''s own name.\n\nIn the header it sits inline on desktop, and on mobile beside the menu button\nrather than inside the panel, so it is reachable without opening the menu.\n\nAdds the nav.language label to both dictionaries and language_changed to the\nanalytics event union.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"064ced2f8b4075ce933e5aa4f827fcce4a9ee5ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/064ced2f8b4075ce933e5aa4f827fcce4a9ee5ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/db76fe28d6040488d260064f122f1093375