"html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/325e47e5e430b3a01ec2bab446b6092d11729f00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:08:03Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:08:03Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(trust): company identity on the About page, phone on Contact\n\n§4.3 requires the identity block on the footer AND the About page. I\nonly did the footer — this closes that gap.\n\nThe Contact page listed the general and privacy email addresses but no\nphone number, which is one of the required contact details. Added it\nwhere someone would actually look for it, rendering the loud placeholder\nif it is still unfilled rather than quietly omitting the row.\n\nNo values are supplied here: legal name, ЕИК, VAT, address and phone\nremain [[TODO:*]] until the owner provides them (TODO-LEGAL.md §1). This\nis the wiring, so that supplying the env vars is all that is left.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6b389ceb68cf3399cce538a7135428905339e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/f6b389ceb68cf3399cce538a7135428905339e84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/325e47e5e430b3a01ec2bab446b6092d11729f00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at