izations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/8a47cf1f684e5aa2fb609f1d38aac4644251fdb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:05:55Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:05:55Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(design): restore the brand lockup source to design/\n\nRestores the file removed in the previous commit, byte-identical\n(blob c0652f42), renamed from \"ChatGPT Image Aug 28, 2026, 12_59_35 PM.png\"\nto design/veyra-lockup-source.png.\n\nI had called it a stray. It is not: it is the untrimmed original of the\nlockup, and frontend/public/veyra-logo.png and veyra-logo-white.png are\nits trimmed derivatives (both 1458x379, matching LOCKUP_RATIO in\ncomponents/Logo.tsx).\n\ndesign/README.md records what the file is, which production assets come\nfrom it, and the coupling to LOCKUP_RATIO — so re-cropping the source\nwithout updating that constant does not silently break the header and\nfooter logos. It also states plainly that source assets are unreferenced\nby design, so the next person does not delete it as junk the way I\nnearly did.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01c17e7c57f52a8f17f15adc5bfe5252128c24f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/01c17e7c57f52a8f17f15adc5bfe5252128c24f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/8a47cf1f684e5aa2fb609f1d38aac4644251fdb3","verification":{"payload":nu