ives of it — veyra-logo.png and veyra-logo-white.png are\nboth 1458x379, matching LOCKUP_RATIO in components/Logo.tsx.\n\nRemoving it from HEAD only. The blob stays in history and can be\nrestored at any time with:\n\n  git show ''8355b83:ChatGPT Image Aug 28, 2026, 12_59_35 PM.png'' > logo-source.png\n\nIf the padded original is worth keeping to hand, a design/ directory or\nan asset store is a better home for it than the repo root.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f71e954df623e88de432cad64fe71bacc4b13505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/f71e954df623e88de432cad64fe71bacc4b13505"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/5edd7eca3d1986769d65bc42065856cfbfaa1f01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/5edd7eca3d1986769d65bc42065856cfbfaa1f01","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDVlZGQ3ZWNhM2QxOTg2NzY5ZDY1YmM0MjA2NTg1NmNmYmZhYTFmMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/4a91873fcacfb8a52ef900e97812a672da2f311c","sha":"4a91873fcacfb8a52ef900e97812a672da2f311c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4a91873fcacfb8a52ef900e97812a672da2f311c"}],"sha":"5edd7eca3d1986769d65bc42065856cfbfaa1f01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/5edd7eca3d1986769d65bc42065856cfbfaa1f01"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4a91873fcacfb8a52ef900e97812a672da2f311c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:01:13Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T11:01:13Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"test(backend): cover ad_eligible and consent wording versioning\n\ntest_ad_eligible_defaults_to_true — new products are advertisable\nunless explicitly marked otherwise.\n\ntest_ad_eligible_does_not_affect_matching — the important one. The flag\ngoverns the advertising surface only; flipping it must not change which\noptions a borrower is shown, so the test compares the full\n(product, score, rank) result set before and after and asserts they are\nidentical. Guards against someone \"helpfully\" filtering on it in the\nmatching engine later.\n\ntest_consent_records_wording_version_not_policy_version — regression\nguard for the bug fixed earlier in this branch: consent_text_version was\nbeing filled with PRIVACY_POLICY_VERSION, so changing the consent\ncheckbox copy left no trace and we could not prove what a user had\nagreed to. Asserts all three versions are tracked independently through\nthe API.\n\nVerified by execution (Python 3.12 was installed but shadowed by the\nStore alias, hence the earlier report that it was unavailable):\n\n  pytest                       130 passed\n  makemigrations --check       No changes detected — the hand-written\n                               0008 migration matches the model state\n  migrate                      lenders.0008 applies cleanly\n  ruff                         no new findings (the 5 reported are all\n                               pre-existing and untouched)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15b528064694bf0bbf38e597d2ecbf701802660e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/15b528064694bf0bbf38e597d2ecbf701802660e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/4a91873fcacfb8a52ef900e97812a672da2f311c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizati