99/Veyra/commits/dd89ccd371bd73eef05056697a6519cb160b97ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:57:03Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:59:56Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"chore(lint): block the marketing placeholder from applicant-facing surfaces\n\nGuards the bug fixed in faed845, where the results page rendered\nhome.viz.requestValue — the fixed \"€2 000 · 12 месеца\" motif — under the\n\"Твоята заявка\" / \"Your request\" label.\n\nTwo no-restricted-syntax rules:\n\n- Any `.requestValue` property access outside components/MatchingViz.tsx and\n  app/how-it-works/page.tsx, the two illustrations where the motif depicts a\n  hypothetical request. Matching on the property name rather than the full\n  path catches the aliased form the bug actually took (`const v = m.home.viz`\n  then `v.requestValue`).\n- Any `home.viz` access anywhere under app/apply/, which shows the applicant\n  their own answers and has no use for landing-page decoration.\n\nConverted .eslintrc.json to .eslintrc.js so the reasoning lives next to the\nselectors; JSON has no comments and the rule is not self-explanatory.\n\nVerified by reintroducing both shapes: each is reported with its message,\nand the two decorative files still lint clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18f6e1963a59d388940c8d8c77ffed8a2f21fe85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/18f6e1963a59d388940c8d8c77ffed8a2f21fe85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/dd89ccd371bd73eef05056697a6519cb160b97ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/follo