mits/4dbe2362f77d97ae3fe669e0a4fb76cb58e5533b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4823a08090749334b3ce504e3c17809198f56f15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:50:54Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:50:54Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(perf,content): footer logo LCP regression + FAQ coverage gaps\n\nLCP. Logo hardcoded `priority`, so the FOOTER logo emitted a\nhigh-priority image preload on every page for something below the fold,\ncompeting with the real LCP element. `priority` is now opt-in: the site\nheader and the application-flow chrome set it, the footer does not.\nHomepage high-priority image preloads drop from 2 to 1.\n\nFAQ (§7.4). The brief asks the FAQ to cover five things. \"Is Veyra a\nlender\", \"how does Veyra make money\" and the compatibility score were\nalready covered; two were missing and one was too vague to be useful:\n\n  * \"Кой вижда данните ми?\" — new. Veyra plus only the partners you\n    select; not broadcast, not sold; each partner is an independent\n    controller; links to the published list.\n  * \"Какво се случва, след като избера партньор?\" — new. What is passed,\n    that you go to the partner''s site, and that the decision is theirs.\n  * The credit-record answer now says plainly that Veyra runs no ЦКР\n    query and no credit assessment, and that a partner may run its own.\n    Verified against the backend: there is no credit-bureau integration\n    anywhere, so the claim is accurate.\n\nBoth mirrored in the English catalog. FAQPage structured data picks the\nnew entries up automatically.\n\nChecked while here and found already correct, so left alone: fonts ship\nthe Cyrillic subset (u+0400-045f) for both families with font-display\nswap and next/font''s size-adjusted fallbacks, which is what prevents the\nreflow §6.5 warns about; logos already go through next/image, so the\nheavy PNG sources are served resized as WebP/AVIF.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dbc7516d35e395bdcb581e6deb4694f3e400d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/4dbc7516d35e395bdcb581e6deb4694f3e400d3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/4823a08090749334b3ce504e3c17809198f56f15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/4823a08090749334b3ce504e3c17809198f56f15","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDQ4MjNhMDgwOTA3NDkzMzRiM2NlNTA0ZTNjMTc4MDkxOThmNTZmMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed","sha":"8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed"}],"sha":"4823a08090749334b3ce504e3c17809198f56f15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/4823a08090749334b3ce504e3c17809198f56f15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:46:35Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:46:35Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"feat(build): guard against shipping unfilled regulated values\n\nThe site already renders [[TODO:*]] placeholders loudly so a missing\nregulated value fails in review. This is the other half: it stops a\nhalf-filled config reaching production at all.\n\nDeliberately asymmetric, so the partner-preview deploy keeps working\nwhile the values are still being gathered:\n\n  production build          blocking findings fail the build (exit 1)\n  preview / branch / local  everything reported as a warning (exit 0)\n\nProduction is CONTEXT=production (set by Netlify), with an explicit\nREQUIRE_LEGAL_VALUES=true|false override for CI or a deliberate bypass.\n\nBlocking: company identity, disclosures, representative example.\nWarning: VAT, empty partner list, unset domain — and the statutory\nwarning wording, which BECOMES BLOCKING on 20 Nov 2026, when the Act is\nin force and shipping unconfirmed wording is a real breach rather than a\npending task.\n\nEnv is loaded through @next/env so values set in .env.local are seen and\nthe guard does not false-positive locally. Wired in as the npm prebuild\nhook, and available standalone as `npm run check:legal`.\n\nCurrently reports 16 blocking, 4 warnings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b4292ab0a03be3187d3206f7c91d4f9b70b893f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/5b4292ab0a03be3187d3206f7c91d4f9b70b893f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKDg4NTZiY2RjYjcwMGYyNTI5NDhiZTlmMmExOWY0YWJlODM4MjE1ZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/5ef1807a27abf9ddfdb1f3b7e86869a1a6a68036","sha":"5ef1807a27abf9ddfdb1f3b7e86869a1a6a68036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/5ef1807a27abf9ddfdb1f3b7e86869a1a6a68036"}],"sha":"8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/8856bcdcb700f252948be9f2a19f4abe838215ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/fc31752a051e8f6ad945526dc5ae2c3fae19ebb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:43:45Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:43:45Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"fix(results): fall back to the local draft when it matches the application\n\nAdopts the better half of the alternative fix in #1.\n\nThe summary previously waited on getApplication before it could render, so\nthe card briefly showed a bare label, and a transient API failure dropped it\nentirely. The local draft now stands in — but only when publicId equals the\napplication in the URL, so a shared results link pointing at a different\napplication can never pull in this browser''s leftover values.\n\nAlso moves the requestValue computation up into ResultsInner and hides the\nwhole viz block when no value is available, rather than hiding just the value\nline and leaving an orphaned \"Твоята заявка\" label.\n\nThe stored application stays authoritative; the draft is only a stand-in\nuntil it loads. The cancelled guard on the fetch is kept, so a response for a\nprevious application id cannot land after the id changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a323543184a0e07506c5b14c7d53a0170f0c2d77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/a323543184a0e07506c5b14c7d53a0170f0c2d77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/fc31752a051e8f6ad945526dc5ae2c3fae19ebb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/fc31752a051e8f6ad945526dc5ae2c3fae19ebb6","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGZjMzE3NTJhMDUxZThmNmFkOTQ1NTI2ZGM1YWUyYzNmYWUxOWViYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/00cc5d263da157c071600e698e80fd295fc4a14d","sha":"00cc5d263da157c071600e698e80fd295fc4a14d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/00cc5d263da157c071600e698e80fd295fc4a14d"}],"sha":"fc31752a051e8f6ad945526dc5ae2c3fae19ebb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/fc31752a051e8f6ad945526dc5ae2c3fae19ebb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218256958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alaahlb","id":218256958,"login":"alaahlb","node_id":"U_kgDODQJWPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alaahlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/5ef1807a27abf9ddfdb1f3b7e86869a1a6a68036/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:35:23Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:35:23Z","email":"alaahalabibusiness@gmail.com","name":"alaahlb"},"message":"feat(content): loan-purpose pages for personal, car and home-improvement\n\nCompletes the §7.2 set. The repo already covered кредити онлайн, бързи\nкредити, кредит онлайн, лошо ЦКР, кредит до заплата, без трудов договор\nand обединяване; the three suggested intents still missing were personal\nloan, car loan and home improvement.\n\nWritten as real guidance rather than keyword filler — these are YMYL\npages and Google applies elevated quality scrutiny regardless of\nlanguage. Each covers what the money is typically for, what actually\ndrives the total cost (ГПР over headline interest), what the lender\nassesses, and what to check before signing.\n\nNo speed or ease framing, no approval claims, no invented rates: the car\npage explains the three financing structures without asserting which is\ncheaper, and the renovation page argues for borrowing less rather than\nmore. All three inherit the credit warning and disclosures block from\n<LandingPage>, are marked adEligible, and are picked up automatically by\nthe sitemap and the cross-linking nav.\n\nBulgarian copy here needs the same native review as the rest\n(TODO-LEGAL.md §8).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":