com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/6573933cef12e5adcfcaa23cf44aee22e9bdb0d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:41:01Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:41:01Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"chore(legal): add legal/disclosure config and TODO-LEGAL register\n\nIntroduces the single-source config the compliance work reads from, with\nevery unconfirmed regulated value left as a loud [[TODO:*]] placeholder\nrather than a plausible-looking invention:\n\n  config/legal.ts        CREDIT_WARNING (config constant, not inline text),\n                         APR_CAP as a dated value with the 1 Jan / 1 Jul\n                         reset schedule documented, MIN_AGE.\n  config/disclosures.ts  Google Ads / ЗПК чл.25 disclosures + representative\n                         example, plus DISCLOSURES_INCOMPLETE so the UI can\n                         fail visibly while unfilled.\n  config/company.ts      Legal entity, ЕИК, VAT, registered address, phone.\n  config/partners.ts     Real signed partners only — currently empty.\n\nTODO-LEGAL.md collects every placeholder into one list for the owner.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1f9689fd1a0bac4a82272123ffe75e3904333c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/b1f9689fd1a0bac4a82272123ffe75e3904333c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/6573933cef12e5adcfcaa23cf44aee22e9bdb0d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194582360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followi