,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/37cc1b8e198e854164f068ab5972690ed2ba3909/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:29:15Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:29:15Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"fix(results): distinct headline/subhead for zero-match state\n\nWhen matching returns zero partners, show a no-match headline and subhead\ninstead of the success copy. The success (match) state, layout, styling and\nnavigation are unchanged. Adds emptyHeadline/emptySubhead to the bg/en\ncatalogs and switches the results header dynamically on match count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"b421d635a96a550fa802e38451ead06609c866ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/b421d635a96a550fa802e38451ead06609c866ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/37cc1b8e198e854164f068ab5972690ed2ba3909","verification":{"payload":"tree b421d635a96a550fa802e38451ead06609c866ac\nparent 54f841b9dd303cf51ae86c2d70d4b48594c1c934\nauthor Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788175755 +0000\ncommitter Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788175755 +0000\n\nfix(results): distinct headline/subhead for zero-match state\n\nWhen matching returns zero partners, show a no-match headline and subhead\ninstead of the success copy. The success (match) state, layout, styling and\nnavigation are unchanged. Adds emptyHeadline/emptySubhead to the bg/en\ncatalogs and switches the results header dynamically on match count.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2\n","rea