0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:41:52Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:41:52Z","email":"vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com","name":"Veyra"},"message":"Fix Render blueprint: dockerCommand for Docker service + relative API base\n\n- Render rejects `startCommand` on a Docker-runtime service (\"docker runtime\n  must not have startCommand\"); rename it to `dockerCommand`.\n- Frontend now builds with NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api/v1 so the browser calls the\n  same origin and the Next server proxies /api/* to API_PROXY_TARGET — without\n  it the built app calls http://localhost:8000 and the apply flow fails.\n- Add DEMO_MODE=true so the deployed backend serves the demo partners with\n  simulated referrals.\n\nDeploy config only; no application changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2","tree":{"sha":"fa6f9ec852738a2677f552b9f9474d8ee3d0e999","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/trees/fa6f9ec852738a2677f552b9f9474d8ee3d0e999"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/git/commits/aae950a79513eabe58299fa74c2501f5e7591e50","verification":{"payload":"tree fa6f9ec852738a2677f552b9f9474d8ee3d0e999\nparent 2697023ad6a2d3429b60920a19432a0ad2975f23\nauthor Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788172912 +0000\ncommitter Veyra <vulkoshishkov87@gmail.com> 1788172912 +0000\n\nFix Render blueprint: dockerCommand for Docker service + relative API base\n\n- Render rejects `startCommand` on a Docker-runtime service (\"docker runtime\n  must not have startCommand\"); rename it to `dockerCommand`.\n- Frontend now builds with NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api/v1 so the browser calls the\n  same origin and the Next server proxies /api/* to API_PROXY_TARGET — without\n  it the built app calls http://localhost:8000 and the apply flow fails.\n- Add DEMO_MODE=true so the deployed backend serves the demo partners with\n  simulated referrals.\n\nDeploy config only; no application changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KffmA1kzYNwRxH6iUnodE2\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGOeHENn\nBGPE89t6tjZgs4LPj/wqoBYAm3bILarjqTQ8Qy/XFXeyRZkXscwMLueUyGLy1EpIjKSoEtB2Wbv0\ndg4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194582360?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99","id":194582360,"login":"vulko99","node_id":"U_kgDOC5kXWA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vulko99","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/aae950a79513eabe58299fa74c2501f5e7591e50","node_id":"C_kwDOUCSFDdoAKGFhZTk1MGE3OTUxM2VhYmU1ODI5OWZhNzRjMjUwMWY1ZTc1OTFlNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vulko99/Veyra/commit/2697023ad6a2d3429b60920a19432a0ad2975f23","sha":"2697023ad6a2d3429b60920a19432a0ad2975f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vulko99/Veyra/commits/2697023ad6a2d3429b60920a19432a0ad2975f23"}],"sha":"aae950a79513eabe58299fa74c2501f5e7591e