pi.github.com/users/natibs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natibs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natibs/mfe-platform/commits/fd1c736dddcdf2df874fa3e5b3c63011eaa09beb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T10:28:43Z","email":"nati.bs@gmail.com","name":"Nati Ben-Shalom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T10:28:43Z","email":"nati.bs@gmail.com","name":"Nati Ben-Shalom"},"message":"Fix theming/responsiveness, move route paths into shell, strip comments\n\n- Fix dark-mode contrast: replace hardcoded/non-theme-aware colors with\n  theme-aware neutral tokens across shell and every remote; add an explicit\n  body background/color reset instead of relying on browser default canvas.\n- Make the layout responsive: sidebar collapses to a horizontal top bar\n  under 768px, shell content gets a centered max-width container, no more\n  horizontal overflow at any width.\n- Shell now controls the platform font (Tahoma); each remote falls back to\n  Google''s Alef only when run standalone on its own dev port, so it''s\n  visibly distinguishable from the composed experience.\n- Move ROUTE_PATHS/NAV_ITEMS out of the shared-state library into\n  shell-app/src/app/nav-config.ts (the shell owns routing, not a shared\n  package) and pass them into sidebar-mfe as component inputs via\n  RemoteOutletComponent instead. login-mfe''s own login/signup/forgot-password\n  path segments now live locally in that app instead of being shared.\n- Pin ui-components'' local @angular/core to the same patch version every\n  consuming app installs, fixing a compiler crash on signal inputs with\n  union types caused by the version drift.\n- Strip explanatory comments across the codebase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37c8c16a1cf884a6077a6dd59cea101baf492c8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natibs/mfe-platform/git/trees/37c8c16a1cf884a6077a6dd59cea101baf492c8a"},