e":"2026-08-23T08:34:18Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:21:38.308Z","repositoryId":1344888825,"sha":"0ba3edb03ec3eb9c8b0d25e3215c8f783b304ba6"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T15:22:36Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T15:22:36Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:21:38.308Z","repositoryId":1344888825,"sha":"584738aa84767861b38581c2f93655dbd4d8f139"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T15:14:24Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T15:14:24Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:21:38.308Z","repositoryId":1344888825,"sha":"367d4aa1c0db29cf8bb1be7405d816397c21a4d3"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T14:45:28Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T14:45:28Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:21:38.308Z","repositoryId":1344888825,"sha":"0fcf0cdc777212265d47e1377eee78ee5b014bc4"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T14:45:01Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T14:45:01Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"atapatel","providerType":"User"},"email":"ajaypatel@atyantik.com","name":"Ajay Patel"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:21:38.308Z","repositoryId":1344888825,"sha":"3548bc5376c52287e70d056d4ef783242f09d83f"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:21:38.308Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287664814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sesa767979","id":287664814,"login":"sesa767979","node_id":"U_kgDOESVqrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/894d5f76713e4f4b3cb8c6cb60622fbe2a9dc167/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:28:19Z","email":"SESA767979@se.com","name":"Tirth Bodawala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:28:19Z","email":"SESA767979@se.com","name":"Tirth Bodawala"},"message":"Record the constrained-profile dataset, and a finding only throttling could show\n\nThree runs of each stack under Slow 4G with a constrained processor, cores and\nheap. 368/368 checks every run, 251 metrics, 111 resolvable differences, every\nparameter captured in the dataset.\n\nThe finding: on `/cart` and `/product/p-0001`, Svelte ships 22% and 14% FEWER\nbytes and paints 12% LATER. On localhost those routes reported identical paint\ntimes, so this was invisible until the connection was throttled.\n\nThree candidates checked, two eliminated. Svelte''s anchor comments do inflate the\nHTML, but by 140-270 bytes gzipped — a millisecond here. Stylesheets are\nidentical in count and bytes. What differs is the eagerly preloaded set: React\npreloads one 3.7 kB chunk on /cart, Svelte preloads two totalling 28.0 kB,\nbecause its client runtime is bundled into the island chunk rather than shared\nfrom the host. Those are modulepreload — eager and high priority, competing with\nthe stylesheets and markup that first paint waits for.\n\nThe arithmetic closes: 24.3 kB of extra critical-path transfer at 205 kB/s is\n118 ms, against an observed 108 ms of additional paint delay.\n\nThat is the unshareable Svelte runtime in its third form. It has now cost bytes\nper remote on the account page, correctness at the component boundary, and now\nlatency — by moving weight out of the part of the page that can wait and into the\npart that cannot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LtjvJvVNhKG5N1T121daxV","tree":{"sha":"8bc8019b1e40d8029c444105207075b2868c40bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/git/trees/8bc8019b1e40d8029c444105207075b2868c40bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/git/commits/894d5f76713e4f4b3cb8c6cb60622fbe2a9dc167","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287664814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sesa767979","id":287664814,"login":"sesa767979","node_id":"U_kgDOESVqrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commit/894d5f76713e4f4b3cb8c6cb60622fbe2a9dc167","node_id":"C_kwDOUClf-doAKDg5NGQ1Zjc2NzEzZTRmNGIzY2I4YzZjYjYwNjIyZmJlMmE5ZGMxNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commit/61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e","sha":"61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e"}],"sha":"894d5f76713e4f4b3cb8c6cb60622fbe2a9dc167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/894d5f76713e4f4b3cb8c6cb60622fbe2a9dc167"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287664814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sesa767979","id":287664814,"login":"sesa767979","node_id":"U_kgDOESVqrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:12:38Z","email":"SESA767979@se.com","name":"Tirth Bodawala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:12:38Z","email":"SESA767979@se.com","name":"Tirth Bodawala"},"message":"README: describe the research output and the profile rule\n\nThe results section documented single archived runs but not the aggregated\nresearch dataset, its three renderings, or the rule that runs from different\nmeasurement profiles are never averaged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LtjvJvVNhKG5N1T121daxV","tree":{"sha":"5f0a87054b52129a570d87033627abb332e8b40a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/git/trees/5f0a87054b52129a570d87033627abb332e8b40a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/git/commits/61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287664814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sesa767979","id":287664814,"login":"sesa767979","node_id":"U_kgDOESVqrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commit/61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e","node_id":"C_kwDOUClf-doAKDYxYWMzZDE2MjI3MWMwMmNlNmY4ZWE3NmE5YzQ2NzQ4MWFhNThmMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commit/c45b75fb0667170cf116b68231186b5df975d9be","sha":"c45b75fb0667170cf116b68231186b5df975d9be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/c45b75fb0667170cf116b68231186b5df975d9be"}],"sha":"61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/61ac3d162271c02ce6f8ea76a9c467481aa58f2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287664814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sesa767979","id":287664814,"login":"sesa767979","node_id":"U_kgDOESVqrg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sesa767979","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/commits/c45b75fb0667170cf116b68231186b5df975d9be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:12:06Z","email":"SESA767979@se.com","name":"Tirth Bodawala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T11:12:06Z","email":"SESA767979@se.com","name":"Tirth Bodawala"},"message":"A third rendering of the report, for readers without the vocabulary\n\nSame dataset, same statistics, no simplified numbers — the difference is entirely\nin what is said around them. Every metric gets a plain title (\"How long until the\nbiggest thing appears\"), a sentence on what it is, a sentence on why anyone\nshould care in terms of what a visitor experiences, what a good value looks like,\nand its own chart.\n\nThe measurement conditions get the same treatment. \"4x CPU throttling\" becomes\n\"we made the browser four times slower than this machine, because the computer\nrunning these tests is far faster than the phone most visitors use\" — with the\nactual configured value printed beside it.\n\nCharts are grouped by the question a reader actually has rather than by metric\nfamily: how long people wait, how annoying the page is, what it costs to\ndownload, how hard the device has to work, are we comparing the same website,\nwhat it costs to run the servers, what it costs the people building it. Routes\nare named rather than pathed — \"Shopping basket\", not `/cart`.\n\nOne rule kept from the technical report: the spread is never dropped. A reader\nwho cannot define a coefficient of variation still needs to know which numbers to\ntrust, so the stability class is translated rather than removed — and it names\nthe specific rows that wobbled, because taking the worst class across a chart and\nstating it flatly made five solid rows read as unreliable on account of one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LtjvJvVNhKG5N1T121daxV","tree":{"sha":"59219a543313e9114321cf14454dac078ab37038","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/git/trees/59219a543313e9114321cf14454dac078ab37038"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Atyantik/mfe-benchmarking/git/commits/c45b75fb0667170cf116b68231186b5df975d9be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"c