47500627a4151/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:59:12Z","email":"salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com","name":"Salvador Duenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T18:59:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: KYC-110 Playwright Chromium smokes for Angular, React, and Vue (#119)\n\n* feat: KYC-110 Playwright Chromium smokes for Angular, React, and Vue\n\nCatch browser-level regressions (validation, JWT, GraphQL/REST) in CI without folding e2e into unit test:ci.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: do not 429 named Login/RegisterTenant GraphQL operations\n\nThe auth-op classifier counted mutation Login(...) { login(...) } as two login fields, so all three UI e2e smokes failed on the first sign-in.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: keep e2e diagnosable and stop classifier string false 429s\n\nFailed Playwright jobs now keep traces and the API log. Vue counts assert seed volume, and GraphQL string defaults no longer look like a second login field.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: Vue reports counts e2e without listitem role\n\nChromium drops listitem when list-style is none, so the seed-count assertion never found Draft. Read the label’s sibling value instead and keep list semantics with role=list.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"790201e664b6b0ffccd526531a802ca24784a3af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/790201e664b6b0ffccd526531a802ca24784a3af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/c18cd0fa800367121fce886e11147500627a4151","verification":{"payload":"tree 790201e664b6b0ffccd526531a802ca24784a3af\nparent ff40b8ced88592aff29156a72e5eb1e72f435bac\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1788375552 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788375552 +0200\n\nfeat: KYC-110 Playwright Chromium smokes for Angular, React, and Vue (#119)\n\n* feat: KYC-110 Playwright Chromium smokes for Angular, React, and Vue\n\nCatch browser-level regressions (validation, JWT, GraphQL/REST) in CI without folding e2e into unit test:ci.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: do not 429 named Login/RegisterTenant GraphQL operations\n\nThe auth-op classifier counted mutation Login(...) { login(...) } as two login fields, so all three UI e2e smokes failed on the first sign-in.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: keep e2e diagnosable and stop classifier string false 429s\n\nFailed Playwright jobs now keep traces and the API log. Vue counts assert seed volume, and GraphQL string defaults no longer look like a second login field.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: Vue reports counts e2e without listitem role\n\nChromium drops listitem when list-style is none, so the seed-count assertion never found Draft. Read the label’s sibling value instead and keep list semantics with role=list.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmHIACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfdMQAExJZcPz8NWIwffdGqBY5Ixp\npibJsApiXbcvMLOLNJ/DE0Nx/de1KkuX7Ew+VAtB7pLNXqOUo3QM6EtliHsxID7U\ni9xbtTDtRIw8bEImJA5/6dRXQkYdxupZYqZDbIla7gbzgTLGCBUvwlTiP92cmLgL\nQ/Snzt/KM/3hOWct+ZY1TPL1462K95aVbdUuDkC0eLj2bWJezgdv43HUebOWCloa\n0YiOyiCn4uykywu+Yg2IXqPoCC+qWj1wUI2MvZwbhbIJ1DCxD5t8FpWLqOOwb0/w\nVW21gVyqagX12sWXjoGdpWlaPQDhpi+jybiJCuSs3cBEq7yyAY9aHmWXcGAHJOh0\nC/fv3GYjP5b5qEHaJV3+VP4umLFP9xe1ScIqc0z3hEjleg3y00fJfnjt7RIGHTG+\nd04RVjJrKW2G9ZpCT7DrJCvPuZ0Ld06h5UtoJRsL6rPrGMJ73NUt9N7CAZNkZbB3\nxI2jBz/8Li+3QGeXCba5jmxWeC3