y}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SDS37","id":5322884,"login":"SDS37","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjI4ODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SDS37","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/commits/ff40b8ced88592aff29156a72e5eb1e72f435bac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:34:27Z","email":"salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com","name":"Salvador Duenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T15:34:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: KYC-095 freeze submitted KYC, count GraphQL auth ops, and harden the three apps (#118)\n\n* feat: KYC-095 freeze submitted KYC, count GraphQL auth ops, and harden the three apps\n\nClose the post-094 review punch-list: atomic draft/upload, aliased login cannot multiply the limiter, and the UIs match session, a11y, and production-URL checks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(react): drop unused spec imports that fail tsc -b\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): make draft-update persist recheck deterministic\n\nThe concurrent HTTP race was order-dependent: an update that still saw Draft could change the title before submit. Flip status during payload validation so ExecuteUpdate where Draft is proven without two in-flight SQLite writers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: fail closed on truncated GraphQL peeks and restore skip-target focus in forced-colors\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): close GraphQL comment and mixed-op bypasses; do not SET omitted FormData\n\nStrip # comments before auth-field counts, 429 mixed login+register in one HTTP request, and omit FormData from title-only ExecuteUpdate so a concurrent form save is not overwritten. Raise the classifier peek cap above max FormData so a valid 64KiB update is not fail-closed to 429.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(react): ignore draft save/create results after unmount\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): drop unused interpolation in batch login 429 test\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): use System.Threading.Lock for in-process lockout gating\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e22f72be34ccb6a67dfb93df10e2a9d6205115cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/e22f72be34ccb6a67dfb93df10e2a9d6205115cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/ff40b8ced88592aff29156a72e5eb1e72f435bac","verification":{"payload":"tree e22f72be34ccb6a67dfb93df10e2a9d6205115cd\nparent 29afcb14887db4b7bd3114ebba1d19ae461e7c54\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1788363267 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788363267 +0200\n\nfeat: KYC-095 freeze submitted KYC, count GraphQL auth ops, and harden the three apps (#118)\n\n* feat: KYC-095 freeze submitted KYC, count GraphQL auth ops, and harden the three apps\n\nClose the post-094 review punch-list: atomic draft/upload, aliased login cannot multiply the limiter, and the UIs match session, a11y, and production-URL checks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(react): drop unused spec imports that fail tsc -b\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): make draft-update persist recheck deterministic\n\nThe concurrent HTTP race was order-dependent: an update that still saw Draft could change the title before submit. Flip status during payload validation so ExecuteUpdate where Draft is proven without two in-flight SQLite writers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: fail closed on truncated GraphQL peeks and restore skip-target focus in forced-colors\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): close GraphQL comment and mixed-op bypasses; do not SET omitted FormData\n\nStrip # comments before auth-field counts, 429 mixed login+register in one HTTP request, and omit FormData from title-only ExecuteUpdate so a concurrent form save is not overwritten. Raise the classifier peek cap above max FormData so a valid 64KiB update is not fail-closed to 429.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(react): ignore draft save/create results after unmount\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): drop unused interpolation in batch login 429 test\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): use System.Threading.Lock for in-process lockout gating\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmEIDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWRIQAJAlO6+HKZ4C7AQS7GG4yKYM\ns/ViRj9oea70uZIhmAOlYa72uMTjsQwvZYkSmODjF8+0mEEFj7yxeSxV14ZVVs13\n4TEldIadT+X1la6hDLGinoidQj0Nw9MECx98fyRokXpBqw1cK/gKeKJHluWGGlWL\nlF8hCGbNLBxexohRCYxcZllx4EEhXiEluAXjpjS5xAFV590E98VN0z9eX804iCM7\nWnAXaiTaJwH0HtPsgNG7dhsfPTazkpvWWsV+XjjDDyBnGtFInrDmIWpykznuotig\n1poxMN0LMzEK7UR3wBtd5ArRTMlsMIb1x7cL8Hm5qXoXksNYjEgyYgp/+zuFx2ev\nkIQB4yt