n, and show rate-limit copy on authenticated GraphQL 429s. Mark KYC-094 done in the roadmap.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"edffe2b88bd73a220bb586ecb02cd6b2a6f5d0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/edffe2b88bd73a220bb586ecb02cd6b2a6f5d0a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/517cb6527820f7fc7dd5c6a5232e463a1d7d8c34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/commit/517cb6527820f7fc7dd5c6a5232e463a1d7d8c34","node_id":"C_kwDOUCmPmdoAKDUxN2NiNjUyNzgyMGY3ZmM3ZGQ1YzZhNTIzMmU0NjNhMWQ3ZDhjMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/commit/6b58fccc1d799cbe4c22932db38d9ba3b4ac771f","sha":"6b58fccc1d799cbe4c22932db38d9ba3b4ac771f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/commits/6b58fccc1d799cbe4c22932db38d9ba3b4ac771f"}],"sha":"517cb6527820f7fc7dd5c6a5232e463a1d7d8c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/commits/517cb6527820f7fc7dd5c6a5232e463a1d7d8c34"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/commits/6b58fccc1d799cbe4c22932db38d9ba3b4ac771f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:20:10Z","email":"sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local","name":"Salvador Dueñas Solis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:20:10Z","email":"sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local","name":"Salvador Dueñas Solis"},"message":"fix(angular): require captcha flags on AppConfig\n\nMatch React/Vue: captchaRequiredForLogin and turnstileSiteKey are always present. Off is false / empty string, not missing fields.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"eff34bb98909147b79321e25f6369851f2c99f59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/eff34bb98909147b7932