lis@yahoo.com","name":"Salvador Duenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T11:15:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: KYC-094 login rate limits and optional captcha in the three apps (#112)\n\n* feat: KYC-094 login rate limits and optional captcha across the three apps\n\nMap HTTP 429 to a dedicated catalog message without clearing the session, and send captchaToken only when the login form collected one.\nCloses #111.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: bind Angular captcha as a form control and stop Turnstile loader hangs\n\nReject leftover Turnstile scripts instead of waiting on load events that already fired. Login captcha is a ControlValueAccessor so whitespace tokens cannot submit and reset clears the field.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: ignore late Turnstile callbacks and freeze the widget while signing in\n\nClear the React/Vue submit lock on success so a failed redirect can retry, and ignore iframe tokens after unmount or while the control is disabled.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: drop unused GraphQL HTTP 429 string fallbacks\n\nGraphqlHttpError already maps status 429, so the message-regex branches in React and Vue were unreachable.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"139a31a93ea2401435cef934565c821cbb10fe1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/139a31a93ea2401435cef934565c821cbb10fe1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/f7040e1d074834d06b3e81d5231075de2a2ce416","verification":{"payload":"tree 139a31a93ea2401435cef934565c821cbb10fe1d\nparent e596d98730c42143669ada8144c07bbd49085cb7\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1788347744 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788347744 +0200\n\nfeat: KYC-094 login rate limits and optional captcha in the three apps (#112)\n\n* feat: KYC-094 login rate limits and optional captcha across the three apps\n\nMap HTTP 429 to a dedicated catalog message without clearing the session, and send captchaToken only when the login form collected one.\nCloses #111.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: bind Angular captcha as a form control and stop Turnstile loader hangs\n\nReject leftover Turnstile scripts instead of waiting on load events that already fired. Login captcha is a ControlValueAccessor so whitespace tokens cannot submit and reset clears the field.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: ignore late Turnstile callbacks and freeze the widget while signing in\n\nClear the React/Vue submit lock on success so a failed redirect can retry, and ignore iframe tokens after unmount or while the control is disabled.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix: drop unused GraphQL HTTP 429 string fallbacks\n\nGraphqlHttpError already maps status 429, so the message-regex branches in React and Vue were unreachable.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmAVgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKwUQAExqs/80+uBODy77nTiQocYQ\noUKeAli5b7LCjz3SJ1eN8hlJyDAG7gP+IT+ghg09BuvITNo3bCa4b6N3s8qGOMC3\n34mVZeVXne7VYpD53a2P19fGm4+ArOjFI3mHQ4V2WlvDxjChC+Aw3gEP5ukQ7huH\n7NoKoBYFeMlmarTBO/FZ71SjrYUa86KfsDT28YmYrBP+6Unv3rUvTclymCaz8L/S\n2k6nGR/Y9XT0o8SvzOAChdNQyqRc2DEh8d1XZJT8FDnFuzHIgEyuK/XVyMr86gqv\nQwRnbS42N5rh6Pb101R6zgO9N9N9pkKvlBmcB7OElcH664PjBtq73E3lZk4mp7ce\n3WvAtGJnB/mZ9YwqauuEEtYDnCyr4tOuHoiuFYyMLWbvtzOLDStonvHGpFPhzQnr\nI2tr9xmfJyTor+XH3WTlHablIg5ryiC/tLpDKoCsxYVSIopF25NkmHBQPgwo/NQp\n+ICjajV0YQjrVjJXk91BLuRzVSY9I5SE80