ronously\n\nStream is IAsyncDisposable; await using clears RCS1261 in the peek tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1ee90869f293d0500dfced8b86539ae56fcc8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/b1ee90869f293d0500dfced8b86539ae56fcc8d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/e596d98730c42143669ada8144c07bbd49085cb7","verification":{"payload":"tree b1ee90869f293d0500dfced8b86539ae56fcc8d4\nparent 571b96502f1c8f820352e7e94bd18e666e096200\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1788338800 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788338800 +0200\n\nfeat(api): KYC-093 layered public-auth abuse controls (#110)\n\n* feat(api): KYC-093 layered public-auth abuse controls\n\nPut GraphQL login/register on env-specific IP buckets and add lockout, captcha, and invite-only register without leaking account existence.\n\nCloses #54\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): fail closed on truncated GraphQL peeks and re-check invite expiry\n\nKeep padded login/register on the strict bucket and reject expired invites at redeem time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): take the stricter GraphQL auth bucket and fail closed on captcha JSON errors\n\nA login operationName must not hide registerTenant, and a non-JSON Turnstile body must stay VALIDATION instead of HTTP 500.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): dispose classifier test streams asynchronously\n\nStream is IAsyncDisposable; await using clears RCS1261 in the peek tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":