mitter":{"date":"2026-08-31T09:35:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(angular): KYC-065 review Signal Form, rxResource, panes (#97)\n\n* feat(angular): KYC-065 review Signal Form, rxResource, and panes\n\nAlign case review with Angular Architects structure: load detail via\nrxResource, reject via Signal Forms, and extract presentational panes\nwhile keeping mutations and download on the smart CaseReview.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): reset reject Signal Form state after actions\n\nUse FieldState.reset so touched/dirty clear with the comment value after a successful start/approve/reject.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): repair review reject submit and error-state UX\n\nAdd novalidate so Signal Form required does not block Reject, and guard\nrxResource.value() with hasValue() so missing cases show an error instead\nof spinning forever.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): annotate CaseReview resource, form, and field types\n\nMake caseResource, rejectForm, computeds, and pane message catalogs\nexplicit so Hard TypeScript inference cannot silently widen.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): annotate remaining message-catalog copy fields\n\nGive case-list, login, and shell explicit typeof annotations on copy\nfields to match Hard TypeScript and the review panes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"92261925cf7fdd43350cffd62d401a2d803890bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/92261925cf7fdd43350cffd62d401a2d803890bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/3e06c7850eee630e96e954dcd856409e99ab63e2","verification":{"payload":"tree 92261925cf7fdd43350cffd62d401a2d803890bf\nparent 8a2ea6a9aa652ba14c61972f6787f718534767e6\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1788168941 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788168941 +0200\n\nfeat(angular): KYC-065 review Signal Form, rxResource, panes (#97)\n\n* feat(angular): KYC-065 review Signal Form, rxResource, and panes\n\nAlign case review with Angular Architects structure: load detail via\nrxResource, reject via Signal Forms, and extract presentational panes\nwhile keeping mutations and download on the smart CaseReview.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): reset reject Signal Form state after actions\n\nUse FieldState.reset so touched/dirty clear with the comment value after a successful start/approve/reject.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): repair review reject submit and error-state UX\n\nAdd novalidate so Signal Form required does not block Reject, and guard\nrxResource.value() with hasValue() so missing cases show an error instead\nof spinning forever.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): annotate CaseReview resource, form, and field types\n\nMake caseResource, rejectForm, computeds, and pane message catalogs\nexplicit so Hard TypeScript inference cannot silently widen.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(angular): annotate remaining message-catalog copy fields\n\nGive case-list, login, and shell explicit typeof annotations on copy\nfields to match Hard TypeScript and the review panes.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlUrtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEcMQAGoLyCvPIqzWw4h+n+Qec2UM\nT14YB2RRF3ZsruUWUUBwWxP5U3vW9NOl9/mfZSn4Ja5+WYHtEvRnZbLVxBBzTsCy\nGYET/NDx2aRNxzsIaI6xzCNM4T+sJH1h3El7SmtTcg+m5rk9dzNpS