larify blank Provider → InMemory.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: align README.STUDY tours with KYC-040 documents and MinIO\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(test): skip refs assembly copy to avoid MSB3026 on Desktop\n\nPreserveCompilationReferences=false keeps Mvc.Testing deps context\nwithout copying ~300 refs/*.dll that race with fileproviderd/LSP locks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a597859273a726ace1c9b4893630031da344d9e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/a597859273a726ace1c9b4893630031da344d9e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/d05732efb110ac9c498cae522cc03338b5f5d2d1","verification":{"payload":"tree a597859273a726ace1c9b4893630031da344d9e2\nparent ebc4a44556b7b9dc53f47e3ccafc974f99c597d3\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1788015521 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788015521 +0200\n\nfeat(api): KYC-040 Upload document (#82)\n\n* feat(api): KYC-040 customer document upload to object storage\n\nAdd REST multipart upload for draft/submitted cases with PDF/PNG/JPG\nvalidation, MinIO/InMemory storage, Document metadata, and case detail wiring.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): address Copilot review on KYC-040 upload\n\nRequire the multipart file field, align VALIDATION/size limits, order\ndocuments by UploadedAt, and clarify blank Provider → InMemory.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: align README.STUDY tours with KYC-040 documents and MinIO\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(test): skip refs assembly copy to avoid MSB3026 on Desktop\n\nPreserveCompilationReferences=false keeps Mvc.Testing deps context\nwithout copying ~300 refs/*