r":{"date":"2026-08-27T10:34:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): KYC-014 tenant isolation enforcement (#52)\n\n* feat(api): enforce tenant isolation via JWT and EF filters\n\nResolve tenant_id from the JWT into ICurrentTenant and apply global query filters on ITenantScoped entities (User now; Case in KYC-030). Add integration tests proving tenant A cannot read tenant B data.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): make tenant query filters fail closed\n\nWithout a JWT tenant_id, ITenantScoped queries return no rows. Cross-tenant lookups (login) must opt in with IgnoreQueryFilters, matching ADR-007.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7ce0d78c9b50ee39a6eb79c73964b2aa073650e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/a7ce0d78c9b50ee39a6eb79c73964b2aa073650e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/fbee5c7d14c8deb5bd91964db5cbf90be91ca995","verification":{"payload":"tree a7ce0d78c9b50ee39a6eb79c73964b2aa073650e\nparent d14fac9281add24734a2a3414d0ffd2fe56f0818\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1787826854 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787826854 +0200\n\nfeat(api): KYC-014 tenant isolation enforcement (#52)\n\n* feat(api): enforce tenant isolation via JWT and EF filters\n\nResolve tenant_id from the JWT into ICurrentTenant and apply global query filters on ITenantScoped entities (User now; Case in KYC-030). Add integration tests proving tenant A cannot read tenant B data.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): make tenant query filters fail closed\n\nWithout a JWT tenant_id, ITenantScoped queries return no rows. Cross-tenant lookups (login) must opt in with IgnoreQueryFilters, matching ADR-007.\n\nCo-autho