in endpoint that issues short-lived JWTs\n\nPublic POST /api/login authenticates by tenant slug, email, and password, returning a JWT with sub, tenant_id, role, and email. Inactive tenants and bad credentials share a generic 401 (KYC-013).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): keep JWT claim names unmapped for ADR-007\n\nDisable inbound claim mapping and set NameClaimType/RoleClaimType so sub and role stay as issued for upcoming tenant isolation (KYC-014).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b00e04085e15cc12d4d6aadf27c813170cd48516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/trees/b00e04085e15cc12d4d6aadf27c813170cd48516"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SDS37/kyc-multi-frontend/git/commits/d14fac9281add24734a2a3414d0ffd2fe56f0818","verification":{"payload":"tree b00e04085e15cc12d4d6aadf27c813170cd48516\nparent 2ef17328e45d648a20b2663e7e7311229780c25a\nauthor Salvador Duenas <salvador_duenas_solis@yahoo.com> 1787825743 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787825743 +0200\n\nfeat(api): KYC-013 login with JWT (#51)\n\n* feat(api): add login endpoint that issues short-lived JWTs\n\nPublic POST /api/login authenticates by tenant slug, email, and password, returning a JWT with sub, tenant_id, role, and email. Inactive tenants and bad credentials share a generic 401 (KYC-013).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* fix(api): keep JWT claim names unmapped for ADR-007\n\nDisable inbound claim mapping and set NameClaimType/RoleClaimType so sub and role stay as issued for upcoming tenant isolation (KYC-014).\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Salvador Dueñas Solis <sal@MacBook-Air-som-tillhor-Salvador.local>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid",